rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Duration: Fall Semester 2026 (August 1st - January 31st)<\/span><\/p><\/li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Part-time position (maximum 320 hours for the total duration of the contract)<\/span><\/p><\/li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">15 EUR hourly rate (gross)<\/span><br><br><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Application<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">If you are interested in this role, please upload your CV.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">In a cover letter, please describe briefly your motivation and why you\u2019re a good fit for a teaching position. (Please don\u2019t use an LLM to generate the cover letter.)<\/span><\/p><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/code\/student-teacher-intro-to-software-engineering-and-web-berlin-295592","tags":[],"job_types":["Student","Working student","Part time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1785614952},{"slug":"account-executive-central-europe-dach-munich-474378","company_name":"Bazaarvoice","title":"Account Executive \u2013 Central Europe (DACH)","description":"<br><strong>Who we want:<\/strong><br>\n<li>The ideal candidate will be someone with a strong record of achievement in a new business sales position within SaaS &amp;\/or\/other online based technologies.<\/li>\n<li>Having a background selling into multiple Executive\/C-Level stakeholders is a must.<\/li>\n<li>Experience navigating through an organisation to sell a multi-solution offering, with the ability to drive urgency and be assertive in every step of your process<\/li>\n<li>Ability to navigate ambiguous circumstances both internally and externally<\/li>\n<li>Ability to juggle multiple competing priorities and consistently meet deadlines and objectives<\/li>\n<li>Proven tenacity and success with prospecting your own accounts and setting your own meetings.<\/li>\n<li>Comfort in developing a technical understanding of how our products work, to enable stronger sales cycles.<\/li>\n<br><strong>Key responsibilities:<\/strong><br>\n<li>Building and maintaining a pipeline of new prospect accounts.<\/li>\n<li>Uncovering and understanding a client\u2019s needs through in-depth discovery and positioning Bazaarvoice\u2019s value according to those specific needs<\/li>\n<li>Demonstrating the value propositions of our products and services by positioning a high-ROI solution.<\/li>\n<li>Confidently lead a sales cycle and collaborate internally with various teams to close business (pre-sales, marketing, product specialists etc.).<\/li>\n<li>Ability to manage and grow the territory with accurate and realistic forecasting.<\/li>\n<br><strong>Requirements:<\/strong><br>\n<li>3+ years new business sales experience in eCommerce, digital or SaaS.<\/li>\n<li>Follows a proven sales methodology. We use BANT which we\u2019ll give you full training on, but we expect knowledge and experience of a recognised sales methodology.<\/li>\n<li>Proven track-record of overachieving quota, and clear demonstrable experience of building champions in new accounts to draft mutual close plans with the client.<\/li>\n<li>Strong work ethic: self-motivated with an ability to learn quickly and hold yourself accountable to hitting quota<\/li>\n<li>Clear and concise communication skills, as well as effectively listen with both clients and internal business partners<\/li>\n<li>Fluent written and oral in German and English<\/li>\n<br><strong>Experience nice to have:<\/strong><br>\n<li>Additional language skills.<\/li>\n<li>Experience using SalesForce, Powerpoint &amp;\/or Excel<\/li>\n<li>Full authorization to work in the EU without any restrictions, sponsorship will not be provided<\/li>\n<p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/bazaarvoice\/account-executive-central-europe-dach-munich-474378","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full-time"],"location":"Munich","created_at":1785614690},{"slug":"senior-technical-success-manager-36843","company_name":"zscaler","title":"Senior Technical Success Manager","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;About &lt;strong&gt;Zscaler&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zscaler accelerates digital transformation to ensure our customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. As an &lt;strong&gt;AI-forward enterprise&lt;\/strong&gt;, we are constantly pushing the envelope, leveraging the world\u2019s largest security data lake to power our cloud-native Zero Trust Exchange platform. This innovation protects our customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here, &lt;strong&gt;impact in your role matters more than title&lt;\/strong&gt; and trust is built on results. We say, impact over activity. We seek innovators who actively use AI to amplify their impact and who thrive in an environment where we leverage intelligent systems to stay ahead of evolving threats. We believe in transparency and value &lt;strong&gt;constructive, honest debate&lt;\/strong&gt;\u2014we\u2019re focused on getting to the best ideas, faster. We build high-performing teams that can make an impact quickly and with high quality. To do this, we are building a culture of execution centered on &lt;strong&gt;customer obsession&lt;\/strong&gt;, collaboration, ownership, and accountability.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We value high-impact, high-accountability with a sense of urgency where you\u2019re enabled to do your best work and embrace your potential. If you\u2019re driven by purpose, thrive on solving complex challenges, and want to be part of the team that\u2019s helping to secure the AI age, we invite you to bring your talents to Zscaler and help shape the future of cybersecurity.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Sr. Technical Success Manager to join our team. This is a Germany-based role, reporting to the Manager of Technical Success Management in the Customer Success Organization department. You will guide customers through their Zero Trust journey as the central post-sales point of contact, helping customers adopt and maximize Zscaler&#39;s solutions to secure their digital transformation objectives. Your role centers on providing expert advice, building relationships, and ensuring successful solution adoption.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you\u2019ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture relationships with key customer stakeholders and operational service owners to define and prioritize the strategic alignment between customer objectives and Zscaler goals&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Offer technical guidance, product insights, and best practices to develop customized strategies for the integration and operationalization of Zscaler solutions&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Provide technical expertise and organizational leadership to manage complex escalations and coordinate resolutions with internal and external teams&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Work proactively to identify adoption insights, develop risk mitigation plans, and partner with Zscaler teams to ensure long-term customer success&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Participate in the creation and sharing of intellectual capital, including best practice guides and playbooks, to strengthen the Customer Success team\u2019s collective impact&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback\u2014knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We\u2019re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI\/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a customer-facing technical role (e.g., Solutions Delivery, Customer Success Management, Technical Account Management, or Sales Engineering) focused on Cloud Services Architectures, Web-based Security, Networking, or Infrastructure Solutions&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Strong technical acumen with the ability to align customer business challenges to the Zscaler portfolio for desired business and security outcomes&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to analyze customer data to gain key insights and develop tailored adoption strategies and risk mitigation plans&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Native\/bi-lingual German language proficiency&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-powered operational analytics or predictive health-scoring dashboards to proactively evaluate deployment health, uncover adoption blockages, and systematically mitigate customer risk&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Deep background in Cloud and Networking Security technologies such as SD-WAN, MPLS, SWG, DLP, VPNs, and CASB&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive understanding of industry-specific workflows and operational processes alongside relevant industry certifications (e.g., CISSP, CCNP, CCIE, Network+, AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-MM5&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Zscaler\u2019s salary ranges are benchmarked and determined by role and level. The range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire base salaries for this position across all Germany locations. Individual pay placement within this range is determined based on objective, gender-neutral criteria including job-related skills, relevant experience, and education or training. The base salary range listed for this full-time position excludes commission\/bonus\/equity (if applicable) and benefits. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;\u20ac73.500&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;\u20ac105.000 EUR&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https:\/\/www.zscaler.com\/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;\/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https:\/\/www.eeoc.gov\/sites\/default\/files\/2023-06\/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/zscaler\/senior-technical-success-manager-36843","tags":["Customer Success Dept"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1785606912},{"slug":"senior-sales-engineer-public-sector-germany-105541","company_name":"zscaler","title":"Senior Sales Engineer, Public Sector - Germany","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;About &lt;strong&gt;Zscaler&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zscaler accelerates digital transformation to ensure our customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. As an &lt;strong&gt;AI-forward enterprise&lt;\/strong&gt;, we are constantly pushing the envelope, leveraging the world\u2019s largest security data lake to power our cloud-native Zero Trust Exchange platform. This innovation protects our customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here, &lt;strong&gt;impact in your role matters more than title&lt;\/strong&gt; and trust is built on results. We say, impact over activity. We seek innovators who actively use AI to amplify their impact and who thrive in an environment where we leverage intelligent systems to stay ahead of evolving threats. We believe in transparency and value &lt;strong&gt;constructive, honest debate&lt;\/strong&gt;\u2014we\u2019re focused on getting to the best ideas, faster. We build high-performing teams that can make an impact quickly and with high quality. To do this, we are building a culture of execution centered on &lt;strong&gt;customer obsession&lt;\/strong&gt;, collaboration, ownership, and accountability.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We value high-impact, high-accountability with a sense of urgency where you\u2019re enabled to do your best work and embrace your potential. If you\u2019re driven by purpose, thrive on solving complex challenges, and want to be part of the team that\u2019s helping to secure the AI age, we invite you to bring your talents to Zscaler and help shape the future of cybersecurity.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Sales Engineer to join our team. This is a remote role, reporting to the Sales Engineering Manager in the Public Sector Sales Engineering department. As a trusted technical partner to the account team, you will co-own customer engagement strategies and design secure Network Security and Cloud solutions tailored specifically to the German Public Sector. Your mission is to drive technical wins by translating complex requirements into clear, measurable outcomes like risk reduction and compliance.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you\u2019ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Operate as a true \u201ctwo-in-a-box\u201d team with the Account Executive (AE) to jointly build and execute the account plan and customer engagement strategy, ensuring tight alignment from discovery through close&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact customer engagements by running discovery, workshops, demos, and architecture sessions to translate complex user needs into secure Network Security &amp;amp; Cloud solution designs&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulate measurable outcomes such as risk reduction, regulatory compliance, and operational efficiency to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Drive technical win plans and proof points, creating and executing the technical strategy for opportunities, defining success criteria, and coordinating internal resources to guide deals to clear decisions&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback\u2014knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We\u2019re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI\/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Senior Sales Engineering track record in the German Public Sector with a proven ability to support complex deals end-to-end and a solid understanding of public procurement and tender processes across Federal, State, or Municipal segments&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Deep technical expertise in Network Security and Cloud, including architecture-level understanding, relevant security controls, and seamless integration into customer environments&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Value- and outcome-oriented communication skills, with the ability to deliver executive-ready presentations in German and collaborate effectively internally in English&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;High learning agility to quickly master new security technologies combined with a collaborative, professional cross-functional presence&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Experience advising public sector clients on securing AI workloads or implementing AI-forward security operations that align with sovereign cloud frameworks&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Public-sector security and compliance expertise, with hands-on experience mapping solutions to German and EU compliance frameworks such as BSI IT-Grundschutz, C5, and KRITIS\/NIS2&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Presales excellence at scale, including demonstrated use of qualification or deal frameworks like Value Selling or MEDDICC alongside a track record of building repeatable technical assets&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;#LI-LS2 #LI-Remote&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Zscaler\u2019s salary ranges are benchmarked and determined by role and level. The range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire base salaries for this position across all Germany locations. Individual pay placement within this range is determined based on objective, gender-neutral criteria including job-related skills, relevant experience, and education or training. The base salary range listed for this full-time position excludes commission\/bonus\/equity (if applicable) and benefits. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;\u20ac86.625&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;\u20ac123.750 EUR&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https:\/\/www.zscaler.com\/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;\/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https:\/\/www.eeoc.gov\/sites\/default\/files\/2023-06\/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/zscaler\/senior-sales-engineer-public-sector-germany-105541","tags":["EMEA Field Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1785606912},{"slug":"account-executive-majors-171383","company_name":"zscaler","title":"Account Executive, Majors","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;About &lt;strong&gt;Zscaler&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zscaler accelerates digital transformation to ensure our customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. As an &lt;strong&gt;AI-forward enterprise&lt;\/strong&gt;, we are constantly pushing the envelope, leveraging the world\u2019s largest security data lake to power our cloud-native Zero Trust Exchange platform. This innovation protects our customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here, &lt;strong&gt;impact in your role matters more than title&lt;\/strong&gt; and trust is built on results. We say, impact over activity. We seek innovators who actively use AI to amplify their impact and who thrive in an environment where we leverage intelligent systems to stay ahead of evolving threats. We believe in transparency and value &lt;strong&gt;constructive, honest debate&lt;\/strong&gt;\u2014we\u2019re focused on getting to the best ideas, faster. We build high-performing teams that can make an impact quickly and with high quality. To do this, we are building a culture of execution centered on &lt;strong&gt;customer obsession&lt;\/strong&gt;, collaboration, ownership, and accountability.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We value high-impact, high-accountability with a sense of urgency where you\u2019re enabled to do your best work and embrace your potential. If you\u2019re driven by purpose, thrive on solving complex challenges, and want to be part of the team that\u2019s helping to secure the AI age, we invite you to bring your talents to Zscaler and help shape the future of cybersecurity.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Account Executive to join our team. This is a hybrid role based in Germany, reporting to the Regional Sales Director in the Sales and Go-to-Market department. The Sales and Go-to-Market team is a global group of professionals dedicated to delighting customers and driving a secure, cloud-enabled digital future. In this role, you will demonstrate the power and agility of cloud transformation to the world and cement Zscaler\u2019s position as a global leader.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you\u2019ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Manage an assigned territory in Germany focused on net new logo acquisition and upsell opportunities in the largest companies in region&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with key stakeholders, including C-Level decision-makers&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Create long-term account strategies aligned with customer goals&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to meet customer needs and contribute to account planning&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor by understanding client businesses and aligning Zscaler solutions with their goals&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback\u2014knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We\u2019re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI\/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-cycle sales experience within the software or security industry&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with current and prospective customers&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Progressive selling experience engaging with accounts and selling at the C-Level&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Business fluency in German&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-powered sales intelligence, predictive forecasting, or conversational AI platforms to optimize enterprise territory planning and pipeline acceleration&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the bigger picture, customer goals, and how technology facilitates business outcomes&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in strategic sales planning with a proven track record of closing net new logos&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;#LI-MM5 #LI-Hybrid&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Zscaler\u2019s salary ranges are benchmarked and determined by role and level. The range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire base salaries for this position across all Germany locations. Individual pay placement within this range is determined based on objective, gender-neutral criteria including job-related skills, relevant experience, and education or training. The base salary range listed for this full-time position excludes commission\/bonus\/equity (if applicable) and benefits. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;\u20ac103.250&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;\u20ac147.500 EUR&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https:\/\/www.zscaler.com\/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;\/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https:\/\/www.eeoc.gov\/sites\/default\/files\/2023-06\/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/zscaler\/account-executive-majors-171383","tags":["EMEA Field Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1785606911},{"slug":"product-manager-director-gpu-ai-services-hamburg-410467","company_name":"Impossible Cloud","title":"Product Manager \/ Director \u2013 GPU & AI Services","description":"<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">ABOUT US:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">Impossible Cloud is a fast-growing B2B cloud company headquartered in Hamburg, Germany. We have built a cloud object storage solution comparable to AWS S3, purpose-built and optimised for AI and compute workloads. Our commercial hyper-growth speaks for itself, powered by our channel-first go-to-market strategy.<\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">We are now expanding beyond storage: we are building a high-performance compute platform, offering an end-to-end solution from GPU infrastructure to full GPU platform software stack. In doing so, we are redefining the cloud ecosystem by bridging the gap between decentralised infrastructure (DePIN), mainstream B2B cloud use cases, and AI applications.<\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">Find out more about us <a href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/presentation\/d\/e\/2PACX-1vTFoSr7kaMSDnldKo8R0xyEWekNaCTO4eFKSCsC6nMyhMfdtKwd2DtCL0kvU6hvMsywLr_0eHtyQjIS\/pub?start=false&amp;loop=false&amp;delayms=5000&amp;slide=id.g3d6a3a5c4b8_0_0\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #515357; background-color: #f6f6f6;\"><strong><em>Please note that we can only consider candidates who have a valid, unrestricted work permit for the EU.<\/em><\/strong><\/span><\/p><div><br><\/div><h3>Your Impact<\/h3>\n<p>You will own the product and go-to-market strategy for our GPU and AI services, working directly with the founders to define what we build, how we price and package it, and which customer segments and use cases we go after first. Success in 12 months means a validated commercial model with thousands of AI B2B customers and a product roadmap with huge customer pull behind it.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div><br><strong>WHAT YOU WILL DO:<\/strong><br><div>\n\n<li>\n<p>Direct the end-to-end GPU and AI services strategy and roadmap, taking full commercial accountability.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Establish product-market fit by identifying high-advantage segments and use cases.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Design pricing, packaging, and GTM strategies alongside sales and channel partners.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Convert customer signals and research into clear, executable engineering backlogs.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Serve as the technical product lead for enterprise accounts, discussing GPUs, networking, and AI workloads.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Monitor competitors to ensure industry-leading positioning and features.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n\n<\/div><br><strong>WHAT YOU BRING:<\/strong><br><div>\n\n<li>\n<p>Proven success leading cloud infrastructure or AI product strategy and revenue growth.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Technical fluency in GPU architectures, AI\/ML workloads, and cluster networking.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Strong commercial instincts with experience in pricing and defining ICPs.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Evidence-based approach, prioritizing customer data over personal opinion.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Proficiency in using AI tools to optimize research and execution.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Fluent English; additional European languages preferred.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n\n<\/div><div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">WHAT WE OFFER:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Competitive salary coupled with direct engagement in your success through an enticing ESOP.<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Clear and transparent career progression scheme inspired by the best performing organisations incl. fast track promotion opportunity for exceptional performance to support your growth ambitions.<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Prime growth-stage company with proven revenue and a sharp edge in cloud \u2014 founded by serial entrepreneurs with multiple successful exits.<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Experienced, passionate team working with cutting-edge cloud technology.<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">A vibrant office in a trendy location with free brain food and a canteen \u2014 plus a subsidized premium gym membership and monthly team meet-ups that bring the whole crew together!<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">OUR CULTURE:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We are committed to success. We embrace individuals from all backgrounds who share the goal of building a future European cloud champion, celebrated through a richly diverse team of 15+ nationalities and 10+ languages spoken.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">OUR HIRING PROCESS:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Apply<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: Submit your CV or LinkedIn profile via the application form.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">First response<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: We review every application carefully and get back to you within a few days. If your profile is a strong match, we'll invite you to an intro call via Google Meet.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Get to know us<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: We move quickly through two to four interview steps, including a meeting with our founders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Offer<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: If it's a mutual fit, you'll receive a personal offer and feedback call, followed by a written offer document.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/impossible-cloud\/product-manager-director-gpu-ai-services-hamburg-410467","tags":["Product"],"job_types":["Full-time"],"location":"Hamburg","created_at":1785605201},{"slug":"senior-hr-business-partner-hamburg-387189","company_name":"Epay","title":"Senior HR Business Partner (m\/w\/d)","description":"<p>Als&nbsp;<strong>Senior HR Business Partner (m\/w\/d)<\/strong>&nbsp;bist du strategische*r und operative*r Sparringspartner*in f\u00fcr definierte Business Units: Du ber\u00e4tst F\u00fchrungskr\u00e4fte ganzheitlich in personalwirtschaftlichen und arbeitsrechtlichen Fragestellungen, gestaltest Ver\u00e4nderungsprozesse aktiv mit und entwickelst moderne HR\u2011Strukturen sowie \u2011Prozesse weiter. Dabei agierst du als Br\u00fcckenbauer*in zwischen Business und HR und tr\u00e4gst zur Weiterentwicklung einer zukunftsf\u00e4higen Unternehmenskultur bei. <\/p><p>Du bist Teil einer Organisation, die&nbsp;den Fokus auf die Kundschaft, Effizienz, Standardisierung und strategische HR\u2011Projekte&nbsp;vorantreibt \u2013 mit dem Ziel,&nbsp;Mitarbeiterbindung und \u2011zufriedenheit&nbsp;(m\/w\/d) zu st\u00e4rken und&nbsp;Business Impact&nbsp;zu erzielen.<\/p><p>Gemeinsam mit&nbsp;HR Service Partnering, Recruiting und L&amp;D&nbsp;hebst du Effizienzpotenziale, standardisierst und digitalisierst Workflows und baust eine&nbsp;datenbasierte Steuerung&nbsp;\u00fcber Kennzahlen und&nbsp;HR\u2011Reporting (HR Cockpit)&nbsp;aus. So verbindest du&nbsp;Business\u2011Ziele, Compliance und Employee Experience&nbsp;zu messbarem Impact \u2013 heute operativ wirksam, morgen strategisch skalierbar.<\/p><p><strong>Requirements<\/strong><\/p><p>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Dein Gestaltungsspielraum:<\/strong><\/p><p><\/p><ul><li><strong>Strategisches HR\u2011Business\u2011Partnering:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du ber\u00e4tst F\u00fchrungskr\u00e4fte in definierten Bereichen ganzheitlich zu personalwirtschaftlichen und arbeitsrechtlichen Fragestellungen \u2013 auf Augenh\u00f6he und mit Blick auf Business\u2011Ziele.<\/li><li><strong>Personalplanung &amp; -entwicklung:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du ber\u00e4tst zur strategischen Personalplanung und -entwicklung im Einklang mit der Unternehmensstrategie.<\/li><li><strong>Employee\u2011Lifecycle:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du begleitest den gesamten Lifecycle von Onboarding bis Offboarding und sorgst f\u00fcr eine starke Candidate\u2011 &amp; Employee\u2011Experience.<\/li><li><strong>Performance &amp; Workforce Planning:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du steuerst Performance\u2011Management-Prozesse inkl. Nachfolgeplanung.<\/li><li><strong>Analyse &amp; Ma\u00dfnahmen:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du analysierst relevante HR-Kennzahlen und leitest daraus zielgruppenspezifische Ma\u00dfnahmen ab.<\/li><li><strong>Change\u2011Prozesse:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du steuerst proaktiv Change-Prozesse, ber\u00e4tst zu Umorganisationen und unterst\u00fctzt bei Teamworkshops.<\/li><li><strong>HR\u2011Consulting &amp; Moderation:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du ber\u00e4tst und coachst F\u00fchrungskr\u00e4fte, moderierst Workshops und begleitest Ver\u00e4nderungsprozesse.<\/li><li><strong>HR\u2011Prozesse &amp; Projekte:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du standardisierst und digitalisierst HR\u2011Prozesse (z.\u202fB. Vorlagen, Workflows, JIRA\u2011Vorbereitung), stellst Compliance sicher (u.\u202fa. Nachweisgesetz, Entgelttransparenzgesetz) und entwickelst Reporting\u2011Logiken weiter.<\/li><li><strong>Kollaboration &amp; Service:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du arbeitest eng mit HR Service Partnering und Recruiting zusammen, etablierst klare SLAs\/Kommunikation und st\u00e4rkst so Service\u2011 und Umsetzungsqualit\u00e4t.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>\ud83d\udcab <strong>Dein Know-How:<\/strong><\/p><p><\/p><ul><li><strong>Fachliche Qualifikation:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du verf\u00fcgst \u00fcber ein abgeschlossenes Studium mit HR-Schwerpunkt oder eine vergleichbare Ausbildung.<\/li><li><strong>HR-Erfahrung:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du bringst mehrj\u00e4hrige Erfahrung (mind. 5 Jahre) als HR Business Partner im deutschsprachigen Raum mit, inklusive sehr guten Kenntnissen im deutschen Arbeits- und Sozialversicherungsrecht.<\/li><li><strong>Projekt- &amp; Ver\u00e4nderungskompetenz:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du \u00fcberzeugst mit Hands-on-Mentalit\u00e4t, hoher Eigeninitiative und Umsetzungsst\u00e4rke \u2013 und treibst Projekte sowie Ver\u00e4nderungen aktiv voran.<\/li><li><strong>Team &amp; Kommunikation:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du bist Teamplayer*in mit ausgepr\u00e4gter sozialer Kompetenz, diplomatischem Fingerspitzengef\u00fchl und souver\u00e4nem Auftreten.<\/li><li><strong>Matrix &amp; Wandel:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du bringst Erfahrung im Umgang mit komplexen Matrixstrukturen und transformativen Prozessen mit und gestaltest den kulturellen Wandel aktiv mit.<\/li><li><strong>Sprachkompetenz &amp; Pr\u00e4senz:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du kommunizierst sicher auf Deutsch und Englisch und bist bereit, regelm\u00e4\u00dfig (3\u20134 Tage\/Woche) im Office in Hamburg pr\u00e4sent zu sein.<\/li><li><strong>Zusammenarbeit &amp; Coaching:<\/strong>&nbsp;Du hast idealerweise Erfahrung in der Zusammenarbeit mit Arbeitnehmervertretungen und im Coaching von F\u00fchrungskr\u00e4ften.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>Unsere Werte <strong>One Team, Innovation &amp; Transformation, Ownership, Entrepreneurship und Empowerment<\/strong> spiegeln auch deine Haltung wider? Dann bist du bei uns genau richtig!<\/p><p><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Hybrides Arbeiten: <\/strong>Wir bieten ein Office, das interdisziplin\u00e4res sowie agiles Arbeiten f\u00f6rdert und R\u00fcckzugsorte, an denen du wieder neue Energie tanken kannst. Schaue dir&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/tours.nexpics.com\/cadooz-gmbh-hamburg\/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external\">hier<\/a> unser Office in einer 360\u00b0-Tour an. F\u00fcr eine ausgewogene Work-Life-Balance stehen dir zwei Tage\/Woche Home Office zu.<\/li><li><strong>Kultur:&nbsp;<\/strong>Wir legen viel Wert auf ein wertsch\u00e4tzendes Miteinander \u2013 alle cadoozies begegnen sich auf Augenh\u00f6he. Transparente und regelm\u00e4\u00dfige Kommunikation sowie eine aufgeschlossene Unternehmenskultur mit einem beispiellosen Teamzusammenhalt werden bei uns gro\u00dfgeschrieben! Dresscode? Kennen wir nicht! Mehr dazu auf unserem <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/cadooz_gmbh\/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external\">Instagram-Profil<\/a>.<\/li><li><strong>Pers\u00f6nliche Entwicklung:&nbsp;<\/strong>Durch regelm\u00e4\u00dfige Mitarbeitergespr\u00e4che &amp; individuelle Personalentwicklungsma\u00dfnahmen f\u00f6rdern wir deine pers\u00f6nliche sowie berufliche Entwicklung. Unsere europaweite Academy bietet ein sehr gro\u00dfes Weiterbildungsangebot an \u2013 da ist f\u00fcr jeden etwas dabei.<\/li><li><strong>Benefits ab dem ersten Tag: <\/strong>Du hast Zugriff auf unsere Corporate Benefits-Plattform, wir bezuschussen dein DeutschlandTicket sowie deine EGYM WellPass-Mitgliedschaft und du kannst deinen Hund mit ins B\u00fcro bringen.<\/li><li><strong>Benefits nach der Probezeit:&nbsp;<\/strong>Neben zahlreichen Mitarbeiterrabatten erh\u00e4ltst du Zugang zum Employee Benefit Club, der dir einen monatlichen Shopping-Gutschein im Wert von 50 \u20ac bietet. Au\u00dferdem kannst du ein Fahrrad \u00fcber die Firma leasen. Eine \u00dcbersicht der Benefits findest du auf unserer Karriereseite <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cadooz.com\/karriere\/unsere-benefits\/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external\">hier<\/a>.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>cadooz<\/h3><p>Benefits &amp; Incentives seit \u00fcber 20 Jahren: wir entwickeln hochwertige, spannende Produktl\u00f6sungen f\u00fcr Gesch\u00e4ftskunden \u2013 von DAX-Unternehmen bis Kleinstbetrieb.<\/p><p>Mit \u00fcber 170 Mitarbeitenden in Hamburg und M\u00fcnchen bieten wir Bonus- &amp; Treueprogramme, Vorteilswelten, Gutscheine &amp; Sachpr\u00e4mien f\u00fcr Neukundengewinnung, Kundenbindung, Mitarbeitermotivation uvm. an.<\/p><p>cadooz ist Teil von Euronet Worldwide und epay, den Experten f\u00fcr digitale &amp; physische Prepaid-Produkte weltweit.<\/p><p><strong>We are the leading and most trusted voucher and benefits provider in the DACH region!<\/strong><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/epay\/senior-hr-business-partner-hamburg-387189","tags":["Human Resources","Information Technology and Services","cadooz"],"job_types":["Full time","mid-senior"],"location":"Hamburg, Germany","created_at":1785604837},{"slug":"mitarbeiter-qualitatssicherung-hamburg-173838","company_name":"Luis Technology","title":"Mitarbeiter Qualit\u00e4tssicherung (m\/w\/d)","description":"<br><strong>Das erwartet Dich bei uns:<\/strong><p><ul><li>Du hilfst mit, Menschenleben zu retten<\/li><li>Du arbeitest im Herzen von Hamburg<\/li><li>Wir bieten Dir eine angenehme Arbeitsatmosph\u00e4re mit viel Raum f\u00fcr Eigeninitiative<\/li><li>Wir haben flache Hierarchien und helfen uns gegenseitig<\/li><li>Wir bieten Dir eine ausf\u00fchrliche und intensive Einarbeitung<\/li><li>Wir f\u00f6rdern Dich \u2013 auch im Rahmen unserer betrieblichen Altersversorgung<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>Dein Verantwortungsbereich:<\/strong><p>Im Qualit\u00e4tsmanagement verantworten wir die Weiterentwicklung unseres nach DIN EN ISO 9001:2015 zertifizierten Qualit\u00e4tsmanagementsystems und unseres nach DIN EN ISO 14001:2015 zertifizierten Umweltmanagementsystems. Wir setzen nationale und internationale gesetzliche Bestimmungen, Normen, Richtlinien und Standards um und k\u00fcmmern uns um die Einhaltung der Qualit\u00e4tsstandards unserer produzierten Bauteile.<br>\u00a0\u00a0<br>\u00a0Zu deinen Verantwortungsbereichen geh\u00f6rt u.a.:<br><ul><li>Pr\u00fcfung unterschiedlicher Produkte nach vorgegebener Pr\u00fcfanweisung aus interner und externer Fertigung und anschlie\u00dfende Dokumentation der Ergebnisse<\/li><li>Dokumentation und Fehlerbeschreibung der gepr\u00fcften Artikel<\/li><li>Bedienen und Einstellen von Pr\u00fcfeinrichtungen<\/li><li>Aussortierung von Produkten nach Qualit\u00e4tsabweichungen\u00a0<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>Was wir uns von Dir w\u00fcnschen:<\/strong><p><ul><li>Du hast eine erfolgreich abgeschlossene Ausbildung im metallverarbeitenden\/elektrotechnischen Bereich<\/li><li>Idealerweise verf\u00fcgst du \u00fcber\u00a0Erfahrung im Bereich der Qualit\u00e4tssicherung und Wareneingangspr\u00fcfung<\/li><li>Korrekte Interpretation von technischen Zeichnungen und Erfahrung mit elektronischen Bauteilen w\u00fcnschenswert<\/li><li>Qualit\u00e4tsbewusste und verantwortungsbewusste Arbeitsweise<\/li><li>Gute MS-Office Kenntnisse und Erfahrung im Umgang mit ERP-Systemen<\/li><li>Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse und gute Englischkenntnisse<\/li><li>Gehaltsspanne (abh\u00e4ngig von Vorkenntnissen): 32.000 - 35.000 EUR \/ Jahr\u00a0<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/luis-technology\/mitarbeiter-qualitatssicherung-hamburg-173838","tags":[],"job_types":["Entry","Permanent","Full time"],"location":"Hamburg","created_at":1785604151},{"slug":"senior-sales-managerin-brand-performance-advertising-berlin-203451","company_name":"Good Hood GmbH","title":"Senior Sales Manager:in Brand & Performance Advertising (m\/w\/d)","description":"<br><strong>Deine Aufgaben<\/strong><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Deine Mission:<\/strong> Werde zum Wachstumsmotor von Deutschlands gr\u00f6\u00dfter Nachbarschaftsplattform<br><\/span><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Du willst nicht nur Media-Budgets verwalten, sondern den Markt aktiv gestalten? Du hast den Instinkt f\u00fcr gro\u00dfe Deals und die Ausdauer, Marken dort zu platzieren, wo sie echtes Vertrauen genie\u00dfen?<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Bei nebenan.de bringen wir starke Brands direkt in das digitale Zuhause von \u00fcber 4 Millionen aktiven Nutzer:innen. Wir suchen keinen \"Verwalter\", sondern einen Senior Sales Profi, der unser Werbegesch\u00e4ft mit Biss, Kreativit\u00e4t und unternehmerischem Mut auf das n\u00e4chste Level hebt.<\/span><\/p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Jagdinstinkt trifft Strategie<\/strong><\/span><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Pipeline-Architekt &amp; Hunter:<\/strong> Du baust dir deinen eigenen Kundenstamm von Grund auf auf. Dabei nutzt du Kaltakquise als Werkzeug und identifizierst durch eigenst\u00e4ndige Lead-Recherche \u2013 massiv unterst\u00fctzt durch unsere internen KI-Tools \u2013 die Brands, die perfekt zu unserer Plattform passen<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Deal-Closing auf Entscheiderebene:<\/strong> Du gewinnst gro\u00dfe Marken und Mediaagenturen f\u00fcr hyperlokale und nationale Kampagnen. Du begleitest den gesamten Prozess von der ersten Kontaktaufnahme bis zum finalen Vertragsabschluss.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Scale bigger:<\/strong> Du denkst nicht in Standardpaketen. Du suchst aktiv nach Hebeln, um Budgets zu skalieren, Add-ons zu platzieren und crossmediale Konzepte umzusetzen, die nachhaltig Eindruck hinterlassen.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Kreativer Sparringspartner:<\/strong> Du entwickelst proaktiv \u201eum die Ecke gedachte\u201c Ans\u00e4tze f\u00fcr deine Kund:innen, um deren Sichtbarkeit und Wirksamkeit auf der Plattform zu maximieren.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\"><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Vorbild &amp; Mentor:in:<\/strong> Du teilst deine Sales-Experience im Team, pushst die Ambition deiner Kolleg:innen und hilfst uns, als Einheit \u00fcber uns hinauszuwachsen.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>Dein Profil<\/strong><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Abschlussst\u00e4rke ist deine DNA<\/span><ul><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Erfahrung:<\/strong> Du bringst\u00a04-5+ Jahre fundierte Erfahrung\u00a0im Media- oder Ad-Sales mit, idealerweise mit einem Fokus auf Branding- oder Plattformkampagnen.\u00a0<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Erfolgsbilanz:<\/strong> Dein Track Record ist tadellos \u2013 du hast bereits nachweislich gro\u00dfe Marken \u00fcberzeugt und signifikante Umsatztreiber etabliert.\u00a0<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Hunter-Mentalit\u00e4t:<\/strong> Du brennst f\u00fcr den Vertrieb.\u00a0Kaltakquise\u00a0schreckt dich nicht ab, sondern spornt dich an. Du hast den unbedingten Willen zum Erfolg und arbeitest leidenschaftlich an deinen Zielen.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Netzwerk:<\/strong> Du verf\u00fcgst \u00fcber ein belastbares Netzwerk in der Agentur- und Markenwelt, das du sofort aktivieren kannst.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p><strong>Mindset:<\/strong> Du denkst gro\u00df und mutig. Wo andere Hindernisse sehen, findest du Wege, um das Ticket zu heben und die Idee noch st\u00e4rker aufzuladen.<\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Arbeitsweise:<\/strong> Du arbeitest selbstorganisiert, hochgradig fokussiert und mit einem echten unternehmerischen Spirit.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>Was wir bieten<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Ein hybrides Arbeitsmodell mit einer Kombination aus B\u00fcro- und Remote-Tagen<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Einen sinnstiftenden Job \u2013 wir bauen ein gro\u00dfartiges Produkt, das echten Mehrwert f\u00fcr Communities liefert<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Arbeiten in einem fr\u00f6hlichen, erfahrenen Team, das Wissen teilt und voneinander lernt<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Einblicke in den gesamten Arbeitsprozess unseres Social Startups sowie der nebenan.de Stiftung<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Deine nebenan.de SpenditCard \u2013 jeden Monat erh\u00e4ltst Du zus\u00e4tzlich 35 \u20ac zur freien Verf\u00fcgung<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">30 Tage Jahresurlaub, plus die M\u00f6glichkeit von Workation-Modellen und Sabbaticals<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Eine st\u00e4rkenorientierte Entwicklungskultur (wir arbeiten mit dem Gallup StrengthsFinder)<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Ein B\u00fcro in Berlin-Kreuzberg und regelm\u00e4\u00dfige Events wie Yoga oder \u201eLunch &amp; Learn\u201c-Sessions<\/li><\/ul><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><br>Wir bieten dir die Chance, in einem Umfeld zu arbeiten, das Impact mit Performance verbindet. Du gestaltest die Zukunft unseres Advertising-Gesch\u00e4fts aktiv mit und profitierst von einer Plattform, die als \"Zuhause f\u00fcr Marken mit Haltung\" echtes Alleinstellungsmerkmal genie\u00dft.<\/span><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/good-hood-gmbh\/senior-sales-managerin-brand-performance-advertising-berlin-203451","tags":["#join","sales manager","direct sales","adsales","agency relations","vertrieb"],"job_types":["Experienced","Permanent","Full time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1785604147},{"slug":"chief-of-staff-berlin-10796","company_name":"Good Hood GmbH","title":"Chief of Staff (m\/f\/d)","description":"<br><strong>Deine Aufgaben<\/strong><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">We're looking for a results-driven Chief of Staff to build the operating backbone behind our leadership team. This role exists to support our COO and the wider C-level move faster: turning strategy into structured decisions, taking high-priority initiatives from idea to delivery, and making sure the way we work as a company actually keeps up with how we want to work.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">You'll sit at the intersection of strategy, organizational design, and daily execution, with real ownership over how well the company runs, reporting directly to the COO.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Turning strategy into action<\/strong><\/span><br><ul><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Help teams move and settle into our new team structure, support them in working together effectively, and shape how our enabling teams support other teams<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Own high-priority initiatives end-to-end, partnering directly with senior leadership and department heads from first concept to delivery<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Steer and track cross-departmental projects, keeping them accountable to their timelines<\/li><\/ul><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Organizational design<\/span><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Assess our organizational structure, spot capability gaps, and lead the work to close them<\/li><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Design and refine the internal processes, workflows, formats, and meeting rhythms that keep the company moving<\/li><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Prepare &amp; steer internal leadership meetings, keep track of deliverables<\/li><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Support the build-out and optimization of processes, tools, and automation<\/li><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Improve cross-team collaboration and introduce new ways of working<\/li><\/ul><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Daily operations &amp; project management<\/span><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Work closely with the C-level on delivering key priorities and operational topics in day-to-day business<\/li><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Take on high-visibility administrative and organizational special topics, stepping in with hands-on coordination when leadership needs it to unblock something important<\/li><\/ul><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Executive communication<\/span><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Prepare analyses, presentations, decision papers, and management reporting for leadership<\/li><li style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\">Organize and follow up on management meetings, workshops, and steering sessions<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>Dein Profil<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Outstanding academic background, MBA preferred<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>2-5 years of experience ideally in consultancies, scale-ups, VCs, or PEs; previous experience as COO of a small start up, CoS or Head of Operations or Special Projects in a mid-sized start up beneficial<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Excellent project management skills, building slides (Google Slides) and spreadsheets for daily business use cases with an analytical, structured, and process-oriented approach<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Professional and clear communication in both written and verbal form<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Ability to thrive in ambiguous situations and be able to lead something with little input\/context<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Strong analytical skills and a high affinity for data, business models, and operational metrics<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Structured, self-driven, and pragmatic way of working, with a steep learning curve and strong follow-through<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>A natural ability to build and maintain relationships and anticipate needs and challenges as well as thinking ahead<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Resilient, persistent, and proactive attitude as well as trustworthy with confidential information<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Business-level proficiency in both German and English is a must<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Excited by in-person collaboration. This role requires 4 day office attendance, one day can be worked remotely.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>Was wir bieten<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>A meaningful job \u2013 we're creating a great product with real added value for the community<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Work in a cheerful and experienced team that exchanges ideas and learns from each other<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Insights into the entire work process of our social startup and the nebenan.de foundation<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Responsibility and great opportunities to actively contribute<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>Your nebenan.de SpenditCard \u2013 you'll receive an additional income of 35 Euros per month, which you can use for things of your choice<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>30 days of vacation per year \u2013 we also offer the possibility of workation models and a sabbatical<\/p><\/li><li style=\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><p>A workplace in Berlin-Kreuzberg and regular events like yoga or Lunch &amp; Learn sessions.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/good-hood-gmbh\/chief-of-staff-berlin-10796","tags":[],"job_types":["Experienced","Permanent","Full time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1785604147},{"slug":"head-of-reporting-planning-bayreuth-24827","company_name":"Gunter Arlt Unternehmensberatung","title":"Head of Reporting & Planning (m\/w\/d)","description":"<p>Jobbeschreibung<\/p>\n<p>Head of Reporting &#x26; Planning (m\/w\/d)<\/p>\n<p>Finance Leadership f\u00fcr eine internationale Wachstumsgeschichte<\/p>\n<p>Zahlen berichten \u00fcber die Vergangenheit. Sie gestalten die Zukunft.<\/p>\n<p>F\u00fcr ein weltweit f\u00fchrendes, dynamisch wachsendes Unternehmen suchen wir eine unternehmerisch denkende F\u00fchrungspers\u00f6nlichkeit f\u00fcr die Leitung von Reporting &#x26; Planning.<\/p>\n<p>In dieser Schl\u00fcsselrolle f\u00fchren Sie nicht nur ein leistungsstarkes Team: Sie schaffen Transparenz f\u00fcr strategische Entscheidungen, entwickeln Planung und Steuerung weiter und nutzen Digitalisierung, Automatisierung und KI, um Finance noch wirksamer zu machen.<\/p>\n<h2>Aufgaben<\/h2>\n<p>Ihr Impact<\/p>\n<p>Sie machen Finance zum strategischen Navigationssystem der Unternehmensgruppe:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sie f\u00fchren, entwickeln und inspirieren das Reporting-&#x26;-Planning-Team.<\/li>\n<li>Sie verantworten aussagekr\u00e4ftige Management-Reports und \u00fcbersetzen komplexe Finanzdaten in klare Entscheidungen.<\/li>\n<li>Sie steuern Budget-, Forecast- und Planungsprozesse \u2013 vorausschauend, datenbasiert und international.<\/li>\n<li>Sie analysieren Abweichungen, leiten konkrete Handlungsempfehlungen ab und optimieren die finanzielle Performance.<\/li>\n<li>Sie gestalten moderne, effiziente Finanzprozesse und verbessern die Zusammenarbeit zwischen Finance und den Fachbereichen.<\/li>\n<li>Sie treiben Digitalisierung, Automatisierung und den sinnvollen Einsatz von KI im Finanzbereich voran.<\/li>\n<li>Sie arbeiten eng mit internationalen Stakeholdern und interdisziplin\u00e4ren Teams zusammen.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Qualifikation<\/h2>\n<p>Ihr Profil<\/p>\n<p>Sie verbinden Finance-Exzellenz mit Leadership und Ver\u00e4nderungswillen:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Studium in BWL, VWL, Finance &#x26; Controlling oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation<\/li>\n<li>Mehrj\u00e4hrige Berufs- und F\u00fchrungserfahrung in Reporting, Planung, Controlling oder Analytik \u2013 idealerweise in einem internationalen Wachstumsumfeld<\/li>\n<li>Erfahrung in internationalen, funktions\u00fcbergreifenden Projekten, beispielsweise Konzernkonsolidierung<\/li>\n<li>Sehr gute Kenntnisse in SAP FI\/CO sowie Reporting- und Datenvisualisierungstools<\/li>\n<li>Ausgepr\u00e4gte analytische St\u00e4rke, Qualit\u00e4tsbewusstsein und Hands-on-Mentalit\u00e4t<\/li>\n<li>Freude daran, etablierte Prozesse intelligent weiterzuentwickeln<\/li>\n<li>Souver\u00e4ne Kommunikation auf Deutsch und Englisch \u2013 auch im internationalen Stakeholder-Umfeld<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Benefits<\/h2>\n<p>Was Sie erwartet<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Eine sichtbare F\u00fchrungsrolle mit echtem Gestaltungsspielraum<\/li>\n<li>Internationale Karriereperspektiven bei einem weltweit f\u00fchrenden Unternehmen<\/li>\n<li>Attraktives Verg\u00fctungspaket inklusive Relocation Support<\/li>\n<li>Ein hochkompetentes, kollegiales Team<\/li>\n<li>30 Urlaubstage, ein Homeoffice-Tag und eine faire 40-Stunden-Woche<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Sie m\u00f6chten Finance nicht nur verwalten, sondern Zukunft gestalten?<\/p>\n<p>Dann freuen wir uns auf den vertraulichen Austausch.<\/p>\n<p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/gunter-arlt-unternehmensberatung\/head-of-reporting-planning-bayreuth-24827","tags":["Management","Team Leader"],"job_types":["teamleitung"],"location":"Bayreuth","created_at":1785601825},{"slug":"remote-ingenieur-software-architekt-ki-nutzer-darmstadt-77943","company_name":"DAI Software GmbH","title":"Remote - Ingenieur \/ Software-Architekt \/ KI-Nutzer","description":"<p>DAI Software ist eine <strong>Softwareberatung<\/strong> aus Darmstadt, die enterprise-grade Anwendungen auf einem vollst\u00e4ndig modernen TypeScript-Stack entwickelt.<br>\nWir sind ein erfahrenes, schlankes Team - kein Overhead, keine B\u00fcrokratie. Wir denken in Systemen, \u00fcbernehmen volle Verantwortung f\u00fcr unsere Arbeit und haben KI-gest\u00fctzte Workflows fest in unseren Alltag integriert. Mit Sitz in <strong>Darmstadt<\/strong> suchen wir engagierte Kolleginnen und Kollegen aus <strong>S\u00fcd-, Mittelhessen und Umgebung<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2>Aufgaben<\/h2>\n<p>Du entwickelst sauber strukturierten Code von der Architektur bis zum Deployment.<br>\nDu denkst mit, bringst Meinungen ein und \u00fcbernimmst volle Verantwortung f\u00fcr deine Arbeit - von der Planung bis zur Auslieferung. Kein Ticket-Schlie\u00dfen, kein Mikromanagement. Volle Eigenverantwortung in einem eingespielten Team.<\/p>\n<h2>Qualifikation<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mehrere Jahre Erfahrung in der Entwicklung, bevorzugt mit TypeScript<\/li>\n<li>Solide Kenntnisse in React und oder im Backend mit Bun oder Node.js<\/li>\n<li>Erfahrung mit API Design und Integration<\/li>\n<li>Sicherer Umgang mit relationalen oder dokumentenbasierten Datenbanken (z. B. PostgreSQL)<\/li>\n<li>Praxis mit Git, CI\/CD-Pipelines und modernen Deployment-Workflows<\/li>\n<li>Erfahrungen mit den Frontier Modellen und entsprechender Harness<\/li>\n<li>Erfahrung mit Testing (z. B. Vitest, Playwright oder \u00e4hnliches)<\/li>\n<li>Selbstst\u00e4ndige, ergebnisorientierte Arbeitsweise \u2014 du brauchst keine Anleitung<\/li>\n<li>Flie\u00dfend Deutsch (Arbeitssprache)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Studium der Informatik, ein Ingeneursstudium oder vergleichbare Ausbildung bzw. gleichwertige Berufserfahrung.<\/p>\n<h2>Benefits<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Attraktives Gehalt<\/strong> \u2014 marktgerechte, erfahrungsbasierte Verg\u00fctung<\/li>\n<li><strong>Vollst\u00e4ndig remote<\/strong> \u2014 arbeite von wo du willst<\/li>\n<li><strong>Flexible Arbeitszeiten<\/strong> \u2014 mit regelm\u00e4\u00dfigem Team-Overlap f\u00fcr Abstimmungen<\/li>\n<li><strong>Modernes Equipment<\/strong> \u2014 Top-Hardware, vollst\u00e4ndig bereitgestellt<\/li>\n<li><strong>Enterprise-Projekte<\/strong> \u2014 komplexe, reale Aufgaben mit echtem Impact<\/li>\n<li><strong>Kleines, eingespieltes Team<\/strong> \u2014 direkte Kommunikation, freundliche Atmosph\u00e4re<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Bei der <strong>DAI Software GmbH<\/strong> hast du die M\u00f6glichkeit, von Anfang an <strong>mitzugestalten<\/strong> und Verantwortung zu \u00fcbernehmen. Wenn du Lust hast, in einem <strong>kleinen, erfahrenen Team<\/strong> an spannenden Projekten zu arbeiten und moderne AI-gest\u00fctzte Softwarel\u00f6sungen zu entwickeln, bist du bei uns genau richtig. Kommunikation bitte auf Deutsch.<\/p>\n<p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":true,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/dai-software-gmbh\/remote-ingenieur-software-architekt-ki-nutzer-darmstadt-77943","tags":["Remote","IT"],"job_types":[],"location":"Darmstadt","created_at":1785600049},{"slug":"cro-direct-response-strategist-senior-landau-190258","company_name":"agencro","title":"CRO & Direct Response Strategist (Senior)","description":"<p>Wir sind agencro, eine CRO- und Direct-Response-Agentur f\u00fcr E-Commerce-Brands: Wir erstellen Advertorials, Landingpages, Online-Shops und Email f\u00fcr unsere Kunden. Mittlerweile geh\u00f6ren dazu ebenfalls eigene Brands, f\u00fcr die wir selbst auch Paid Ads schalten.<\/p>\n<p>Wir arbeiten AI-first: AI \u00fcbernimmt das Volumen, ein kleines Team mit Urteil und Geschmack dirigiert und veredelt. Kleines Remote-Team, kurze Wege, deine Arbeit geht schnell live.<\/p>\n<p>Wir gehen in die n\u00e4chste Wachstumsstufe und daf\u00fcr suchen wir eine zus\u00e4tzliche Ebene zwischen Gesch\u00e4ftsf\u00fchrung und Tagesgesch\u00e4ft: <strong>dich.<\/strong> Du gibst unseren Projekten die strategische Richtung, gibst Feedback, h\u00e4ltst die Qualit\u00e4t hoch und f\u00fchrst das Team fachlich.<\/p>\n<h2>Aufgaben<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Strategie:<\/strong> Angles und Marketing-Strategie pro Projekt entwickeln und Test-Roadmaps priorisieren - f\u00fcr Funnels, Seiten und Email genauso wie f\u00fcr Ads (Creative Strategy f\u00fcr unsere eigenen Paid-Kampagnen).<\/li>\n<li><strong>Team fachlich f\u00fchren:<\/strong> unser Team aus Copy, Design, Video und Technik briefen, Feedback geben und Ergebnisse abnehmen. Du musst nicht jeden Prozess auswendig kennen - Marketingverst\u00e4ndnis, gutes Feedback und klare Kommunikation z\u00e4hlen.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Copy schreiben:<\/strong> wenn es gebraucht wird, kannst du auch selbst schreiben - vor auf Deutsch und Englisch, mit AI als Hebel.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Testing-System:<\/strong> Winning Ads und Funnels analysieren, Learnings dokumentieren, den Creative-Testing-Prozess laufend verbessern.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Sparring der Gr\u00fcnder:<\/strong> strategische Entscheidungen vorbereiten und mittragen.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Qualifikation<\/h2>\n<p><strong>Woran wir Erfolg messen<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wir arbeiten mit klaren KPIs pro Projekt (Test-Win-Rate, Conversion-Ziele, geplanter Output) - die h\u00e4ltst du mit dem Team ein.<\/li>\n<li>Qualit\u00e4t von Copy und Creatives steigt messbar.<\/li>\n<li>Feedback und Kommunikation laufen strukturiert: das Team wei\u00df, was gut ist und was fehlt.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Wen wir NICHT suchen<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reine Berater, die seit Jahren nichts mehr selbst angefasst haben.<\/li>\n<li>Buzzword-Marketer. Wir denken in Angles, Awareness-Stufen und Zahlen.<\/li>\n<li>Feedback-Geber, die nur kommentieren, aber nicht vormachen k\u00f6nnen.<\/li>\n<li>AI-Skeptiker. AI ist bei uns Umsetzungs-Hebel.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Wen wir suchen<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nachweisbare Direct-Response-Erfolge (Funnels, Advertorials, VSLs, Ads), mit Zahlen belegt.<\/li>\n<li>Marketingverst\u00e4ndnis \u00fcber den ganzen Funnel: von der Ad \u00fcber die Landingpage bis zur Email.<\/li>\n<li>Du schreibst selbst gut, auf Deutsch und Englisch.<\/li>\n<li>AI-first: du nutzt AI t\u00e4glich f\u00fcr Research, Varianten und Drafts.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Benefits<\/h2>\n<p>Im Gegenzug f\u00fcr diese Skills arbeitest Du in einem Team aus jungen, dynamischen Leuten, kannst Deinen Tag so gestalten wie Du willst, arbeiten von wo Du willst und wirst jeden Tag aufs neue gechallenged.<\/p>\n<p>Du siehst unterschiedlichste Projekte im eCommerce von Health \u00fcber Beauty und Fitness bis hin zu Fashion, mit 8-9 stelligen Jahresums\u00e4tzen.<\/p>\n<p>Statt wochenlang an einer Sache zu sitzen, wechseln Deine Aufgaben im Tagestakt, sodass es Dir nie langweilig wird. Es gibt immer eine Challenge zu l\u00f6sen, ein Projekt zu pushen oder einen Prozess zu verbessern.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bewerbung<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Schick uns 3-5 Funnels, Advertorials oder Ads, die du geschrieben oder verantwortet hast - idealerweise mit Ergebnissen (CVR, CPA, Spend, Test-Wins).<\/li>\n<li>Ein kurzer Absatz: dein AI-Workflow heute - welche Tools, wof\u00fcr, wo dein Handwerk reinkommt.<\/li>\n<li>N\u00e4chste Schritte: Kennenlern-Gespr\u00e4ch, Probeaufgabe, Video-Call.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":true,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/agencro\/cro-direct-response-strategist-senior-landau-190258","tags":["Remote","Strategic Marketing"],"job_types":[],"location":"Landau","created_at":1785612543},{"slug":"remote-head-of-product-technology-germany-236010","company_name":"Cara Care","title":"Head of Product & Technology (m\/f\/x)","description":"<p>Cara Care is a leading German digital therapeutics company and part of Bayer, combining the agility of a growth-stage health tech company with the backing, scale, and credibility of a global healthcare leader. We build DiGA-listed products that deliver measurable clinical outcomes for patients and integrate deeply into the German healthcare system. Our ambition is to become a category leader in digital care by bringing together evidence-based medicine, outstanding user engagement, and scalable, compliant technology - while shaping how digital therapeutics connect to national health infrastructure and care delivery.<br><\/p><p>We are looking for a <strong>Head of Product &amp; Technology&nbsp; (m\/f\/x)<\/strong> to support us in our mission with immediate effect. In this role, you will be a <strong>key member of the Cara Care leadership team<\/strong> and report directly to the Managing Director of Cara Care. You will own the combined product and technology agenda across our DiGA products for IBS and GERD as well as our R&amp;D portfolio. Your mission is to build a clinically effective, user-centric, compliant, and scalable digital therapeutics platform that strengthens Cara Care\u2019s position as a category leader in digital care.&nbsp;<\/p><p>You combine product leadership, technical depth, and regulated healthcare expertise. You set direction, create focus, build strong teams, and ensure that product discovery, engineering delivery, data\/AI capabilities, and compliance requirements work together effectively.<\/p><p><\/p><h3>\ud83d\ude80 Your Mission<\/h3><ul><li>Product and technology strategy, roadmap, prioritization, and execution across existing and future digital therapeutic offerings<\/li><li>End-to-end product lifecycle from discovery and delivery to optimization, engagement, and measurable patient impact<\/li><li>Engineering architecture across mobile\/web frontend, backend services, data, cloud infrastructure, DevOps, security, and integrations<\/li><li>Data and AI capabilities, including analytics, personalization, automation, experimentation, and responsible AI-enabled product features<\/li><li>Translation of clinical, regulatory, reimbursement, privacy, and security requirements into pragmatic product and technology solutions<\/li><li>Software-as-a-medical-device lifecycle practices, including risk management, documentation discipline, change control, audit readiness, and post-market considerations<\/li><li>Operating model, delivery rhythms, decision rights, and ownership across Product, Engineering, Design, and Data\/AI<\/li><li>Team leadership, hiring, coaching, and development of a high-performing, accountable, and learning-oriented organization<\/li><li>Senior stakeholder management across Cara Care, Bayer interfaces, external partners, healthcare ecosystem stakeholders, and relevant infrastructure initiatives<\/li><\/ul><h3>What Success Looks Like in the First 12 Months<\/h3><ul><li>A focused product and technology roadmap is aligned with business, clinical, regulatory, and patient outcomes<\/li><li>Engineering delivery is more predictable, scalable, and transparent, with clear ownership and operating rhythms<\/li><li>The platform foundation supports multiple indications, future integrations, and compliant product evolution<\/li><li>Product engagement, therapy adherence, prescription activation, and patient impact are improved through data-informed iteration<\/li><li>Teams have clear roles, decision rights, and development paths, and are able to operate with speed and accountability in a regulated environment<\/li><li>Cara Care is prepared for audits, certification requirements, security reviews, and quality expectations by design rather than through late-stage remediation<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p><strong>Requirements<\/strong><\/p><h3>\ud83e\udd13 Your Profile<\/h3><p><strong>Must-Haves<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Senior product and\/or technology leadership experience at Head\/VP level, with ownership of strategy, roadmap, delivery, and team performance<\/li><li>Strong product mindset and track record building consumer-facing or patient-facing digital products with measurable engagement, outcome, and business impact<\/li><li>Technical fluency across modern software architecture, including mobile\/web frontend, backend services, APIs, cloud infrastructure, DevOps, cybersecurity, and data platforms<\/li><li>Experience operating in regulated environments, with the ability to balance speed, quality, compliance, privacy, safety, and auditability<\/li><li>Strong people leadership, coaching, hiring, and organizational development skills across Product, Engineering, Design, and Data\/AI teams<\/li><li>Pragmatic, hands-on ownership mindset with strong structured communication and the ability to create clarity in complex environments<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Preferred<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Experience with DiGA, digital therapeutics, SaMD, MDR Class I\/IIa, ISO\/QMS environments, TR-03161, GDPR, or comparable healthcare regulatory frameworks<\/li><li>Familiarity with German healthcare workflows, prescription journeys, HCP interaction, reimbursement logic, Gematik\/ePA\/eVO, or emerging interoperability standards such as EUDI Wallet<\/li><li>Experience building data-driven and AI-enabled product capabilities such as personalization, recommendations, automation, analytics, or experimentation platforms<\/li><li>Experience working in or with larger enterprise environments while preserving entrepreneurial speed and product focus<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>How You Will Work<\/h3><p>At Cara Care, you work alongside a team of physicians, researchers, developers, product specialists, and people experts who are passionate about improving people\u2019s lives. We are inspired by our patients and driven by real-world impact. We work fast, collaborate closely, and never lose sight of wellbeing \u2013 both for our users and for ourselves.<\/p><p><\/p><p>In this role you will work in a hybrid or remote setup and collaborate closely with leadership, Medical, Regulatory, Quality, Commercial, Privacy, Security, and Bayer stakeholders. The role requires the ability to combine startup-like ownership with the governance expectations of a global healthcare company. <strong>Fluency in English is required; German language skills are strongly preferred<\/strong> given Cara Care\u2019s DiGA context and German healthcare ecosystem.<\/p><p><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/p><p>\ud83d\udcb8&nbsp;<strong>Fair compensation<\/strong><br>You receive fair pay, regular salary payments, and of course the technology you need to do your job really well.<\/p><p>\ud83e\udef6&nbsp;<strong>Great team<\/strong><br>You\u2019ll join a lively, interdisciplinary team and a friendly, supportive working atmosphere \u2013 including regular on-site team events.<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udcbb&nbsp;<strong>Remote-first<\/strong><br>Want to work from home? No problem. Prefer coming to the office in Berlin? Also great. We are remote-first \u2013 you work wherever suits you best.<\/p><p>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f&nbsp;<strong>30 days off<\/strong><br>Rest is important. With us you get 30 days off per year: 26 vacation days plus 4 extra mental health days for breaks when you need them.<\/p><p>\ud83e\udd89&nbsp;<strong>Flexible working hours<\/strong><br>Whether you like to start early or prefer a later start \u2013 you shape your day in a way that works for you.<\/p><p>\ud83d\ude80&nbsp;<strong>You make a difference<\/strong><br>With us, you\u2019re not just part of it \u2013 you\u2019re at the center of it. Your ideas matter, and you can truly make an impact.<\/p><p><\/p><h3>Diversity matters to us<\/h3><p>We believe diverse teams build better products. That\u2019s why we are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone \u2013 regardless of race, religion, skin color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, or disability.<\/p><p>We know that applying for a new job is a big step, and we truly appreciate your time and effort. We look forward to getting to know you!<\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":true,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/cara-care\/remote-head-of-product-technology-germany-236010","tags":["Product Management","Health","Wellness and Fitness","Product & Engineering","Remote"],"job_types":["Full time","director"],"location":"Germany","created_at":1785594047},{"slug":"remote-werkstudentin-mitarbeiter-vertragswesen-all-genders-germany-249104","company_name":"Shiftmove","title":"Werkstudent:in Mitarbeiter Vertragswesen (all genders)","description":"<p>In ganz Europa stehen Fuhrparks unter enormem Druck. Kraftstoffkosten steigen, regulatorische Anforderungen werden komplexer und der Umstieg auf emissions\u00e4rmere Fahrzeuge nimmt Fahrt auf. Gleichzeitig verwalten noch immer rund 70 % der europ\u00e4ischen Unternehmen ihre Flotten mit Excel-Tabellen, isolierten Tools und Prozessen, die f\u00fcr die heutigen Herausforderungen nie ausgelegt waren.<\/p><p><strong>Shiftmove<\/strong>&nbsp;macht genau das einfacher. Wir sind ein profitables B2B-SaaS-Unternehmen und die am schnellsten wachsende Flottenmanagement-Plattform Europas. Entstanden aus dem Zusammenschluss von Avrios und Vimcar, unterst\u00fctzen wir heute zehntausende Gesch\u00e4ftskunden in Deutschland, Frankreich, Spanien, der Schweiz, Polen und weiteren europ\u00e4ischen M\u00e4rkten. Mit den j\u00fcngsten Akquisitionen von Optimum und Ocean in Frankreich haben wir unsere Pr\u00e4senz weiter ausgebaut und unsere Position in einem der gr\u00f6\u00dften Flottenm\u00e4rkte Europas gest\u00e4rkt.<\/p><p>Unsere KI-gest\u00fctzte Plattform verbindet Fahrzeugdaten in Echtzeit mit intelligenter Software, damit Unternehmen ihre Fahrzeuge smarter beschaffen, Kosten kontrollieren, Compliance sicherstellen und die Mobilit\u00e4tswende aktiv gestalten k\u00f6nnen \u2013 alles an einem Ort.<\/p><p><\/p><h3>\u00dcber die Rolle<\/h3><p>Als Werkstudent:.in im Vertragskundenservice unterst\u00fctzt du unsere Gesch\u00e4ftskunden bei allen Fragen rund um ihre Vertr\u00e4ge, Bestellungen, Rechnungen und K\u00fcndigungen. Du bist eine zentrale Anlaufstelle f\u00fcr ihre Anliegen und sorgst daf\u00fcr, dass Anfragen freundlich, zuverl\u00e4ssig und l\u00f6sungsorientiert bearbeitet werden.<\/p><p>Dabei arbeitest du eng mit verschiedenen internen Teams wie Customer Success und Logistik zusammen, kl\u00e4rst offene Fragen und leitest Anliegen gezielt an die richtigen Ansprechpartner weiter. So tr\u00e4gst du dazu bei, unseren Kunden eine reibungslose Customer Experience zu bieten und unsere internen Abl\u00e4ufe zuverl\u00e4ssig zu unterst\u00fctzen.<\/p><p><\/p><h3>Das erwartet dich<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Kundenbetreuung:<\/strong> Betreuung von Gesch\u00e4ftskunden bei Fragen rund um Vertr\u00e4ge, Bestellungen, Rechnungen und K\u00fcndigungen \u2013 telefonisch und schriftlich.<\/li><li><strong>Anfragenbearbeitung:<\/strong> Entgegennahme, Pr\u00fcfung und eigenst\u00e4ndige Bearbeitung von Kundenanfragen sowie Einleitung notwendiger n\u00e4chster Schritte.<\/li><li><strong>Vertragsmanagement:<\/strong> Bearbeitung vertragsbezogener Vorg\u00e4nge sowie zuverl\u00e4ssige und sorgf\u00e4ltige Umsetzung von Anfragen und \u00c4nderungen.<\/li><li><strong>Dokumentation:<\/strong> Strukturierte Dokumentation von Kundenanfragen, Bearbeitungsst\u00e4nden und relevanten Informationen in den entsprechenden Systemen.<\/li><li><strong>Zusammenarbeit:<\/strong> Enge Zusammenarbeit mit Customer Success, Logistik und weiteren Teams sowie proaktive Weiterleitung von Anfragen an die richtigen Ansprechpartner.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Was du mitbringst<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Erfahrung im Kundenservice:<\/strong> Du bringst erste praktische Erfahrung in der telefonischen oder schriftlichen Kundenbetreuung mit, idealerweise im kaufm\u00e4nnischen Kundenservice oder in einem vergleichbaren Umfeld.<\/li><li><strong>Kundenorientierung:<\/strong> Du arbeitest empathisch und serviceorientiert und hast Freude am direkten Kontakt mit Kunden.<\/li><li><strong>Kommunikationsst\u00e4rke:<\/strong> Auch in anspruchsvollen Situationen kommunizierst du freundlich, ruhig und professionell.<\/li><li><strong>Digitale Affinit\u00e4t:<\/strong> Du arbeitest sicher mit g\u00e4ngigen Office-Anwendungen, findest dich schnell in neue Tools und Systeme ein und hast Freude daran, digital zu arbeiten.<\/li><li><strong>Struktur &amp; Priorisierung:<\/strong> Du kannst mehrere Anfragen parallel bearbeiten, Informationen strukturiert erfassen und Aufgaben sinnvoll priorisieren.<\/li><li><strong>Sprachen:<\/strong> Du verf\u00fcgst \u00fcber Deutschkenntnisse auf C2-Niveau sowie Englischkenntnisse auf mindestens B2-Niveau.<\/li><\/ul><h3><\/h3><h3>Warum diese Stelle?<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Einarbeitung &amp; Entwicklung:<\/strong>&nbsp;Strukturierte Einarbeitung sowie individuelle Coachings, die auf pers\u00f6nliche St\u00e4rken abgestimmt sind und die fachliche sowie pers\u00f6nliche Weiterentwicklung unterst\u00fctzen.<\/li><li><strong>B2B-Kundenkontakt:<\/strong>&nbsp;Zusammenarbeit mit Gesch\u00e4ftskund:innen in einem professionellen und wertsch\u00e4tzenden Umfeld.<\/li><li><strong>Teamkultur:<\/strong>&nbsp;Arbeit in einem unterst\u00fctzenden Team, in dem Zusammenarbeit, Austausch und gegenseitige Unterst\u00fctzung im Mittelpunkt stehen \u2013 nicht reine Ticketbearbeitung.<\/li><li><strong>Arbeitszeiten:<\/strong>&nbsp;Geregelte Arbeitszeiten von Montag bis Freitag (zwischen 09:00 und 18:00 Uhr), keine Wochenend- oder Feiertagsarbeit.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Warum Shiftmove?<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Produkte mit echtem Impact bauen:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wir l\u00f6sen komplexe, allt\u00e4gliche Herausforderungen f\u00fcr tausende Unternehmen in ganz Europa - und ersetzen manuelle, fragmentierte Flottenprozesse durch datengetriebene, intelligente L\u00f6sungen, auf die sich unsere Kund:innen verlassen.<\/li><li><strong>Sinnvoll skalieren:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wir sind ein profitables, PE-finanziertes Scale-up mit starken Fundamenten und einer klaren Vision (1 Mio. Fahrzeuge auf unserer Plattform bis 2027) \u2013 eine seltene Kombination aus Stabilit\u00e4t, Ownership und Geschwindigkeit.<\/li><li><strong>International &amp; kollaborativ arbeiten:<\/strong>&nbsp;Mit \u00fcber 30 Nationalit\u00e4ten, Englisch als Unternehmenssprache und Teams in ganz Europa sind Zusammenarbeit und gemeinsame Verantwortung fest in unserer Arbeitsweise verankert.<\/li><li><strong>Wachsen mit Autonomie und Vertrauen:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wir investieren gezielt in Produkt, Daten und Menschen \u2013 und geben dir den Raum, Verantwortung zu \u00fcbernehmen, Ideen einzubringen, andere herauszufordern und aktiv mitzugestalten, wie wir skalieren.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Benefits<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Urlaub:<\/strong>&nbsp;30 Tage<\/li><li><strong>Workation:<\/strong>&nbsp;Bis zu 6 Wochen pro Jahr weltweit remote arbeiten<\/li><li><strong>Hundefreundliches Office:<\/strong>&nbsp;Vierbeinige Kolleg:innen sind bei uns willkommen \ud83d\udc36<\/li><li><strong>Weiterentwicklung:<\/strong>&nbsp;2.000 \u20ac j\u00e4hrliches Budget f\u00fcr pers\u00f6nliche und fachliche Entwicklung<\/li><li><strong>Hauptbenefits:<\/strong>&nbsp;Urban Sports Club, Hrmony-Abo, JobRad oder Zuschuss zum BVG-Ticket<\/li><li><strong>Wellbeing:<\/strong>&nbsp;1 Mental Health Day + Zugang zu nilo.health<\/li><li><strong>F\u00fcr Foodies:<\/strong>&nbsp;Kostenloses Mittagessen 1\u00d7 pro Woche, zweiw\u00f6chentliches Company Breakfast sowie rund um die Uhr verf\u00fcgbare Getr\u00e4nke &amp; Snacks \ud83c\udf55<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Administrative Infos<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Vertragsart:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wekstudent:in<\/li><li><strong>Standort:<\/strong>&nbsp;Berlin oder Remote (in Deutschland)<\/li><li><strong>Arbeitsmodell:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wenn in Berlin, dann hybrid mit 2 Tagen pro Woche im B\u00fcro im Herzen von Friedrichshain (Warschauer Stra\u00dfe 57)<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>We mean it!<\/h3><p><em>Mit \u00fcber 40 Nationalit\u00e4ten verbindet uns vor allem eines: der gemeinsame Anspruch, Mobilit\u00e4t f\u00fcr Unternehmen einfacher zu machen. Unterschiedliche Hintergr\u00fcnde, Erfahrungen und Perspektiven machen unsere Arbeit besser.<\/em><\/p><p><em>Uns ist nicht wichtig, ob dein Lebenslauf perfekt aussieht. Uns interessieren Menschen, die Verantwortung \u00fcbernehmen, Dinge ins Rollen bringen und Lust haben, gemeinsam etwas aufzubauen.<\/em><\/p><p><em>Du bist nicht sicher, ob du alle Anforderungen erf\u00fcllst? Bewirb dich trotzdem. Und wenn du im Bewerbungsprozess etwas brauchst oder Anpassungen notwendig sind, sag einfach Bescheid \u2013 wir finden eine L\u00f6sung.<\/em><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":true,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/shiftmove\/remote-werkstudentin-mitarbeiter-vertragswesen-all-genders-germany-249104","tags":["Customer Service","Computer Softwa