/p><p>Dabei arbeitest du eng mit verschiedenen internen Teams wie Customer Success und Logistik zusammen, kl\u00e4rst offene Fragen und leitest Anliegen gezielt an die richtigen Ansprechpartner weiter. So tr\u00e4gst du dazu bei, unseren Kunden eine reibungslose Customer Experience zu bieten und unsere internen Abl\u00e4ufe zuverl\u00e4ssig zu unterst\u00fctzen.<\/p><p><\/p><h3>Das erwartet dich<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Kundenbetreuung:<\/strong> Betreuung von Gesch\u00e4ftskunden bei Fragen rund um Vertr\u00e4ge, Bestellungen, Rechnungen und K\u00fcndigungen \u2013 telefonisch und schriftlich.<\/li><li><strong>Anfragenbearbeitung:<\/strong> Entgegennahme, Pr\u00fcfung und eigenst\u00e4ndige Bearbeitung von Kundenanfragen sowie Einleitung notwendiger n\u00e4chster Schritte.<\/li><li><strong>Vertragsmanagement:<\/strong> Bearbeitung vertragsbezogener Vorg\u00e4nge sowie zuverl\u00e4ssige und sorgf\u00e4ltige Umsetzung von Anfragen und \u00c4nderungen.<\/li><li><strong>Dokumentation:<\/strong> Strukturierte Dokumentation von Kundenanfragen, Bearbeitungsst\u00e4nden und relevanten Informationen in den entsprechenden Systemen.<\/li><li><strong>Zusammenarbeit:<\/strong> Enge Zusammenarbeit mit Customer Success, Logistik und weiteren Teams sowie proaktive Weiterleitung von Anfragen an die richtigen Ansprechpartner.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Was du mitbringst<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Erfahrung im Kundenservice:<\/strong> Du bringst erste praktische Erfahrung in der telefonischen oder schriftlichen Kundenbetreuung mit, idealerweise im kaufm\u00e4nnischen Kundenservice oder in einem vergleichbaren Umfeld.<\/li><li><strong>Kundenorientierung:<\/strong> Du arbeitest empathisch und serviceorientiert und hast Freude am direkten Kontakt mit Kunden.<\/li><li><strong>Kommunikationsst\u00e4rke:<\/strong> Auch in anspruchsvollen Situationen kommunizierst du freundlich, ruhig und professionell.<\/li><li><strong>Digitale Affinit\u00e4t:<\/strong> Du arbeitest sicher mit g\u00e4ngigen Office-Anwendungen, findest dich schnell in neue Tools und Systeme ein und hast Freude daran, digital zu arbeiten.<\/li><li><strong>Struktur &amp; Priorisierung:<\/strong> Du kannst mehrere Anfragen parallel bearbeiten, Informationen strukturiert erfassen und Aufgaben sinnvoll priorisieren.<\/li><li><strong>Sprachen:<\/strong> Du verf\u00fcgst \u00fcber Deutschkenntnisse auf C2-Niveau sowie Englischkenntnisse auf mindestens B2-Niveau.<\/li><\/ul><h3><\/h3><h3>Warum diese Stelle?<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Einarbeitung &amp; Entwicklung:<\/strong>&nbsp;Strukturierte Einarbeitung sowie individuelle Coachings, die auf pers\u00f6nliche St\u00e4rken abgestimmt sind und die fachliche sowie pers\u00f6nliche Weiterentwicklung unterst\u00fctzen.<\/li><li><strong>B2B-Kundenkontakt:<\/strong>&nbsp;Zusammenarbeit mit Gesch\u00e4ftskund:innen in einem professionellen und wertsch\u00e4tzenden Umfeld.<\/li><li><strong>Teamkultur:<\/strong>&nbsp;Arbeit in einem unterst\u00fctzenden Team, in dem Zusammenarbeit, Austausch und gegenseitige Unterst\u00fctzung im Mittelpunkt stehen \u2013 nicht reine Ticketbearbeitung.<\/li><li><strong>Arbeitszeiten:<\/strong>&nbsp;Geregelte Arbeitszeiten von Montag bis Freitag (zwischen 09:00 und 18:00 Uhr), keine Wochenend- oder Feiertagsarbeit.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Warum Shiftmove?<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Produkte mit echtem Impact bauen:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wir l\u00f6sen komplexe, allt\u00e4gliche Herausforderungen f\u00fcr tausende Unternehmen in ganz Europa - und ersetzen manuelle, fragmentierte Flottenprozesse durch datengetriebene, intelligente L\u00f6sungen, auf die sich unsere Kund:innen verlassen.<\/li><li><strong>Sinnvoll skalieren:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wir sind ein profitables, PE-finanziertes Scale-up mit starken Fundamenten und einer klaren Vision (1 Mio. Fahrzeuge auf unserer Plattform bis 2027) \u2013 eine seltene Kombination aus Stabilit\u00e4t, Ownership und Geschwindigkeit.<\/li><li><strong>International &amp; kollaborativ arbeiten:<\/strong>&nbsp;Mit \u00fcber 30 Nationalit\u00e4ten, Englisch als Unternehmenssprache und Teams in ganz Europa sind Zusammenarbeit und gemeinsame Verantwortung fest in unserer Arbeitsweise verankert.<\/li><li><strong>Wachsen mit Autonomie und Vertrauen:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wir investieren gezielt in Produkt, Daten und Menschen \u2013 und geben dir den Raum, Verantwortung zu \u00fcbernehmen, Ideen einzubringen, andere herauszufordern und aktiv mitzugestalten, wie wir skalieren.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Benefits<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Urlaub:<\/strong>&nbsp;30 Tage<\/li><li><strong>Workation:<\/strong>&nbsp;Bis zu 6 Wochen pro Jahr weltweit remote arbeiten<\/li><li><strong>Hundefreundliches Office:<\/strong>&nbsp;Vierbeinige Kolleg:innen sind bei uns willkommen \ud83d\udc36<\/li><li><strong>Weiterentwicklung:<\/strong>&nbsp;2.000 \u20ac j\u00e4hrliches Budget f\u00fcr pers\u00f6nliche und fachliche Entwicklung<\/li><li><strong>Hauptbenefits:<\/strong>&nbsp;Urban Sports Club, Hrmony-Abo, JobRad oder Zuschuss zum BVG-Ticket<\/li><li><strong>Wellbeing:<\/strong>&nbsp;1 Mental Health Day + Zugang zu nilo.health<\/li><li><strong>F\u00fcr Foodies:<\/strong>&nbsp;Kostenloses Mittagessen 1\u00d7 pro Woche, zweiw\u00f6chentliches Company Breakfast sowie rund um die Uhr verf\u00fcgbare Getr\u00e4nke &amp; Snacks \ud83c\udf55<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Administrative Infos<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Vertragsart:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wekstudent:in<\/li><li><strong>Standort:<\/strong>&nbsp;Berlin oder Remote (in Deutschland)<\/li><li><strong>Arbeitsmodell:<\/strong>&nbsp;Wenn in Berlin, dann hybrid mit 2 Tagen pro Woche im B\u00fcro im Herzen von Friedrichshain (Warschauer Stra\u00dfe 57)<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>We mean it!<\/h3><p><em>Mit \u00fcber 40 Nationalit\u00e4ten verbindet uns vor allem eines: der gemeinsame Anspruch, Mobilit\u00e4t f\u00fcr Unternehmen einfacher zu machen. Unterschiedliche Hintergr\u00fcnde, Erfahrungen und Perspektiven machen unsere Arbeit besser.<\/em><\/p><p><em>Uns ist nicht wichtig, ob dein Lebenslauf perfekt aussieht. Uns interessieren Menschen, die Verantwortung \u00fcbernehmen, Dinge ins Rollen bringen und Lust haben, gemeinsam etwas aufzubauen.<\/em><\/p><p><em>Du bist nicht sicher, ob du alle Anforderungen erf\u00fcllst? Bewirb dich trotzdem. Und wenn du im Bewerbungsprozess etwas brauchst oder Anpassungen notwendig sind, sag einfach Bescheid \u2013 wir finden eine L\u00f6sung.<\/em><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":true,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/shiftmove\/remote-werkstudentin-mitarbeiter-vertragswesen-all-genders-berlin-19317","tags":["Customer Service","Computer Software","Customer Org","Remote"],"job_types":["Full time"],"location":"Berlin, Germany","created_at":1785594033},{"slug":"associate-account-executive-all-gender-dach-b2b-sales-berlin-383641","company_name":"Shiftmove","title":"Associate Account Executive (all gender) DACH B2B Sales","description":"<p>Bei Shiftmove entwickeln wir die n\u00e4chste Generation vernetzter Mobilit\u00e4tsprodukte, mit denen Unternehmen fundierte, datenbasierte Entscheidungen treffen k\u00f6nnen. Unser Ziel ist es, komplexe Abl\u00e4ufe intuitiv und effizient zu gestalten \u2013 und aus Daten echten Mehrwert f\u00fcr tausende B2B-Kund:innen in ganz Europa und dar\u00fcber hinaus zu schaffen.<\/p><p>Als <strong>Associate Account Executive (B2B Sales)<\/strong> bist du Teil unseres SMB Sales Teams und arbeitest in einer festen Pod-Struktur eng mit erfahrenen Account Executives zusammen. Du verantwortest den Aufbau neuer Kundenbeziehungen, identifizierst Verkaufschancen und unterst\u00fctzt aktiv entlang des gesamten Sales-Prozesses. Dabei entwickelst du dich Schritt f\u00fcr Schritt zu einer eigenverantwortlichen Rolle im B2B-Vertrieb.<\/p><p>Wenn du gerne auf Menschen zugehst, ambitioniert bist und deine Karriere im B2B-Sales starten m\u00f6chtest, bist du bei uns genau richtig.<\/p><p><\/p><h3>Deine Aufgaben<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Neukunden gewinnen: <\/strong>Du identifizierst und kontaktierst potenzielle Kund:innen im deutschsprachigen Raum \u00fcber verschiedene Kan\u00e4le und baust durch \u00fcberzeugende Gespr\u00e4che kontinuierlich neue Gesch\u00e4ftsm\u00f6glichkeiten auf.<\/li><\/ul><ul><li><strong>Opportunities qualifizieren: <\/strong>Du analysierst die Anforderungen potenzieller Kund:innen, bewertest Verkaufschancen anhand klarer Kriterien und vereinbarst gemeinsam mit deinem Pod qualifizierte Gespr\u00e4che mit hoher Terminqualit\u00e4t und Show-Rate.<\/li><\/ul><ul><li><strong>Im Sales Cycle mitwirken: <\/strong>Du arbeitest eng mit deinem Account Executive zusammen, unterst\u00fctzt bei Discovery Calls und \u00fcbernimmst mit wachsender Erfahrung schrittweise mehr Verantwortung im Vertriebsprozess.<\/li><\/ul><ul><li><strong>Pipeline aufbauen: <\/strong>Du baust durch konsequentes Follow-up eine nachhaltige Pipeline auf, h\u00e4ltst Kontakte aktiv und reaktivierst bestehende Leads.<\/li><\/ul><ul><li><strong>Teamwork &amp; CRM: <\/strong>Du arbeitest eng mit deinem Sales Pod zusammen, tr\u00e4gst zu gemeinsamen Zielen bei und dokumentierst deine Aktivit\u00e4ten strukturiert in Salesforce.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Was du mitbringen solltest<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Erste Erfahrung im Vertrieb oder in einer performance-orientierten Rolle:<\/strong> Sales, Recruiting, Kundenakquise oder Business Development, ist ein Plus \u2013 aber kein Muss. <\/li><\/ul><ul><li><strong>Freude an Outbound: <\/strong>Du gehst gerne aktiv auf Menschen zu und f\u00fchlst dich am Telefon wohl. <\/li><li><strong>Hoher eigener Anspruch: <\/strong>Du m\u00f6chtest lernen, wie moderner B2B-SaaS-Vertrieb funktioniert, und entwickelst dich kontinuierlich weiter. <\/li><li><strong>Struktur &amp; Eigenverantwortung: <\/strong>Du arbeitest strukturiert, eigenverantwortlich und verlierst deine Ziele nicht aus dem Blick. <\/li><li><strong>Resilienz &amp; Durchhalteverm\u00f6gen: <\/strong>Ablehnung motiviert dich, statt dich auszubremsen. <\/li><li><strong>Klare Kommunikation: <\/strong>Du kommunizierst klar, \u00fcberzeugend und auf Augenh\u00f6he. <\/li><li><strong>Sprachen:<\/strong>&nbsp;Deutsch C2, Englisch mind. B2<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Warum Shiftmove?<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Lerne den gesamten Sales-Prozess: <\/strong>Du arbeitest vom ersten Tag an eng mit erfahrenen Account Executives zusammen und erh\u00e4ltst Einblicke in den gesamten Customer Journey \u2013 von der ersten Kontaktaufnahme bis hin zu erfolgreichen Kundengespr\u00e4chen.<\/li><li><strong>Steile Lernkurve:<\/strong> Regelm\u00e4\u00dfiges Coaching, direktes Feedback und die Zusammenarbeit im Pod erm\u00f6glichen dir eine schnelle pers\u00f6nliche und fachliche Entwicklung.<\/li><li><strong>Klare Entwicklungsperspektive:<\/strong> Wir investieren gezielt in deine Weiterentwicklung und schaffen die Voraussetzungen, damit du langfristig mehr Verantwortung im Vertrieb \u00fcbernehmen kannst.<\/li><li><strong>Produkte mit echtem Impact:<\/strong> Wir l\u00f6sen komplexe Herausforderungen f\u00fcr tausende Unternehmen in Europa und helfen ihnen dabei, ihre Flottenprozesse datengetrieben und effizient zu steuern.<\/li><li><strong>Performance-Kultur:<\/strong> Wir arbeiten ambitioniert, messen Ergebnisse und unterst\u00fctzen uns gegenseitig dabei, jeden Tag besser zu werden.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Benefits<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Urlaub:<\/strong> 30 Tage<\/li><\/ul><ul><li><strong>Workation:<\/strong> Bis zu 6 Wochen pro Jahr weltweit remote arbeiten<\/li><li><strong>Hundefreundliches Office:<\/strong> Vierbeinige Kolleg:innen sind willkommen \ud83d\udc36<\/li><li><strong>Weiterentwicklung:<\/strong> 2.000 \u20ac j\u00e4hrliches Budget f\u00fcr pers\u00f6nliche und fachliche Entwicklung<\/li><li><strong>Hauptbenefits:<\/strong> Urban Sports Club, Hrmony-Abo, JobRad oder Zuschuss zum BVG-Ticket<\/li><li><strong>Wellbeing:<\/strong> 1 Mental Health Day + Zugang zu nilo.health<\/li><li><strong>F\u00fcr Foodies:<\/strong> Kostenloses Mittagessen 1\u00d7 pro Woche, regelm\u00e4\u00dfiges Company Breakfast sowie Getr\u00e4nke &amp; Snacks<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Administrative Infos<\/h3><ul><li> <strong>Vertragsart:<\/strong> Unbefristet, Vollzeit <\/li><li> <strong>Standort:<\/strong> Berlin <\/li><li> <strong>Arbeitsmodell:<\/strong> Hybrid (2 Tage pro Woche im Office) <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3>Klingt nach dir? Dann lass uns gemeinsam wachsen!<\/h3><p>Dann freuen wir uns darauf, dich kennenzulernen und gemeinsam die Zukunft des B2B-Vertriebs bei Shiftmove zu gestalten.<\/p><p>Shiftmove f\u00f6rdert Chancengleichheit. Wir begr\u00fc\u00dfen Bewerbungen unabh\u00e4ngig von Geschlecht, Alter, Herkunft, Religion, sexueller Orientierung oder Beeintr\u00e4chtigung. Solltest du w\u00e4hrend des Bewerbungsprozesses Unterst\u00fctzung ben\u00f6tigen, sprich uns gerne an.<\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/shiftmove\/associate-account-executive-all-gender-dach-b2b-sales-berlin-383641","tags":["Sales","Computer Software"],"job_types":["Full time","entry"],"location":"Berlin, Germany","created_at":1785594033},{"slug":"account-executive-munich-302363","company_name":"opentable","title":"Account Executive - Munich","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;\/strong&gt;Munich, Bavaria&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;\/strong&gt;: \u20ac60,000 base salary + uncapped commission (circa \u20ac100,000+ OTE)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About OpenTable&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most \u2013 their team, their guests, and their bottom line \u2013 while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You\u2019ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the face of OpenTable in your territory, owning the entire sales cycle from prospecting and relationship building through to negotiation and closing. In this field-based role, you will work across Stuttgart, spending a significant portion of your time meeting restaurant partners in person and the remainder working remotely. You will help restaurants grow revenue and improve operations by introducing technology that supports reservations, front-of-house management, and guest experience. This role requires professional fluency in German and English and a strong ability to build credibility with restaurant operators in a competitive market.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t have an office in Germany so you&#39;ll spend much of your week meeting restaurant operators face-to-face across your territory, helping build trusted relationships and close new business.This field-based role combines home working with regular travel across your territory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Identify, engage, and win new restaurant business within an assigned territory to grow OpenTable\u2019s network.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Deliver tailored in-person and virtual product demonstrations that clearly connect OpenTable\u2019s solutions to each partner\u2019s needs.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with restaurant operators, share relevant market insights, and help them think differently about opportunities in their business.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Develop territory plans, manage pipeline activity, forecast accurately, and process contracts using Salesforce.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet or exceed monthly and quarterly acquisition and revenue targets while navigating objections and competitive pressure.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Share customer feedback with internal teams and represent OpenTable through networking, events, and ongoing engagement with the hospitality community.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in consultative business-to-business enterprise sales.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Proven success meeting or exceeding sales targets in a consultative sales environment.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery, negotiation, presentation, and time management skills, with the ability to use data to influence decisions and build a business case.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Google Workspace and Salesforce, a bachelor\u2019s degree, and the ability to travel regularly within Germany for a field-based role.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Experience selling software, hospitality technology, payments, or related solutions.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Experience in restaurant management or sales within the food and beverage industry.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Experience using customer and market insights to improve sales strategy and provide product feedback.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Experience representing a company through industry networking and events.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Interest in hospitality and technology, with a collaborative and learning-oriented approach.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note; we have a global recruitment team, so ask that your Resume is submitted in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You\u2019ll Get at&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https:\/\/www.opentable.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenTable&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We believe great work happens when people feel trusted, supported &amp;amp; excited about what they do \u2014 so we offer benefits designed to support your life, wellbeing &amp;amp; growth.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;\ud83c\udf0d Flexibility that actually feels flexible&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to &lt;strong&gt;20 days per year&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 vacation days per year&lt;\/strong&gt;, 2 days off off your wedding, one for moving &amp;amp; &lt;strong&gt;your birthday off&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;An annual &lt;strong&gt;company-wide recharge week&lt;\/strong&gt; where the whole business fully switches off&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;\ud83e\udde0 Support for your wellbeing&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company-paid therapy&lt;\/strong&gt; through Spring Health&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Headspace subscription&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&lt;\/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;24\/7 GP access&lt;\/strong&gt;, legal support &amp;amp; more&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Income protection &amp;amp; life assurance&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;\ud83d\ude80 Investment in your growth&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development Dollars&lt;\/strong&gt; to support your learning&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership development opportunities&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Access to &lt;strong&gt;thousands of on-demand courses &amp;amp; learning resources&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;\u2728 The extras that make a difference&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid volunteer days&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive pension contributions&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Resource Groups &amp;amp; inclusive communities&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and\/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We\u2019re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve\u2014and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application or interview process, or on the job, we\u2019re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;#LI-FF1&lt;\/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/opentable\/account-executive-munich-302363","tags":["International RSS"],"job_types":[],"location":"Munich","created_at":1785585312},{"slug":"working-student-accounting-munich-office-259858","company_name":"Westwing","title":"Working Student Accounting (m\/f\/d)","description":"<br><strong>JOIN OUR TEAM<\/strong><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:left;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline;\">As a <strong>Working Student Accounting<\/strong>, you will gain hands-on experience in our core financial operations. You will get to know our team and our way of working, actively supporting us with a variety of tasks across our daily accounting and tax processes. Whether checking business transactions, assisting with month-end closures, or maintaining accurate records, you will bring your passion for numbers to a dynamic business environment. This position is <strong>permanent\u00a0<\/strong>and based in <strong>Munich<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p><br><strong>WHAT YOU'LL DO<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Collaborate on our monthly closures and our diverse tax declarations<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Independently review and allocate business transactions (e.g. incoming invoices) and travel expenses<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Create sales invoices for the B2B business and maintain customer master data<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Take responsibility for proper documentation and (electronic) filing<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Support with projects and special topics<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>YOU COME WITH<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Current enrolment in a Bachelor's or Master's programme in Accounting, Finance, Taxation, Business Administration, Economics, or a related field and i<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">deally, initial experience in accounting, finance, or taxation<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Experience with standard MS Office applications, along with an interest and ability to work with various IT tools<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">A joy for working with numbers and tackling new challenges, combined with an exact, structured approach to work, discretion, and a high level of commitment<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">An independent working style paired with a dedicated, team-oriented mindset<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Fluency in English; good German skills are a plus<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>WHY WESTWING<\/strong><p><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">If you are looking for a place where ambition meets creativity, where ideas turn into impact fast, and where people are trusted to grow - you have found it.<\/span><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(32,32,32);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><\/span><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\">At Westwing, we\u2019re building the Superbrand in Design with a team that\u2019s shaping the future of beautiful home &amp; living.<br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\">Here is what you can look forward to:<br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\"><\/span><ul style=\"border:0px solid;color:rgb(32,32,32);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">A high-performance culture built on trust, feedback and collaboration<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">An inspiring, international environment that empowers you to think big, take ownership, and grow beyond your comfort zone<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">A flexible hybrid setup with ideally 3 office days per week - because strong connections and quick collaboration make great ideas happen<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Work-from-anywhere opportunities for up to 4 weeks per year - as fresh perspectives spark bold ideas<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">30 days of paid holiday to rest, recharge, and come back ready to create<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">A beautiful, centrally located, dog-friendly office with inspiring spaces, a sunny terrace, and good food - designed for moments that energise and connect<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Exclusive discounts - 40% off Westwing Collection, 20% off third-party brands (each on non-reduced items), 10% Family &amp; Friends discount, plus special-occasion vouchers<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Wellbeing support through mental health resources, sports memberships, and preventive care<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Sustainable mobility options with discounted public transport and JobRad - moving with purpose and care for the planet<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Support for working parents, including our on-site Westwing Wichtel daycare and a partnership with multilingual provider Elly &amp; Stoffl<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">One annual Social Impact Day to give back to a cause you care about - because being human is our true superpower<\/li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Team rituals that celebrate results and togetherness - from Summer &amp; Winter Parties to Oktoberfest<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>ABOUT US<\/strong><p><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline;\">Westwing, Europe\u2019s #1 in Beautiful Living e-commerce, is present in 20+ European countries and achieved a GMV (Gross Merchandise Volume) of EUR 507 million in 2025. As Europe\u2019s premium one-stop destination for Design Lovers, it offers a unique brand experience with a carefully curated assortment of the Westwing Collection and 3rd party design brands. The integrated platform combines Shop, Daily Specials, Stores, the B2B Service (Westwing Business) and the Westwing Design Service. Westwing\u2019s team works together on its shared purpose to \u201cExcite people to create homes that unlock the full beauty of life\u201d. Founded in 2011, Westwing is headquartered in Munich and went public on the Frankfurt Stock Exchange in October 2018.<\/span><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(32,32,32);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:18px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(32,32,32);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:18px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><\/span><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline;\">Our team is a diverse group of professionals aiming for high performance, working together at a fast pace in an inspiring, international and informal environment that enables you to grow your career while working with a brand and products our customers love. We\u2019re made up of passionate people who are creative enough to disrupt the status quo, brave enough to fail and smart enough to win. So come, be part of the \u201cwow, you work at Westwing?\u201d crowd.<\/span><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(32,32,32);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:18px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(32,32,32);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:18px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><\/span><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline;\">Diversity is deeply rooted in our culture. Our mission doesn\u2019t stop to inspire only your design choices, it continues to embrace an inclusive lifestyle filled with respect to everyone\u2019s uniqueness, cultural differences and equal opportunity.<\/span><\/p><br><strong>Department<\/strong><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Finance<\/span><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/westwing\/working-student-accounting-munich-office-259858","tags":["accounting","tax accounting","working student","finance","part-time"],"job_types":["Student","Intern","Part time"],"location":"Munich Office","created_at":1785582546},{"slug":"senior-supply-chain-manager-munich-office-98146","company_name":"Westwing","title":"Senior Supply Chain Manager (m\/f\/d)","description":"<br><strong>JOIN OUR TEAM<\/strong><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">As a <strong>Senior Supply Chain Manager<\/strong>, you will own and continuously improve the end-to-end flow of goods across our supply chain network. You will act as a senior partner to cross-functional teams, including buying and warehouse operations, to ensure the timely delivery of products to our customers. Furthermore, you will work with suppliers, driving supply chain resilience to meet purchase order management requirements and ensure product availability. As the central expert for supply chain operations, you will play a key role in shaping best practices and mentoring team members. This position is <strong>permanent<\/strong> and based in <strong>Munich<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p><br><strong>WHAT YOU'LL DO<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Own the end-to-end purchase order lifecycle, from supplier onboarding and order placement to shipment management and tracking, ensuring product availability across a complex, multi-category portfolio<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Coordinate deliveries, resolve shipping issues, and partner with freight providers, warehouse operations, buying, and supply planning teams to ensure efficient order fulfillment and smooth logistics operations<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Monitor and evaluate KPIs (e.g., OTIF, OTP, product availability), conduct root cause analyses, and implement structural improvement plans<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Lead cross-functional projects to improve supply chain processes, resolve systemic bottlenecks, and drive a culture of continuous improvement through best practices, operational excellence, and innovative solutions by utilising AI and automation where applicable, while ensuring compliance with company policies and industry regulations<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Build and lead strategic, long-term relationships with key suppliers, acting as the senior point of contact and driving supplier performance and smooth purchase order execution<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Lead, coach, and develop a team of two direct reports<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>YOU COME WITH<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">A bachelor's degree in supply chain management, logistics, or a related field<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">5+ years of experience in supply chain management, preferably in a similar role<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Strong problem-solving and analytical skills, with the ability to manage multiple priorities and projects simultaneously<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Proficiency in Microsoft Office and supply chain management software; experience with data analysis tools (e.g. Excel, SQL, Tableau) is a plus<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ability to work independently and thrive in a team-oriented environment, as well as excellent communication and interpersonal skills, enabling effective collaboration with diverse stakeholders<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Fluency in English<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>WHY WESTWING<\/strong><p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(22,22,22);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">If you are looking for a place where ambition meets creativity, where ideas turn into impact fast, and where people are trusted to grow - you have found it.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(22,22,22);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">At Westwing, we\u2019re building the Superbrand in Design with a team that\u2019s shaping the future of beautiful home &amp; living.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(22,22,22);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Here is what you can look forward to:<\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\"><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(22,22,22);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none