are<\/span><\/p><\/li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(22,22,22);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Sustainable mobility options with discounted public transport and JobRad - moving with purpose and care for the planet<\/span><\/p><\/li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(22,22,22);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Support for working parents, including our on-site\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none;\">Westwing Wichtel<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">\u00a0daycare and a partnership with multilingual provider Elly &amp; Stoffl<\/span><\/p><\/li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(22,22,22);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">One annual Social Impact Day to give back to a cause you care about - because being human is our true superpower<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(22,22,22);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Team rituals that celebrate results and togetherness - from Movie Nights and Oktoberfest to Summer &amp; Winter Parties<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>ABOUT US<\/strong><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Westwing, Europe\u2019s #1 in Beautiful Living e-commerce, is present in 20+ European countries and achieved a GMV (Gross Merchandise Volume) of EUR 507 million in 2025. As Europe\u2019s premium one-stop destination for Design Lovers, it offers a unique brand experience with a carefully curated assortment of the Westwing Collection and 3rd party design brands. The integrated platform combines Shop, Daily Specials, Stores, the B2B Service (Westwing Business) and the Westwing Design Service. Westwing\u2019s team works together on its shared purpose to \u201cExcite people to create homes that unlock the full beauty of life\u201d. Founded in 2011, Westwing is headquartered in Munich and went public on the Frankfurt Stock Exchange in October 2018.<br><br>Our team is a diverse group of professionals aiming for high performance, working together at a fast pace in an inspiring, international and informal environment that enables you to grow your career while working with a brand and products our customers love. We\u2019re made up of passionate people who are creative enough to disrupt the status quo, brave enough to fail and smart enough to win. So come, be part of the \u201cwow, you work at Westwing?\u201d crowd.<br><br>Diversity is deeply rooted in our culture. Our mission doesn\u2019t stop to inspire only your design choices, it continues to embrace an inclusive lifestyle filled with respect to everyone\u2019s uniqueness, cultural differences and equal opportunity.<\/span><\/p><br><strong>Department<\/strong><p><span style=\"text-transform:none;\">Operations &amp; Logistics<\/span><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/westwing\/senior-supply-chain-manager-munich-office-98146","tags":["Supply Chain","SCM"],"job_types":["Experienced","Permanent","Full time"],"location":"Munich Office","created_at":1785582546},{"slug":"senior-product-manager-operations-munich-office-221065","company_name":"Westwing","title":"Senior Product Manager - Operations (m\/f\/d)","description":"<br><strong>JOIN OUR TEAM<\/strong><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">As a <strong>Senior Product Manager<\/strong>, you will join our Technology team to drive the efficiency of Westwing's supply chain and fulfilment operations across Europe. Operating at the intersection of business and technology, you will partner with senior stakeholders to translate operational strategy into scalable systems across warehouse, order, and delivery management. Having recently completed a major migration of our order and warehouse management systems to modern SaaS platforms, we are now transitioning from initial stabilisation to building the next generation of scalable capabilities on top of that foundation. In this high-impact role, you will directly drive operational excellence and cost efficiency by shaping the systems that power our end-to-end processes, from initial sourcing to final customer delivery. <span style=\"font-size:18px;\">This position is <strong>permanent\u00a0<\/strong>and based in <strong>Munich<\/strong>.<\/span><\/span><\/p><br><strong>WHAT YOU'LL DO<\/strong><p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Partner with stakeholders across Sourcing, Logistics, Warehouse, and Operations to own the roadmap for our Supply Chain and Fulfilment systems, spanning both SaaS platforms and in-house tools<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Own and drive measurable business outcomes aligned with company OKRs and operational performance targets, translating operational needs into clear functional specifications and defining KPIs for data-led optimisation<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Coordinate the implementation of new and existing capabilities with our SaaS vendors and integration partners, driving delivery through to rollout<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Own the end-to-end product lifecycle for in-house operational tools, from prioritisation and delivery to continuous improvement, working closely with engineering, data, and design teams to ensure high-quality, scalable, and timely delivery<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Drive product discovery to identify automation and optimisation opportunities, leveraging AI and emerging technologies to innovate across the supply chain<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Make build-versus-buy decisions based on speed, scalability, and long-term impact, helping shape our evolving strategy across SaaS and in-house tooling as AI lowers the cost of custom software<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>YOU COME WITH<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">5+ years of product management experience within e-commerce, retail, or logistics, with a solid understanding of fulfilment and warehouse operations and systems such as OMS, WMS, or ERP<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Proven track record of implementing, configuring, and integrating SaaS solutions, with a strong comfort level blending product ownership with hands-on vendor and implementation coordination<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Extensive experience in project management, business analysis, Agile methodologies, and leading cross-functional teams to drive continuous process improvements<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Comfort with Excel and SQL, combined with practical experience using AI tools to accelerate research, documentation, and prototyping<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Strong analytical mindset with a passion for using data to distinguish between what technically works and what truly scales<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Fluency in English paired with excellent communication and influencing skills, with the ability to manage stakeholders across all functional and management levels<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">High resilience and adaptability in a fast-paced environment with evolving priorities<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>WHY WESTWING<\/strong><p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 8pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">If you are looking for a place where ambition meets creativity, where ideas turn into impact fast, and where people are trusted to grow - you have found it.<br>At Westwing, we\u2019re building the Superbrand in Design with a team that\u2019s shaping the future of beautiful home &amp; living.<br><br>Here is what you can look forward to:<br><br>\u2022 A high-performance culture built on trust, feedback and collaboration<br>\u2022 An inspiring, international environment that empowers you to think big, take ownership, and grow beyond your comfort zone<br>\u2022 A flexible hybrid setup with 3 office days per week - because strong connections and quick collaboration make great ideas happen<br>\u2022 Work-from-anywhere opportunities for up to 4 weeks per year - as fresh perspectives spark bold ideas<br>\u2022 30 days of paid holiday to rest, recharge, and come back ready to create<br>\u2022 A beautiful, centrally located, dog-friendly office with inspiring spaces, a sunny terrace, and good food - designed for moments that energise and connect<br>\u2022 Exclusive discounts - 40% off Westwing Collection, 20% off third-party brands (each on non-reduced items), 10% Family &amp; Friends discount, plus special-occasion vouchers<br>\u2022 Wellbeing support through mental health resources, sports memberships, and preventive care<br>\u2022 Sustainable mobility options with discounted public transport and JobRad - moving with purpose and care for the planet<br>\u2022 Support for working parents, including our on-site Westwing Wichtel daycare and a partnership with multilingual provider Elly &amp; Stoffl<br>\u2022 One annual Social Impact Day to give back to a cause you care about - because being human is our true superpower<br>\u2022 Team rituals that celebrate results and togetherness - from Summer &amp; Winter Parties to Oktoberfest<\/span><\/p><\/p><br><strong>ABOUT US<\/strong><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Westwing, Europe\u2019s #1 in Beautiful Living e-commerce, is present in 20+ European countries and achieved a GMV (Gross Merchandise Volume) of EUR 507 million in 2025. As Europe\u2019s premium one-stop destination for Design Lovers, it offers a unique brand experience with a carefully curated assortment of the Westwing Collection and 3rd party design brands. The integrated platform combines Shop, Daily Specials, Stores, the B2B Service (Westwing Business) and the Westwing Design Service. Westwing\u2019s team works together on its shared purpose to \u201cExcite people to create homes that unlock the full beauty of life\u201d. Founded in 2011, Westwing is headquartered in Munich and went public on the Frankfurt Stock Exchange in October 2018.<br><br>Our team is a diverse group of professionals aiming for high performance, working together at a fast pace in an inspiring, international and informal environment that enables you to grow your career while working with a brand and products our customers love. We\u2019re made up of passionate people who are creative enough to disrupt the status quo, brave enough to fail and smart enough to win. So come, be part of the \u201cwow, you work at Westwing?\u201d crowd.<br><br>Diversity is deeply rooted in our culture. Our mission doesn\u2019t stop to inspire only your design choices, it continues to embrace an inclusive lifestyle filled with respect to everyone\u2019s uniqueness, cultural differences and equal opportunity.<\/span><\/p><br><strong>Department<\/strong><p>Technology<\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/westwing\/senior-product-manager-operations-munich-office-221065","tags":["Product Manager","Operations","Technology","Senior"],"job_types":["Experienced","Permanent","Full time"],"location":"Munich Office","created_at":1785582546},{"slug":"senior-manager-new-markets-munich-office-135784","company_name":"Westwing","title":"Senior Manager New Markets (m\/f\/d)","description":"<br><strong>JOIN OUR TEAM<\/strong><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\">As a <strong>Senior Manager New Markets<\/strong>, you'll join our New Markets team and report to the VP New Markets. The team is responsible for expanding and scaling geographically. We've expanded Westwing\u2019s footprint from 11 to 23 countries recently and we're not stopping there. The role covers defining the go-to-market approach for new markets and particularly focuses on bringing those markets live and scaling them. You will work closely with other New Markets team members and colleagues across the organisation. This role is well suited to a candidate who is motivated to scale a market from the ground up, demonstrates strong attention to detail, and takes ownership and works independently. The position is <strong>unlimited<\/strong> and based in <strong>Munich<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p><br><strong>WHAT YOU'LL DO<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Drive our expansion strategy including market sizing, competitor analysis, positioning and business case modelling and derive clear, well-founded and detailed recommendations on which markets and which entry mode to pursue<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Own the commercial and go-to-market approach for new markets, from target assortment and pricing to brand positioning and local marketing as well as launch planning and translate it into a concrete, milestone-based implementation plan<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Lead and deliver the workstreams that bring a market to launch readiness, with a particular focus on commercial and marketing topics but also navigating confidently along the interface with sourcing, operations, customs, legal, tax and tech topics<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Own the KPIs that matter once a market is live, including set up the relevant KPI dashboards, identify and act upon what's driving or holding back commercial performance, stay on top of recent developments and continuously sharpen the playbook and derive measures to improve growth and profitability\u00a0<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Run customer surveys to understand the local customer, and make sure the customer experience is flawless from day 1 after launch<\/li><li style=\"font-size:18px;\">Prepare recommendations to senior leadership and ensure stakeholders are aligned<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><strong>YOU COME WITH<\/strong><p><ul><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\">5+ years of relevant experience in business building, strategy and\/or consulting, ideally combined with a proven track record in commercial and\/or marketing functions; experience in consumer\/lifestyle businesses is a clear plus<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\">Strategic and analytical thinking, with the ability to build business cases and financial models from scratch, structure complex and ambiguous problems, and develop creative, customer-centric solutions<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\">Hands-on mentality with a strong sense of ownership, driving topics independently from analysis through implementation. You prioritise pragmatically, execute with speed, and balance attention to detail with getting things done<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\">Strong project management skills, with experience leading complex initiatives across multiple workstreams and stakeholders, while ensuring accuracy and delivering high-quality, well-founded work<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\">Excellent written and spoken English communication skills; German is a plus<\/li><li style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\">Proficiency in Microsoft Office, particularly Excel and PowerPoint; familiarity with Google Workspace is a plus<\/li><\/ul><br><\/p><br><strong>WHY WESTWING<\/strong><p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0pt 0px;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);padding:0pt 0pt 8pt;\"><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-size:18px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(22,22,22);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">If you are looking for a place where ambition meets creativity, where ideas turn into impact fast, and where people are trusted to grow - you have found it.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0pt 0px;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);padding:0pt 0pt 8pt;\"><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0p