fast&amp;nbsp;lane.&amp;nbsp;We\u2019re&amp;nbsp;not just&amp;nbsp;leading&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;market;&amp;nbsp;we\u2019re&amp;nbsp;creating&amp;nbsp;it.&amp;nbsp;We\u2019re&amp;nbsp;constantly&amp;nbsp;innovating,&amp;nbsp;evolving&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;transforming&amp;nbsp;things&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;ourcustomers.&amp;nbsp;We\u2019re&amp;nbsp;driven,&amp;nbsp;ambitious&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;determined&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;do&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;best&amp;nbsp;work,&amp;nbsp;together.&amp;nbsp;For&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;career&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;doesn\u2019t&amp;nbsp;stand still,&amp;nbsp;where&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;put&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;ideasin&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;driving&amp;nbsp;seat&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;change&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;way&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;world&amp;nbsp;moves,&amp;nbsp;joinour&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;community.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Product Designer team at AutoScout24 ensures that we create the right products to deliver delight to customers by working closely with cross-functional partners to establish best practices and&amp;nbsp; processes, develop an end-to-end product rollout plan, align cross-functional stakeholders on strategy,&amp;nbsp; track and communicate business metrics, and help scale product knowledge throughout the organisation.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are currently looking for&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;a Senior Product Designer&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;to join our&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;B2C&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;team. You will work in a dynamic collaborative team in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Munich or Berlin&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; offices. Our work format is hybrid, and we meet in the office 2-3 a week.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You\u2019ll&amp;nbsp;Do&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;n3zij8&quot; data-start=&quot;470&quot; data-end=&quot;603&quot;&gt;Set and maintain a high bar for design craft, creating intuitive, accessible, and delightful user experiences across web and mobile&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;apnqc8&quot; data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;Take end-to-end ownership of key product experiences, from discovery through delivery and iteration&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;88k22b&quot; data-start=&quot;706&quot; data-end=&quot;840&quot;&gt;Use data not just to validate decisions, but to identify problems, evaluate trade-offs, and continuously improve the user experience&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gjtozl&quot; data-start=&quot;841&quot; data-end=&quot;947&quot;&gt;Contribute to strategic product decisions and help shape the future of AutoScout24&#39;s customer experience&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i2v3rd&quot; data-start=&quot;948&quot; data-end=&quot;1099&quot;&gt;Champion user-centered design practices and collaborate closely with Product Managers, Engineers, Researchers, Content Designers, and other designers&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1id0vhl&quot; data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1202&quot;&gt;Contribute to and evolve our design system, ensuring consistency and scalability across our products&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;n50v9w&quot; data-start=&quot;1203&quot; data-end=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;Constantly challenge yourself, explore new ideas, and look for opportunities to improve our products and ways of working&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17urn8u&quot; data-start=&quot;1326&quot; data-end=&quot;1449&quot;&gt;Be an active contributor to our design community by sharing knowledge, giving feedback, and helping raise the quality bar&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;g67szw&quot; data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1562&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1485&quot;&gt;5+ years&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;of in-house experience as a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;Product Designer&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;working on digital products&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bajp03&quot; data-start=&quot;1563&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating end-to-end product thinking, from discovery to execution, with measurable user and business impact&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sjzpj&quot; data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;Experience designing for complex digital products across web and\/or mobile platforms&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;57f6gg&quot; data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;1884&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of interaction design, usability, accessibility, and visual design principles&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xa0ht1&quot; data-start=&quot;1885&quot; data-end=&quot;2003&quot;&gt;Experience using qualitative and quantitative data to identify opportunities, inform decisions, and measure outcomes&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vy16en&quot; data-start=&quot;2004&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, collaboration, and facilitation skills, with experience working in cross-functional teams&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1si12v9&quot; data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot;&gt;A critical eye for high-quality design and a passion for continuously improving the user experience&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hgdojy&quot; data-start=&quot;2223&quot; data-end=&quot;2316&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring less experienced designers and contributing to a strong design culture&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19zf298&quot; data-start=&quot;2317&quot; data-end=&quot;2453&quot;&gt;Experience defining product goals, identifying opportunities, and making design decisions that balance user needs with business impact&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A culture of growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we\u2019re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we\u2019re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you\u2019ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/autoscout24\/senior-product-designer-261733","tags":["Product & Design"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1785563706},{"slug":"teamleiter-vorarbeiter-bruterei-wiesenena-334371","company_name":"Wimex-Gruppe","title":"Teamleiter \/ Vorarbeiter Br\u00fcterei (m\/w\/d)","description":"<p><em><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Die Wimex Group ist ein familiengef\u00fchrtes Unternehmen in der Landwirtschaft, das seit 1985 kontinuierlich w\u00e4chst und nachhaltig wirtschaftet. Als mittelst\u00e4ndischer Betrieb verbinden wir Tradition mit Innovation und setzen auf zukunftsorientierte Technologien, um hochwertige Produkte auf den Markt zu bringen.<\/span><\/em><\/p><p><em><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Bei uns finden Sie nicht nur einen Job, sondern eine Aufgabe mit Sinn, ein starkes Team und die M\u00f6glichkeit, wirklich etwas zu bewegen.<\/span><\/em><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Wir suchen ab sofort&nbsp;f\u00fcr unseren Standort in Wiesenena&nbsp;mehrere Teamleiter\/ Vorarbeiter Br\u00fcterei (m\/w\/d).<\/span><br><\/p><h3><strong>Ihr Aufgabengebiet:<\/strong><\/h3><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Anleitung und Unterst\u00fctzung des Teams bei den t\u00e4glichen Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufen<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Sicherstellung der Einhaltung von Hygiene- und Qualit\u00e4tsvorgaben<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Mitarbeit bei der Optimierung von Prozessen und Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufen<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Dokumentation und Berichterstattung an die Betriebsleitung<\/span><\/p><p style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><\/li><\/ul> <br> <h3><strong>Ihr Profil:<\/strong><\/h3><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Erfahrung im Umgang mit Mitarbeitern w\u00fcnschenswert<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Verantwortungsvoller Umgang mit Tieren<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Kommunikationsst\u00e4rke und eine sorgf\u00e4ltige Arbeitsweise<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Gute Deutschkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><h3><strong>Wir bieten Ihnen:<\/strong><\/h3><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Einen langfristigen Arbeitsplatz in einer krisensicheren Branche<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Eine individuelle Einarbeitung und eine leistungsgerechte Bezahlung<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Verantwortungsvolle Aufgaben und kurze Entscheidungswege<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Rabatte in Online-Shops und Filialen bekannter Marken \u00fcber unsere Corporate Benefits<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Job-Bike Leasing, Mitarbeiterveranstaltungen und ein Mitarbeiterempfehlungsprogramm<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Haben wir Ihr Interesse geweckt? Dann bewerben Sie sich ganz unkompliziert \u00fcber den \"Bewerben\" Button oder per Mail an:<\/span><\/p><p><a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" ----- ----- style=\"font-size:1.1em\">F\u00fcr mehr Informationen besuchen sie gern unsere Webseite:<\/span><\/p><p><a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/www.wimex-group.com\/\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">https:\/\/www.wimex-group.com\/<\/span><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/wimex-gruppe\/teamleiter-vorarbeiter-bruterei-wiesenena-334371","tags":["Cobb Germany Avimex GmbH"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Wiesenena, Sachsen, Deutschland","created_at":1785562237},{"slug":"feldbau-manager-teamleiter-pflanzenproduktion-kothen-anhalt-ot-arensdorf-127592","company_name":"Wimex-Gruppe","title":"Feldbau Manager \/ Teamleiter Pflanzenproduktion (m\/w\/d)","description":"<p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Von Radieschen bis M\u00f6hren: Auf unseren gro\u00dfen Anbaufl\u00e4chen am Rande der Magdeburger B\u00f6rde ernten wir j\u00e4hrlich frisches Gem\u00fcse in h\u00f6chster Qualit\u00e4t und beliefern den regionalen Lebensmitteleinzelhandel.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Als Teil der familiengef\u00fchrten Wimex Gruppe wirtschaften wir nachhaltig und innovativ, um eine lebenswerte Zukunft f\u00fcr alle zu schaffen.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Zur Verst\u00e4rkung unseres Teams im Freilandanbau suchen wir Sie als Feldbau Manager \/ Teamleiter Pflanzenproduktion (m\/w\/d).<\/span><\/p><p style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><h3><strong>Ihr Aufgabengebiet:<\/strong><\/h3><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Koordination und Organisation s\u00e4mtlicher Arbeiten in der Pflanzenproduktion<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">F\u00fchrung und Betreuung von Feldbest\u00e4nden<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Planung und \u00dcberwachung von Pflanz-, Pflege- und Erntema\u00dfnahmen<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Fachliche Anleitung und F\u00fchrung von Mitarbeitenden<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Koordination der Arbeitsabl\u00e4ufe im Team<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Einsatz moderner Landtechnik und digitaler L\u00f6sungen<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul> <br> <p style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><h3><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Ihr Profil:<\/span><\/strong><\/h3><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Abgeschlossene Ausbildung im landwirtschaftlichen Bereich, z. B. als Landwirt (m\/w\/d), Landwirtschaftsmeister (m\/w\/d) oder vergleichbare Qualifikation<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Praxiserfahrung in der Pflanzenproduktion und Bestandsf\u00fchrung<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Erste F\u00fcrhrungserfahrung und Freude an der Arbeit mit Menschen<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Verantwortungsbewusstsein und selbstst\u00e4ndige Arbeitsweise<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Technisches Verst\u00e4ndnis und sicherer Umgang mit moderner Landtechnik<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">F\u00fchrerschein der Klasse B und T<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\"><br><\/span><\/p><h3><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Wir bieten Ihnen:<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\"><br><\/span><\/h3><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Einen vielseitigen und verantwortungsvollen Arbeitsplatz<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Eine langfristige und sichere Perspektive in einem zukunftsorientierten Unternehmen<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Eine gute Erreichbarkeit des Arbeitsplatzes<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Rabatte in Online-Shops und Filialen bekannter Marken \u00fcber unsere Corporate Benefits<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Job-Bike Leasing, Mitarbeiterveranstaltungen und ein Mitarbeiterempfehlungsprogramm<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">Haben wir Ihr Interesse geweckt? Dann bewerben Sie sich ganz unkompliziert \u00fcber den \"Bewerben\" Button oder per WhatsApp.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\">F\u00fcr weitere Infos besuchen Sie gern unsere Internetseite:<\/span><a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/karriere.wimex-group.com\/\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1em\"><br><\/span><\/a><a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/www.wimex-group.com\/\">https:\/\/www.wimex-group.com\/<\/a><\/p><p><a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/boerdegarten.de\/\">https:\/\/boerdegarten.de\/<\/a><\/p><p><strong><br><\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\">Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/wimex-gruppe\/feldbau-manager-teamleiter-pflanzenproduktion-kothen-anhalt-ot-arensdorf-127592","tags":["B\u00f6rdegarten Gem\u00fcse GmbH & Co. KG"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"K\u00f6then (Anhalt) OT Arensdorf, Sachsen-Anhalt, Deutschland","created_at":1785562237},{"slug":"working-student-legal-all-genders-berlin-469680","company_name":"Q Energy","title":"Working Student Legal (all genders)","description":"<p>Q\u202fENERGY is Europe\u2019s 360\u00b0 green energy company. Together with our more than 500 employees we develop, build, and manage renewable energy assets across the entire value chain of large-scale renewable energy projects \u2013 from solar, to onshore wind and offshore wind, to energy storage and hybrid power plants. With a pipeline of more than 16 GW we are among the leading renewable energy companies in Europe. We are always on the lookout for people who want to work with us to empower a sustainable world with green energy.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Join us on our exciting journey and contribute to making a lasting difference to our planet.<\/strong><\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>You will support corporate housekeeping activities, including maintaining updated registries, creating SPVs, managing organizational charts, entity lists, and Excel files for asset management.<\/li><li>You will assist in business development by preparing retransfer contracts, updating legal templates, and conducting legal research as needed.<\/li><li>You will help managing invoice processes such as engaging law firms, coordinating signatures for engagement letters and contracts, facilitating internal processes for approvals, award analysis, and collaborating with Finance, Treasury, and IT departments.<\/li><li>You will prepare and dispatch documents for signatures, ensuring coordination and alignment with other paralegals.<\/li><li>You will provide general legal support through contract assistance, vendor communication, and ongoing legal research.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Requirements<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>You are an enrolled student (m\/f\/d) in the field of Law related studies or equal and still studying for at least 12 months<\/li><li>It's a plus, if you have a first relevant experience to the position<\/li><li>You have good MS Office skills<\/li><li>You are&nbsp;business fluent in <strong>English and German <\/strong> <\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/p><p>We offer an hourly salary of 15\u20ac for Bachelor and 17\u20ac for Master students. <\/p><p>Additionally, we off the following benefits: <\/p><p><\/p><ul><li> <strong>Our workplace: <\/strong>Located in a modern and sustainable office building just a few steps from S\u00fcdkreuz station, making it easily accessible for all employees.<\/li><li> <strong>IT Equipment:<\/strong> We\u2019ll set you up with a laptop, monitor, headphones, and, if needed, a company phone.<\/li><li> <strong>Work-Life Balance: <\/strong>we value your personal time. Enjoy the flexibility to choose your work hours, so you can prioritize what matters most\u2014whether it\u2019s attending a workout class, handling personal matters, or starting your weekend a little earlier. You\u2019re in control.<\/li><li> <strong>Mobile Working: <\/strong>At Q ENERGY we offer a hybrid work model: three days in the office and two days of mobile working. This setup supports in-person teamwork while also allowing for more flexibility and reduced commuting.<\/li><li> <strong>Spendit Card:<\/strong> \u20ac25 monthly allowance on top of your monthly salary, which can be used for your daily lunch or can be saved up unlimitedly.<\/li><li> <strong>Public Transport Allowance:<\/strong> Enjoy a \u20ac15 monthly contribution to your BVG ticket\u2014making your commute easier and more affordable!<\/li><li> <strong>Generous Vacation Policy:<\/strong> Enjoy a well-deserved break and take 31 vacation days a year to relax, recharge, and explore!<\/li><li> <strong>Onboarding:<\/strong> We provide a detailed onboarding process to ensure you have a smooth and successful start with us, helping you feel supported and prepared from day one.<\/li><li> <strong>Pension Plan:<\/strong> We contribute \u20ac13.29 each month to your pension.<\/li><li> <strong>Corporate Discounts:<\/strong> Employees get access to exclusive offers and discounts for various brands through our Corporate Benefits program.<\/li><li> <strong>Corporate Health Management: <\/strong>Prioritize your well-being with our corporate health management program, including preventive check-ups to keep you at your best!<\/li><li> <strong>Mutual support:<\/strong>\u202f You\u2019ll thrive in a supportive environment where open communication, teamwork, and knowledge sharing are highly valued. We\u2019re committed to your growth, encouraging your professional and personal development through ongoing support and guidance.<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p><strong>Would you like to become part of Q ENERGY?<\/strong> <\/p><p>Then we look forward to receiving your application. Please let us know your salary expectations and your earliest possible starting date. <\/p><p>Please note: We do not accept applications by email. Please use the \"Apply now\" button for your application. Thank you very much! <\/p><p>If you have any questions, please contact our recruiting team: ----- <\/p><p>Q ENERGY is an internationally operating company - at our company, people from many nations, cultures, and locations work together in partnership and exchange their experiences and values with each other in an open and collegial manner.<\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/jobs\/companies\/q-energy\/working-student-legal-all-genders-berlin-469680","tags":["Legal"],"job_types":["Part time"],"location":"Berlin, Germany","created_at":1785561627},{"slug":"business-strategist-uk-london-134610","company_name":"Comand Ai","title":"Business Strategist - UK","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comand AI's mission is to deliver the next-generation of software to the European defense.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">From the very identification of the capacities that need building to their actual delivery within the hands of our forces, achieving our objective means finding the narrow ways through complex legacy environments, dense ecosystems, concrete partnership engagements.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for a Business Strategist to build Comand AI\u2019s presence from the ground up. You will identify the right entry points, build trusted relationships across the defense ecosystem, and create the path from first operational engagement to pilot and contract. Working closely with product and forward deployed teams, you\u2019ll turn operational proof into commercial traction and establish Comand AI as a trusted partner in the market.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What this looks like in practice:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build Comand AI\u2019s presence in your market: identify the right units, partners, champions, and procurement pathways, then own the journey from first engagement through experimentation, pilot, and contract<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identify and shape strategic opportunities before formal procurement, positioning Comand AI where operational needs emerge<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build and maintain trusted relationships across the defense ecosystem, from operational units to industrial partners and government stakeholders<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Navigate long, politically sensitive B2G sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders, security clearances, RFIs, RFPs, and public procurement rules<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Translate Prevail\u2019s technical capabilities into language that resonates with procurement officers, general staffs, and program leads<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work closely with the founders, product, and forward deployed teams to turn field validation into commercial traction<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate with a Europe-wide team to unlock strategic opportunities with armed forces, partners, and defense organizations<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>Who We're Looking For<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Must-have:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience selling into armed forces, ministries of defense, or another highly regulated B2G market with long sales cycles<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A top performing history on your sales team and a clear track record of two or three large-size deals you personally closed<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable building a pipeline and a market from close to zero, without a playbook handed to you<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Technical curiosity and the ability to understand complex software products well enough to translate them into operational and commercial value<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Empathy for military users and their mission<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">EU citizenship (contractual requirement tied to our defense contracts)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fluency in the local language of the market you're covering, plus English<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Nice to have:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Existing relationships inside defense ministries, armed forces, or NATO-adjacent institutions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Prior experience at a defense tech or dual-use startup<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Background in the military or a related government role<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>What's In It For You<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Competitive package (top 0.1% of compensation in Europe: base + equity)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Paris-based with field travel to active deployment areas<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>The Process<\/h2><ol style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talent screening<\/strong>: 30 min, online. Background and motivation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Role screening<\/strong>: 60 min, online.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Onsite in Paris<\/strong>: half day.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Roundtable<\/strong>: hiring committee.<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>How to Apply<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">If this sounds like a good fit, we\u2019d love to hear from you. Apply using the link above.<\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/comand-ai\/business-strategist-uk-london-134610","tags":["Business Development"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664929},{"slug":"deployment-strategist-uk-london-106892","company_name":"Comand Ai","title":"Deployment Strategist - UK","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comand AI's mission is to deliver the next-generation of software to the European defense.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Bringing defense software to real operators on the field is no common challenge. Constraints include custom infrastructure, no internet access, frugal equipment and the highest security standards.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for a Deployment Strategist to own the implementation of our software, from the navigation through the most sensitive organisations in Europe to the delivery of a production-ready solution.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will find units and champions to collaborate with, understand their workflows and constraints to maximize the value delivered through our software Prevail.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will then run the deployment: onboarding, operational support, feedback capture, and iteration planning with product and engineering. You will work in close collaboration with a Business Strategist to expand Comand\u2019s footprint within your geography.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What this looks like in practice:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identify and secure design partners: a unit and a champion who will give candid feedback and help validate a real operational workflow<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Decompose that workflow into something that drives real user value, building on the current stage of our product<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work in close collaboration with a Business Strategist to design the right project path to delivery.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own the deployment end-to-end: onboarding, operational support, feedback capture and synthesis, and iteration planning with product and engineering<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Translate field signal for the product team: turn qualitative feedback into clear next steps, reduce noise, increase signal<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate with a Europe-wide team to unlock large opportunities with forces, partners or organizations<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>Who We're Looking For<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Must-have:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Senior-level experience leading ambiguous, high-stakes deployments or field rollouts abroad, where adoption mattered more than the demo \u2014 this isn't a first field role<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to build deep trust with external stakeholders quickly<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to translate messy, real-world feedback into clear product signal<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable pushing back, resolving conflict, and driving alignment without formal authority<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong operational judgment and discipline with sensitive information<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">EU citizenship (contractual requirement tied to our defense contracts)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Willingness to deploy into active theatres, including Ukraine, and to operate under real operational security constraints<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Nice to have:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in defense, public sector, crisis response, or another high-trust operational context<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working cross-culturally, with constrained communications or logistics<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>What's In It For You<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Competitive package (top 0.1% of compensation in Europe: base + equity)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Paris-based with field travel to active deployment areas<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>The Process<\/h2><ol style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talent screening<\/strong>: 30 min, online. Background and motivation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Technical screening<\/strong>: 60 min, online. How you'd structure an ambiguous deployment and build trust with a skeptical unit.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Onsite in Paris<\/strong>: half day. Case-style decomposition and a short presentation of past work.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Roundtable<\/strong>: hiring committee.<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>How to Apply<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Reach out to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" ---------- or <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" ---------- style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Tell us who you are and why now.<\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/comand-ai\/deployment-strategist-uk-london-106892","tags":["Business Development"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664929},{"slug":"programme-coordinator-london-69713","company_name":"Founders Factory","title":"Programme Coordinator","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As we scale the Founders Factory model across new sectors and internationally we are seeking an enthusiastic, self-starter to help us manage the delivery of our programmes and events. This role will sit at the centre of our Studio and Accelerator operations, supporting ventures and their founders as they move through our programmes. You'll be responsible for the administrative duties, operations and the execution of the program once new investments have been made: onboarding new founders, scheduling new programmes, coordinating events, capturing feedback, and monitoring engagement. You will work closely with our Head of Operations and Chief Studio Officer to ensure we are delivering on our offer to founders, tracking against our company-wide objectives, and creating exceptional value for start-ups as they scale.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><u>Programme Delivery<\/u><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will coordinate the day-to-day running of our Studio and Accelerator programmes: scheduling meetings, tracking notes, and sharing recordings, consolidating data points<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will help to create a strong culture within our programmes, creating a sense of community across cohorts and founders, ensuring our group communication channels are maintained, helping to drive engagement across programmes and founders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will be responsible for founder onboarding, ensuring they have access to all relevant tooling (including Notion, Slack, and the FF App), connecting founders with the correct team members, and sharing program specific resources.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will set up new cohorts, creating Google Groups, and setting up our FF App for each new programme.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will manage our Founder Perks and Benefits, onboarding new partner offerings and managing outreach to new potential partners.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support and collect feedback that allows us to improve and iterate on our offering and support; setting up relevant 1-1's with founders to learn from their experience working with us and flagging areas for improvement.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Maintain data collection to enable automatic reporting on ventures and programmes, ensuring key company data and feedback is captured and shared via Airtable.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><u>Event Coordination<\/u><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will help plan and coordinate our founder events calendar, including sector\/cohort specific in-person showcases, sponsored alumni socials, virtual fireside chats and panels.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will source suitable event spaces and liaise with the venue stakeholders to ensure all requirements are met for the event, this would include on contracts, payments and on the day logistics<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will manage guest lists for any events, creating event invites using Luma,. , managing attendance and sending relevant communications to stakeholders and guests<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will capture feedback from events and ensure we are measuring impact. You can will then feed any relevant data points in the ongoing development of the events calendar<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Requirements<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be highly organised, data focused, and quick to take action.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be curious about technology and digital tooling, with an interest in AI and automations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be very comfortable with managing databases.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in operations, project management, events, or administrative roles is a plus.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understand and be able to talk about early-stage business development, and having an understanding of what is needed to scale new ventures.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Have exceptional communication and interpersonal skills, both written and verbal.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Have high emotional intelligence and empathy for founders and their team as well as for your fellow colleagues in the Founders Factory team.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role would suit a recent university graduate or someone with between 1 and 3 years experience - who wants to work in a fast paced tech environment.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><hr><p>Compensation: \u00a325K \u2013 \u00a335K<\/p><ul><li> \u2022 \u00a325K \u2013 \u00a335K<\/li><\/ul><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/founders-factory\/programme-coordinator-london-69713","tags":["FF Operations"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664924},{"slug":"venture-builder-healthtech-london-477287","company_name":"Founders Factory","title":"Venture Builder | HealthTech (London)","description":"<h3><strong>\ud83d\udc4b Hey, we're Founders Factory<\/strong><\/h3><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Founders Factory builds and funds startups together with exceptional entrepreneurs and the world's leading companies. Headquartered in London and operating globally, Founders Factory backs visionary founders with capital, dedicated support from a team of expert operators, and unrivalled access to a coalition of industry leading corporate partners. Since 2015, FF has backed 450+ portfolio companies helping them to secure over 500 enterprise pilots with blue chip corporate partners such as Aviva, Northwestern Medicine, Johnson &amp; Johnson Innovation, and HSBC.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Opportunity:<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Health systems globally are burdened by capacity constraints, rising chronic disease, aging populations, and escalating operational costs. Care delivery models built around physical hospitals are increasingly unsustainable. Advances in connected devices, remote diagnostics, and AI-enabled monitoring now make it possible to safely move large parts of care beyond hospital walls while improving outcomes and patient experience.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The big promise of technology in this space is to enable continuous, proactive, and lower cost care particularly across long-term condition management or home-based \/ community care while allowing scarce clinical resources to focus where they matter most.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for exceptional Venture Builders who are passionate about building the future of healthcare delivery.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><h3>\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Who are we looking for?<\/strong><\/h3><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Venture Builder, you specialise in taking ideas from zero to venture-backable businesses. You work closely with founders to shape strategy, validate problem spaces, build MVPs, and find early product market fit. This is a hands on, high ownership role. You\u2019ll operate across product, design, growth and tech, moving fast, making decisions, and focusing relentlessly on what creates the most leverage at each stage of a venture. You have a varied skill set and will have demonstrated an interest in tech and entrepreneurship. You will be an advocate for FF\u2019s values and mission and be committed to supporting founders. You are opinionated but evidence led, creative but commercial, and comfortable operating in ambiguity. You care deeply about building products people actually want and businesses that can scale.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>Please note that we are looking for someone who is available for an initial 6 month contract with possible extension or full-time employment. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">\ud83d\udcaa <strong>Your responsibilities<\/strong>:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Owning the end-to-end early build: from problem definition and MVP scoping through to shipping, testing, and iteration<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Getting products into users hands fast, using lean, experimental approaches to validate assumptions and generate learning<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Shaping the customer experience and product vision, balancing user needs with commercial and technical realities<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Working closely with founders to challenge thinking, sharpen focus, and drive momentum, especially when things feel unclear or uncomfortable<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Helping ventures progress through studio stage gates, supporting founders towards strong, evidence-backed IC decisions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Spotting opportunities early by staying close to market dynamics, emerging tech, and real user behaviour<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Communicating clearly and regularly, sharing progress, learnings, trade-offs, and recommendations with founders and the wider studio<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h3>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Required skills, experience and mindset:<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated 0\u21921 experience in digital health or medtech, whether at a startup, through a side project, research, or volunteering (experience applying AI or developing innovative health\/medical devices are considered highly advantageous). <\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Driving momentum by subscribing to lean methodologies and an experimental approach, you prioritise speed, learning, and focus over perfection<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable wearing multiple hats (product, design, tech, growth) and knowing when to pull in specialist support<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong technical mindset, with the ability to build no-code \/ low-code solutions, prototypes, or proofs of concept to accelerate validation<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Commercially curious with the ability to think about ICPs, value propositions, pricing hypotheses, and early GTM alongside product<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Communicating your ideas, progress and learnings to the team, seeking feedback when needed.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable setting expectations and ways of working with founders, and maintaining strong, honest working relationships<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h3>\ud83d\udc4c <strong>We value people who:<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Thrive in ambiguity and enjoy solving messy problems<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Quick thinking and intuition, someone who can balance creativity with objective data<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A passion for creating products people love, caring about product performance is key<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The ability to adapt and operate in an ambiguous environment<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable with taking calculated risks and learning fast<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Wanting to continuously improve your skills and productivity, challenging yourself when you can<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong leadership that drives outcomes<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Being approachable and optimistic<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>\ud83d\udeab What this role is not<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Not a pure designer or engineer<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Not a consultant writing decks from the sidelines<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Not a 9\u20135 role<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is about building, deciding, testing, and moving. This is a fast-moving venture studio environment where momentum matters and timelines can be intense at key moments<\/p><h3><\/h3><h3><\/h3><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/founders-factory\/venture-builder-healthtech-london-477287","tags":["FF Operations"],"job_types":["Contract"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664924},{"slug":"remote-sales-operations-associate-emea-12180","company_name":"Tenex","title":"Sales Operations Associate-EMEA","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Sales Operations Associate \u2014 EMEA<br \/><br \/><strong>Location:<\/strong> United Kingdom (London)<br \/><strong>Employment Type:<\/strong> Full time<br \/><strong>Location Type:<\/strong> On-site \/ Hybrid<br \/><strong>Department:<\/strong> G&amp;A<br \/><br \/><br \/>About the Opportunity<br \/><br \/><strong>Company Overview:<\/strong><br \/>TENEX is an AI-native, automation-first, built-for-scale Managed Detection and Response (MDR) provider. We are a force multiplier for defenders, helping organizations enhance their cybersecurity posture through advanced threat detection, rapid response, and continuous protection. Our team is composed of industry experts with deep experience in cybersecurity, automation and AI-driven solutions. Backed by leading investors, we are rapidly growing and seeking top talent to join our mission of revolutionizing the AI-Native MDR landscape.<br \/><br \/><br \/>We're a fast growing startup backed by industry experts and top tier investors led by Crosspoint Capital Partners and also backed by Shield Capital, DTCP (formerly Deutsche Telekom Capital Partners), Deepwork Capital, and the Florida Opportunity Fund. Seed round led by Andreessen Horowitz (a16z). As an early employee, you'll play a meaningful role in defining and building our culture in the region. Get in on the ground floor of TENEX's EMEA build-out \u2014 we're a small but well-funded team that just raised a substantial round, and joining now comes with limited risk and unlimited upside.<br \/><br \/><br \/>TENEX is scaling its EMEA go-to-market motion, and the regional field team needs an operational backbone. This role keeps the EMEA revenue engine running \u2014 clean CRM data, tight reporting, airtight Google and Microsoft partner registrations, and fast-moving paperwork across a multi-country, multi-currency region \u2014 so reps and channel partners can spend their time selling.<br \/><br \/><br \/>What You'll Do<br \/><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Sales support.<\/strong> Serve as the operational backbone for the EMEA field team \u2014 keep CRM hygiene tight, own reporting and dashboards, and free reps to focus on selling across the region's four pods (EU North, EU Central, EU South, MEA).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Google &amp; Microsoft deal registrations.<\/strong> Own the full registration workflow across Google Deal Reg, Services Reg, and Co-sell, and the equivalent Microsoft Partner Center deal registration process, so every TENEX opportunity is properly registered and protected with both hyperscaler partners. Directly tied to revenue and partner credit.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Partner &amp; channel operations.<\/strong> Support the EMEA Premier MSP and distributor network \u2014 managing distribution and omni-channel pipeline visibility, partner deal registration, and two-tier discount administration so channel deals move cleanly from registration to close.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>SOW support.<\/strong> Work with sales and delivery to build and turn around accurate SOWs so deals don't stall on paperwork, including region-specific contracting requirements.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Deal &amp; lead flow.<\/strong> Drive opportunities through the pipeline from first touch to close \u2014 managing lead routing, handoffs, and making sure nothing falls through the cracks across direct and partner-sourced pipeline.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Salesforce reporting &amp; operations.<\/strong> Own campaign management, forecast reporting, executive dashboards, and activity reporting in SFDC, giving EMEA leadership a clean, real-time view of pipeline and performance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>GTM campaign &amp; marketing operations support.<\/strong> Work alongside the TENEX Marketing team to collate GTM campaign performance, reporting, and ROI tracking \u2014 connecting marketing-sourced pipeline back to revenue outcomes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>EMEA dashboard reporting.<\/strong> Own and maintain EMEA dashboard reporting for the EMEA SVP, ensuring regional metrics roll up cleanly into TENEX's Global reporting tools and stay aligned with HQ standards.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Deal desk \/ pricing &amp; CPQ (future).<\/strong> Help manage pricing and discount approvals, support the deal desk, and assist with contract and CPQ work so quotes go out accurately and on time. <em>(This becomes active once CPQ is in place \u2014 noted as future scope.)<\/em><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><br \/>What You Bring<br \/><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">2+ years in sales operations, revenue operations, deal desk, or a comparable GTM support role \u2014 ideally within an EMEA or other multi-country remit.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on Salesforce experience, including campaign management, forecast reporting, executive dashboards, and activity reporting, with a bias for clean data.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with Google Cloud and\/or Microsoft partner programs, including deal registration and co-sell processes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposure to partner\/channel operations \u2014 distribution management and omni-channel pipeline tracking across direct and indirect routes to market.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfort building and maintaining executive-level dashboard reporting, including rolling regional metrics up into a global reporting framework.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong organization and follow-through \u2014 you own workflows end to end and nothing slips.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfort working cross-functionally with sales, delivery, and partners under deadline pressure, across time zones and languages.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><br \/>Bonus Points<br \/><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with Google Cloud partner programs (Deal Reg, Co-sell) or another hyperscaler partner ecosystem, alongside Microsoft Partner Center \/ deal registration.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with EMEA contracting considerations (GDPR\/DPA requirements, multi-currency quoting, distributor and MSA agreements).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposure to CPQ tooling and contract\/SOW processes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Cybersecurity or B2B SaaS background.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><br \/>Education &amp; Certifications<br \/><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Bachelor's in Business, Finance, Information Systems, or a related field (or equivalent experience).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Salesforce Administrator or similar a plus.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/tenex\/remote-sales-operations-associate-emea-12180","tags":["EMEA"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote-United Kingdom","created_at":1785664920},{"slug":"member-of-technical-staff-devops-platform-engineer-london-221832","company_name":"Ineffable","title":"Member of Technical Staff (DevOps \/ Platform Engineer)","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are recruiting a DevOps \/ Platform Engineer to join us in our London office.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Our mission is to <strong>make first contact with superintelligence.<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are creating a superlearner that discovers all knowledge from its own experience, from elementary motor skills through to profound intellectual breakthroughs. This superlearning capability - the ability to endlessly discover knowledge and skills, without relying on human data - will be driven by the world\u2019s most powerful reinforcement learning algorithms.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The superlearner is expected to rediscover and then transcend the greatest inventions in human history, such as language, science, mathematics and technology. If successful, this will represent a scientific breakthrough of comparable magnitude to Darwin: where his law explained all life, our law will explain and build all intelligence.<br \/><br \/><strong>Role brief<\/strong><br \/><br \/>As a foundational hire on the platform team, you'll be joining at a point where individual decisions shape how the platform is designed, not just maintained. This isn't a role where you inherit someone else's architecture, you'll be one of the people defining it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're pushing these learning methods to a scale that hasn\u2019t been tried before and we care deeply about the infrastructure that gets us there. You'll own the infrastructure that the mission depends on; keeping large-scale GPU compute reliable, developer environments fast and the whole platform humming.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is an opportunity for someone who wants to be a part of defining a new paradigm in AI and wants their work to directly speed up the experimentation and progress of our ambitious research.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a broad role, and the list below is non-exhaustive. You\u2019ll be empowered to shape the role how you\u2019d like in order to best enable our mission.<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Kubernetes and containers: <\/strong>manage clusters and deploy internal tools<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>GPU scheduling at scale<\/strong>: hands-on with tools like KAI scheduler and Kueue to keep thousands of GPUs busy and productive<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Making large-scale infrastructure resilient: <\/strong>get to the root of hardware failures and cluster-scale chaos, building the systems that prevent them from recurring<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Cloud infrastructure:<\/strong> experience on Google Cloud and other major providers<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Observability that actually helps:<\/strong> log management and monitoring with tools like QuickWit, Grafana or Datadog<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Developer environments people love:<\/strong> tooling like Tailscale, Workbrew and dev containers that make everyone's day-to-day faster<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Clean, well-crafted code:<\/strong> e.g. Python and Rust for tools and infrastructure that are a joy to build on<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We move fast, give people real ownership and trust engineers to make good judgment calls. We are a team that cares as much about doing this well as doing it fast.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">If you're interested in joining Ineffable and think your skills would be better suited to a different position please express your interest to the Member of Technical Staff position. <br \/><br \/><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/ineffable\/member-of-technical-staff-devops-platform-engineer-london-221832","tags":["Technical Staff"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664917},{"slug":"staff-product-designer-london-237981","company_name":"Fleek","title":"Staff Product Designer","description":"<h1>Can you help us fix the world's most broken supply chain?<\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill, not because people don't want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. <strong>Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice.<\/strong> We're building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade, through a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort, an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill and tripled in size year-on-year. We've raised ~$50M from a16z, Y Combinator, HV Capital, and others, and have recently closed our Series B. Our advisors and private investors include operators behind Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who want to build something that matters, and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1>About the Role<\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're hiring a Staff level Product Designer to join our design team, reporting directly to Miles Norris, VP Product &amp; Design. You'll own real surface area from day one across a product spanning four surfaces: our customer app, supplier app, website, and internal tools. Working alongside and directly with the VP and founders, with no management layers in between.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The design problem here is unusually good. Fleek is a mobile-first B2B marketplace that has to behave like a consumer app. Design is a named differentiator bet in an AI-first company and this role leads that bet at the craft level, shipping exceptional end-product experiences while building the AI-first design system that engineers and agents will build from.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is an individual contributor role at Staff or Principal level, explicitly not a Head of or manager role. We're looking for someone who has genuinely crossed the line from owning the craft of a surface to setting the bar across a product area and coaching it into others.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1>What You'll Do<\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Set the craft bar:<\/strong> own the design bar across a priority product area, deliver quickly while holding a high bar, intervene when the bar slips and coach craft into others.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Unblock product delivery:<\/strong> take a priority surface off the bottleneck, clear the design work blocking its PMs and establish a reliable design-review rhythm with product and engineering.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build the AI-first design system:<\/strong> own the design system end to end and establish its governance, so consistency scales across surfaces and engineers and agents can pull from it in agentic workflows.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Lead discovery:<\/strong> drive the research cadence, get in front of customers directly, prototype as a way of asking questions and shape product direction through design insight with strong PM support around you.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Design for a multi-sided marketplace:<\/strong> hold buyer, supplier and ops experiences at once with mobile-heavy, consumer-grade craft across every surface.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Own end to end:<\/strong> discovery, interaction, visual, prototyping and engineering handoff, with the technical fluency to understand how your design decisions land in the architecture and codebase.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Raise the whole team:<\/strong> partner fluently with PMs and engineers, and lift the craft of the designers around you so the bar rises beyond your own surfaces.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h1>What You Bring<\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Exceptional craft and execution.<\/strong> Mobile-heavy, consumer-grade design at the highest level, delivered fast, with a portfolio of real-world product work that evidences your skills.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Worked design-systems experience.<\/strong> You've built and governed a design system in production, not just contributed components to one. This is a primary signal for us.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>An AI-first mindset.<\/strong> You use AI instinctively in your own workflow and you're excited to design the system layer that AI agents will build product from.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>End-to-end ownership.<\/strong> Discovery, interaction design, visual design, prototyping and engineering handoff, with fluent PM and engineering partnership throughout.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Genuine Staff\/Principal altitude.<\/strong> You've worked as part of a product design team (not a career solo designer), you set the bar across an area rather than a single surface, and you've raised other designers' skill level.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Proven business impact.<\/strong> A track record of meaningful impact on both the product and the business grounded in first-source customer insight.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>A genuine excitement for making secondhand fashion feel like the best consumer product its users own.<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Nice to Have<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Marketplace or ecommerce experience<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You can code, or you're technically fluent enough to work close to the codebase<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exec-ready communication and experience partnering with founders on longer-term vision<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience designing for mobile-only users in emerging markets<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h1>What You'll Get<\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Competitive salary plus performance bonus<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Generous equity: being on Fleek means you'll own a part of it<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comprehensive healthcare coverage<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A collaborative team in a lovely office in the heart of East London<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Access to founders. We're a small team and they're heavily involved (and good fun!)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exclusive employee discounts to buy on Fleek<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Access to borrow any item from our collection of vintage and reworks in the office<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A disproportionate level of responsibility and the opportunity to drive massive impact<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How We Work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held. Design works embedded with product and engineering pods, ships on a fast cadence, and reports straight into the VP Product &amp; Design.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Practicalities<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> London HQ, E1, Spitalfields \/ Shoreditch<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work model:<\/strong> On-site, 4 days per week<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stage:<\/strong> Post-Series B, hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Team:<\/strong> 200 across London, India, and Pakistan<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Culture:<\/strong> High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1>Our Values<\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you're building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job isn't done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way:<\/strong> Don't accept anything at face value. Ask questions you don't know the answer to. That's how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer:<\/strong> Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Ready to build the infrastructure for the world's fastest-growing fashion economy? If you want to work on genuinely hard problems, with a world-class team, at a company that's tripling annually, we'd love to hear from you.<\/strong><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/staff-product-designer-london-237981","tags":["Product"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"organic-growth-lead-seo-ai-search-london-67035","company_name":"Fleek","title":"Organic Growth Lead, SEO & AI Search","description":"<h2>Can you help us fix the world's most broken supply chain?<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill, not because people don't want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice. We're building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade, through a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort, an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill while tripling in size year-on-year. We're backed by some of the world's best investors, including a16z, Y Combinator, and HV Capital, alongside world-class angels who helped build Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who want to build something that matters, and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><h2>About the Role<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We treat SEO and AI Search (AEO\/GEO) as one program, and we're hiring the person to own it end to end.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a senior IC role with full channel ownership. You'll be our first and only search expert: you set the strategy, build the pages, and own the number. You'll report into Growth and work alongside performance marketing, influencer and social, engineering, and a CX team sitting on a goldmine of real customer questions.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Organic is already our most efficient acquisition engine. Your job is to scale it, and to make Fleek the answer wherever second hand resellers and retailers search and ask questions, whether that's Google, ChatGPT, Perplexity, or AI Overviews.<\/p><h2>Why This Role Stands Out<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The AI search playbook is being written right now, and almost nobody has run it with a real P&amp;L attached. You'll get to.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is also a builder's role, not a briefer's role. You own the website as a growth surface. You'll design and ship landing pages, and stand up programmatic templates from our own marketplace data. We care more about taste and what you can build than about how many slides you can produce. Engineering works with you on the deep technical lifts, but the day-to-day craft of the site is yours.<\/p><h2>What You'll Own<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The number.<\/strong> New buyers from organic and AI search. You'll be accountable for growing organic at Fleek.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>SEO and AI search strategy (AEO\/GEO).<\/strong> Baseline and grow our share of voice in Google and LLM answers for the head questions we can't own outright (\"best wholesale vintage supplier\", \"is Fleek legit\"). These are won through earned mentions, not your own pages, so you'll build presence across the ecosystem LLMs actually cite: Reddit, YouTube, review sites, and roundups. You'll have our 1,000+ creator roster and UGC engine to deploy.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The website, as a product.<\/strong> You own how the site converts intent into buyers. You'll design and build landing pages, hub-and-spoke topic clusters, and the templates behind our programmatic pages. You're comfortable working directly in the website and shipping changes yourself rather than waiting on a queue. Good design instinct matters here: pages should be fast, clean, and genuinely useful to a savvy reseller.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Content across the full intent curve.<\/strong> Head questions won via citations and UGC. Middle-intent how-to guides (AI-assisted drafts, human-edited). Long-tail programmatic pages generated from our own marketplace data: brand x category x era, per-country shipping and duty pages, vendor pages, and help-centre articles mined from CX tickets. Help centres are an AEO goldmine, and ours is largely untapped.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Technical foundation.<\/strong> Sitemap, schema, product metadata, site speed. You define the roadmap and ship what you can yourself; engineering resource implements the rest with you.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Measurement.<\/strong> Most AI search value is zero-click, so you'll build the instrumentation that keeps the channel honest: share-of-voice tracking on head questions, signup attribution surveys (\"How did you hear about us?\"), and citation and coverage monitoring. You'll report results in our weekly business review, and your work unlocks budget through stage gates, so rigour matters.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2>How You'll Work<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI-forward by default.<\/strong> You use LLMs and agents daily to multiply your output: drafting, research, programmatic content pipelines, monitoring.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Builder, not briefer.<\/strong> You'd rather ship the page than write a brief and wait. You can design something that looks good and works, and you can take a template from idea to hundreds of live pages without tripping quality systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Experiment-driven.<\/strong> Every initiative ships with a hypothesis, a holdout or baseline, and a kill or scale decision. We don't buy \"technical AEO audits\" or llms.txt snake oil, and we expect you to know why. The evidence is clear that most AEO advice drives no impact and that purely AI-generated content ranks worse, so you focus on the small set of things that actually move the number.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Autonomous.<\/strong> There's no SEO expert above you to set direction. You'll get context, data access, engineering support, and budget. The strategy is yours to defend.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2>What We're Looking For<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">5+ years in SEO and organic growth with full ownership of strategy and execution, ideally in a marketplace, e-commerce, or consumer\/SMB-facing business.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A demonstrable track record of growing organic acquisition.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep SEO fundamentals plus a sharp, current point of view on how AI is reshaping discovery, with evidence you've already been testing.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You build, not just brief. You're comfortable designing and shipping landing pages yourself, working directly in a CMS, and you have enough design taste to make pages that look good and convert.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Programmatic SEO experience: you've shipped template-driven pages at scale from structured data and know how to do it without tripping quality systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong analytical fluency: GSC, GA4, Ahrefs\/Semrush or similar; comfortable in spreadsheets and attribution models.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2>This Role Isn't for You If You Want<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">To set strategy from a deck and hand execution to an agency. Here you own the work and the website.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A big SEO team or a senior expert above you to learn from. You are that person.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A channel where traffic is the goal. You'll be measured on buyers and revenue.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">To keep doing classic SEO and treat AI search as a side project. The two are one program here.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fully remote work. This team is in London 4 days per week.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2>The Practicalities<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> London HQ, Commercial St, E1 (Liverpool St \/ Aldgate East)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work model:<\/strong> Hybrid, 4 days per week on-site<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stage:<\/strong> Post-Series B, hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Team:<\/strong> 100+ across London, India, and Pakistan<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Reports to:<\/strong> Growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Culture:<\/strong> High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2>Why People Join Fleek<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The problem is real:<\/strong> 9 million items saved from landfill since 2022. Your work has tangible, measurable impact.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The AI is genuinely novel:<\/strong> FleekSort is an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, turning an opaque manual trade into a structured global inventory layer. This isn't a GPT wrapper.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The growth is exceptional:<\/strong> Tripling year-on-year, ~$50M raised, Series B closed. Backed by a16z, Y Combinator, HV Capital, with advisors from Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The timing is perfect:<\/strong> The secondhand market is projected to reach $350B by 2027. You're catching a wave, and the AI search playbook is being written right now.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>You'll have real ownership:<\/strong> 100-person company, no bureaucracy. You'll own a channel end to end and see the impact of your work immediately.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2>Our Values<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you're building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job isn't done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way:<\/strong> Don't accept anything at face value. Ask questions you don't know the answer to. That's how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer:<\/strong> Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ready to make Fleek the answer wherever resellers ask? If you want to own a channel end to end, build the AI search playbook with a real P&amp;L attached, and see your wins in the company numbers within weeks, we'd love to hear from you.<\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/organic-growth-lead-seo-ai-search-london-67035","tags":["Marketing"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"full-stack-ai-builder-london-367","company_name":"Fleek","title":"Full Stack AI Builder","description":"<h1><strong>Can you help us fix the world's most broken supply chain?<\/strong><\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill, not because people don't want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice. We're building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade, through a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort, an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill while tripling in size year-on-year. We're backed by some of the world's best investors, including a16z, Y Combinator, and HV Capital, alongside world-class angels who helped build Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who want to build something that matters, and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for a deeply technical, hands-on Full-Stack Builder to embed across our AI and operations pods, building the agents, internal tools, and infrastructure that run Fleek end-to-end.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will work alongside our CTO and Head of AI, jumping between teams to ship the systems that compound: agentic workflows that automate manual ops, internal tools that make every team 10x faster, and the connective tissue between our marketplace, our data, and our AI models. One week you might be building a sourcing agent for the commercial team. The next, productionising an integration with our warehouse partners. The next, hardening FleekOS \u2014 our internal operating system \u2014 so the next thing we build on it lasts.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is the role for someone who has shipped real systems for 3-4 years, is bored of building the same thing in slightly different shapes at a big company, and wants range, ownership, and proximity to the part of AI that's actually useful right now: production agentic infrastructure inside a real business with real revenue.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>What Makes You a Fleek Builder?<\/strong><\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Full-Stack in the Real Sense: <\/strong>You move comfortably across the stack. Backend services, frontend interfaces, integrations, data pipelines, and AI\/agent infrastructure. You have favourite tools but no religion about them.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI-Native:<\/strong> You use AI as your default toolkit, not a curiosity. You have built with LLMs in production, understand how agents actually work and break, and know the difference between a demo and a system that survives contact with real users.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Builder Mindset:<\/strong> You ship. You prefer working code over perfect plans, and you know how to scope something to ship this week rather than next quarter. You have opinions about what's worth abstracting and what isn't.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Pod-Hopper:<\/strong> You get energy from context-switching between problems. One week customs and ops, the next merchant tooling, the next internal infrastructure. You see the through-line.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Commercially Wired:<\/strong> You connect what you build to business outcomes. You can tell a good idea from a real one because you understand who the user is and what changes for them.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Comfortable with Ambiguity:<\/strong> Fleek is being built in real time. Specs are loose, the data is messy, and the right answer often isn't written down. You thrive there.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Action-Oriented Communicator:<\/strong> You translate technical decisions into \"here is what we should do and why.\" Your teammates never have to guess what you're doing or what the trade-offs were.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Startup Pace:<\/strong> You have worked somewhere that ships fast and where velocity is a competitive advantage, not a slogan.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>What You'll Do<\/strong><\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build Across Pods:<\/strong> Embed with different teams (commercial, ops, supply, product) to build the tools and agents they need. You are not assigned to one squad. You go where the leverage is.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Ship Production Agents:<\/strong> Design and ship agentic systems that automate real work. Sourcing, classification, customer ops, internal workflows. Things that need to run reliably and not break when the on-call engineer is asleep.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Extend FleekOS:<\/strong> Contribute to and improve our internal operating system, the platform every team uses to build their own tools. Make it more reliable, more extensible, easier for non-engineers to build on top of.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Own End-to-End:<\/strong> Take features from \"someone mentioned a problem in Slack\" through scoping, building, shipping, and iterating. You own the outcome, not just the code.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Maintain What You Build: <\/strong>Treat reliability and maintainability as first-class. The reason this role exists is that things built without engineering rigour don't last. Yours will.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Use AI to Move Faster:<\/strong> Automate your own workflows, speed up your own analysis, and ship more in a week than most engineers ship in a month. Live the 10x-er pitch we make to candidates.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stay Ahead:<\/strong> Track what's actually working in agent infra, internal tooling, and AI-native development. Turn new ideas into production systems before they become trend pieces.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>What You Bring<\/strong><\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>3-5 years of professional engineering experience. <\/strong>You have shipped production systems and learned what breaks. You are not a junior, but you are still hungry to learn fast.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Strong full-stack chops.<\/strong> Comfortable across backend, frontend, and the glue in between. Specific languages matter less than the ability to pick up new ones quickly.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Hands-on experience building with AI.<\/strong> Production work with LLMs, agents, retrieval, or AI-driven features. Not theoretical.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Startup or scale-up experience. <\/strong>You have worked somewhere with fast cycles, evolving infrastructure, and high ownership. Or you have built your own thing and shipped it.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>A bias toward shipping. <\/strong>You finish what you start, and you know how to make something good enough to ship rather than perfect and unshipped.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>Nice to Have<\/strong><\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with TypeScript, Python, and modern frontend frameworks (React, Next.js)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with data warehousing tools (BigQuery, Snowflake, dbt) and event pipelines<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience building internal tools or developer platforms<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Open source contributions or a public portfolio of side projects<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Background in B2B SaaS, marketplace, or supply chain products<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ready to build the systems that run one of the fastest-growing marketplaces in Europe? If you want range, ownership, and a front-row seat to AI-native infrastructure in production, we would love to hear from you.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>How We Work<\/strong><\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is an in-office company. We believe the best work happens when people are together, the quick decisions, the cross-functional energy, the ability to solve problems in real time. Most of the team works from our London HQ 4-5 days a week.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>The Practicalities<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Location: London HQ, Commercial St, E1 (Liverpool St \/ Aldgate)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work model: In-office, typically 4-5 days per week.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Stage: Post-Series B, hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Team: 100+ across London, India, and Pakistan (~20 in London office)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Culture: High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>Our Values<\/strong><\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you are building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job is not done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way: <\/strong>Do not accept anything at face value. Ask questions you do not know the answer to. That is how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer: <\/strong>Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><hr><p>Compensation: \u00a365K \u2013 \u00a375K \u2022 0.03% \u2013 0.05%<\/p><ul><li> \u2022 Annual base \u00a365K \u2013 \u00a375K \u2022 0.03% \u2013 0.05%<\/li><\/ul><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/full-stack-ai-builder-london-367","tags":["Technology"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"ex-yc-founder-london-390859","company_name":"Fleek","title":"Ex-YC Founder","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Reality check:<\/strong> Something didn't work out? We get it. We're looking for founders who still have that fire and want to join something that's still early but some things are already working.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Opportunity:<\/strong> We serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We've raised over $50M from a16z, Y Combinator, Burda Principal Investments, HV Capital, and others, and have recently closed our Series B. Our advisors and private investors include operators behind Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>We are expecting that you:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ran a YC company (obviously)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Know what worked and what didn't<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Still want to build something massive<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Care about applying AI for good for this world<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Can wear multiple hats<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understand both technical and business sides<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're hosting our first-ever hackathon in partnership with <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"e6012927 ae0be087\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/a16z\/\"><strong>Andreessen Horowitz<\/strong><\/a>!<br \/><br \/>On Saturday, 11th July, we're opening the Fleek HQ doors in London for a one-day sprint to build the AI that makes circular fashion operate at scale. RSVP HERE: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/luma.com\/usntwjdw\"><strong>https:\/\/luma.com\/usntwjdw<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/ex-yc-founder-london-390859","tags":["Technology"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"vp-people-london-493966","company_name":"Fleek","title":"VP People","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Can you help us fix the world's most broken supply chain?<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill, not because people don't want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice. We're building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade, through a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort, an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill and tripled in size year-on-year. We've raised ~$50M from a16z, Y Combinator, Burda Principal Investments, HV Capital, and others, and have recently closed our Series B. Our advisors and private investors include operators behind Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who want to build something that matters, and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">At Fleek, People is a growth function. The companies that win over the next decade will be the ones that figure out what it means to build, develop, and retain exceptional teams in an era where every employee is AI-enabled, where a single person can do what used to take five, and where the relationship between a company and its people is being fundamentally rewritten.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We don't think the old playbooks apply. Compensation, performance management, ways of working, career development, org design: versions of all of these exist, but they were built for a different era. At Fleek, they need to be reconceptualised from scratch for an AI-native company operating across three countries at speed.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You'll be building a globally connected People function from a standing start: the operating system that connects London, Karachi, and Bangalore, the frameworks that make every person at Fleek the best version of themselves, and the thinking that defines what a people function even looks like when AI changes everything about how we work.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role reports directly to Abhi Arora, Co-Founder and CEO, and sits on the senior leadership team.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What You'll Own<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design and implement Fleek's operating system: ways of working, communication architecture, and decision-making frameworks across London, Karachi, Bangalore and beyond<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build the people function: org design, levelling, compensation philosophy, performance management, and the full employee lifecycle<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own talent density: set the hiring bar, invest in development, and build performance standards that make every person at Fleek a 10x version of themselves<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive cultural coherence across three geographies with different working norms, expectations, and communication styles<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coach the founding team on people decisions, organisational design, and leadership development<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build an AI-native people function: use AI to create leverage across every people process rather than scaling headcount<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Close compliance and risk gaps across multiple jurisdictions that currently create founder exposure (supported by HR specialists in region)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Set the company's operating cadence: the rituals, rhythms, and communication patterns that keep a fast-moving distributed team aligned<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Who We're Looking For<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">7+ years of operating experience (Ops, Commercial, Product, Strategy etc) with a minimum of 2-3 years in a people function<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Non-traditional people background: strategy, operations, consulting, or general management with a deliberate pivot into people leadership<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Has built something from genuine zero, not improved an inherited function or optimised an existing team<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience operating across multiple geographies and cultures<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Has stayed at companies long enough to see the consequences of their people decisions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Can hold their own with founders: a coach and thought partner, not a service provider<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Deeply analytical:<\/strong> data-driven decision making is second nature<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Insatiably curious:<\/strong> you're constantly learning about new tools, approaches, and ways of building organisations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Hungry and ambitious:<\/strong> you're driven to build something exceptional, not maintain something adequate<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Change agent:<\/strong> you've driven transformation in previous organisations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Hands-on and scrappy:<\/strong> you're not afraid to roll up your sleeves and build it yourself<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How We Work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>Fleek is an in-office company. We believe the best work happens when people are together, the quick decisions, the cross-functional energy, the ability to solve problems in real time. Most of the team works from our London HQ 3-4 days a week.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We're not prescriptive about it. Performance and trust matter more than attendance. We hire adults and treat them accordingly.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Practicalities<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> London HQ, Shoreditch<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work model:<\/strong> In Person, with trust based flexibility.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stage:<\/strong> Post-Series B, hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Team:<\/strong> 100+ across London, India, and Pakistan (~20 in London office)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Our Values<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/strong><\/em><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you're building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job isn't done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way:<\/strong> Don't accept anything at face value. Ask questions you don't know the answer to. That's how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer:<\/strong> Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/vp-people-london-493966","tags":["People"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"commercial-director-london-146716","company_name":"Fleek","title":"Commercial Director","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Can you help us fix the world's most broken supply chain?<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill, not because people don't want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice. We're building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade: a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort, an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill while tripling in size year-on-year. We're backed by some of the world's best investors, including a16z, Y Combinator, and HV Capital, alongside world-class angels who helped build Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who want to build something that matters, and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is seeking a senior Commercial Director to lead the pivotal, demand-side revenue function, overseeing the acquisition and retention of its broad customer base. This is a genuine zero-to-one opportunity to build and scale a modern sales organization that blends traditional relationship management with cutting-edge AI automation. The Commercial Director will report directly to co-Founder Abhi Arora, and be the most senior sales\/revenue role in the business.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You'll be taking ownership of customers spending \u00a310K-\u00a3100K+ monthly on Fleek's groundbreaking platform, building systematic processes where currently ad-hoc approaches exist, and creating the playbook a modern, scaled commercial team operating in an AI-first world.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>This role sits at the intersection of Fleek's evolving product strategy and its revenue engine. As Fleek transitions toward piece-level inventory and AI-enabled supply infrastructure, the Director of Commercial will be responsible for translating new product capabilities into scalable demand. This includes shaping sales and retention motions around new product primitives, defining how high-value buyers interact with a more dynamic and automated marketplace, and ensuring commercial growth scales in line with supply, unit economics, and operational realities.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What You'll Own<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead the commercial team (~8 people across new business and account management functions)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build the new business growth engine: create repeatable sales motions to drive top-of-funnel growth for high-value customers<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive retention strategy for the best-performing customer cohort (currently at 3x higher retention than other segments)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own key customer relationships and escalations (currently handled by the CEO)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design and implement AI\/agentic workflows to scale commercial operations without proportionally scaling headcount<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Upskill and potentially expand the team with a focus on data-driven, tech-savvy commercial Talent<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Who We're Looking For<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Commercial management experience leading sales, account management, or revenue teams in a very high-growth environment<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Marketplace experience (B2B or B2C), ideally from a fast-paced, metrics-driven environment<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Expertise using data and metrics to support all key functional decisions and build business cases cross-functionally. You should live and breathe contribution margins, unit economics, ROI, and daily metrics<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Zero-to-one builder: you've built sales functions or commercial processes from scratch<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong relationship management: proven ability to build trust with and manage enterprise\/high-value customer relationships over an extended period of time<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Deeply analytical:<\/strong> data-driven decision making is second nature<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Insatiably curious:<\/strong> you're constantly learning about new tools, approaches, and market changes<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Hungry and ambitious:<\/strong> you're driven to stay relevant and push boundaries<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Change agent:<\/strong> you've driven transformation in previous organizations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Hands-on and scrappy:<\/strong> you're not afraid to roll up your sleeves and do the work yourself<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Highly Desirable<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A passion for AI\/agentic platforms: you've: already adapted commercial processes to leverage AI\/automation for increased efficiency and accuracy<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Marketplace unit economics expertise: deep understanding of two-sided marketplace dynamics<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">B2B2C background: experience serving both business customers and end consumers<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Entrepreneurial background: experience in startups or high-growth scale-ups with a strong performance culture<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How We Work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>Fleek is an in-office company. We believe the best work happens when people are together: the quick decisions, the cross-functional energy, the ability to solve problems in real time. Most of the team works from our London HQ 3\u20134 days a week.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We're not prescriptive about it. Performance and trust matter more than attendance. We hire adults and treat them accordingly.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Practicalities<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> London HQ, Commercial St, E1 (Liverpool St \/ Aldgate East)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work model:<\/strong> In-office, typically 3\u20134 days per week.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stage:<\/strong> Post-Series B, hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Team:<\/strong> 100+ across London, India, and Pakistan (~20 in London office)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Visa:<\/strong> Unable to sponsor visas for this role<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Culture:<\/strong> High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Our Values<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/strong><\/em><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you're building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job isn't done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way:<\/strong> Don't accept anything at face value. Ask questions you don't know the answer to. That's how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer:<\/strong> Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/commercial-director-london-146716","tags":["Commercial"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"vp-finance-london-120975","company_name":"Fleek","title":"VP Finance","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Can you help us fix the world\u2019s most broken supply chain?<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill \u2014 not because people don\u2019t want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice. We\u2019re building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade \u2014 through a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort \u2014 an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion \u2014 that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill while tripling in size year-on-year. We're backed by some of the world's best investors, including a16z, Y Combinator, and HV Capital, alongside world-class angels who helped build Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We\u2019re looking for people who want to build something that matters \u2014 and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The VP Finance will be a core part of Fleek\u2019s leadership team, responsible for bringing financial discipline into the business to ready it for further rapid scale. This finance leader will build on and professionalise Fleek\u2019s finance operations, thinking commercially across the business, and supporting on future fundraising.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What you\u2019ll Own<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Building, leading and developing Fleek\u2019s finance function globally<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Owning company-wide financial planning and analysis, cash flow forecasting, and budgeting<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Instilling rigorous financial controls, hygiene, and compliance in a rapidly scaling organisation<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Driving strategy alongside the founders by turning financial data into decision-making tools<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Building the best payment experience for Fleek\u2019s retailers and suppliers,<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Maintaining a strong bottom-line and financial stability for the business<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Leading and growing finance teams in Pakistan (fin-ops), India (accounting\/reporting), and UK (commercial finance)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Supporting future fundraising efforts and investor relations<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Who We\u2019re Looking For<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in scaling the financial function from Series A through to Series C stage (or beyond)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands on leadership in finance strategy, controls, and operations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to hire and retain world-class talent<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated ability to set up and scale core finance processes<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong understanding of long cash cycles, forecasting, and working capital<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Global finance experience - managing cross-border payments and multi-currency operations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fintech knowledge beneficial (especially around credit, payment processing)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong commercial and product instincts - viewing Finance as a growth function<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Previous experience in supporting on fundraising<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Startup mentality and intellectual curiosity - thriving in high autonomy and ambition environments<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Deeply analytical<\/strong>: data-driven decision making is second nature<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Insatiably curious:<\/strong> you're constantly learning about new tools, approaches, and market changes<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Hungry and ambitious:<\/strong> you're driven to stay relevant and push boundaries<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Change agent:<\/strong> you've driven transformation in previous organizations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Hands-on:<\/strong> you're not afraid to roll up your sleeves and do the work yourself<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How We Work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>Fleek is an in-office company. We believe the best work happens when people are together \u2014 the quick decisions, the cross-functional energy, the ability to solve problems in real time. Most of the team works from our London HQ 4 days a week.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re not prescriptive about it. Performance and trust matter more than attendance. For your first six months, we\u2019ll ask you to prioritise being in the office, to learn the business, build relationships, and get up to speed. After that, you\u2019ll have genuine flexibility to manage your own time. We hire adults and treat them accordingly.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Practicalities<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> London HQ \u2014 Heneage Street, E1 (Shoreditch \/ Aldgate East)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work model:<\/strong> In Person, with trust based flexibility<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stage:<\/strong> Post-Series B, hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Team:<\/strong> 100+ across London, India, and Pakistan (~20 in London office)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Culture:<\/strong> High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Our Values<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/strong><\/em><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you\u2019re building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job isn\u2019t done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way:<\/strong> Don\u2019t accept anything at face value. Ask questions you don\u2019t know the answer to. That\u2019s how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer:<\/strong> Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/vp-finance-london-120975","tags":["Finance"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"account-executive-london-479691","company_name":"Fleek","title":"Account Executive","description":"<h2><strong>Can you help us fix the world's most broken supply chain?<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill, not because people don't want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice. We're building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade, through a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort, an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill while tripling in size year-on-year. We're backed by some of the world's best investors, including a16z, Y Combinator, and HV Capital, alongside world-class angels who helped build Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who want to build something that matters, and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for an Account Executive to help define and then execute how we acquire our largest customers for the marketplace.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You'll need a genuine interest in fashion, bonus for secondhand and vintage, and the role centres on driving sales with vintage enterprises, brick and mortar stores, and resellers through visiting their stores, calling, emailing, understanding their needs, and building strong relationships.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The ideal candidate brings an entrepreneurial, creative approach to sales and relationship building. You'll be given a disproportionate level of responsibility and the opportunity to drive massive impact in this next phase of growth.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>What You'll Do<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Acquire Key Accounts:<\/strong> Identify, prospect, and close Fleek's largest marketplace customers, vintage enterprises, retail stores, and high-volume resellers.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build Relationships:<\/strong> Visit stores, get on calls, and build deep relationships with buyers. Understand their needs, pain points, and buying behaviour.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Define the Playbook:<\/strong> Help shape how Fleek acquires large customers. You're not just executing a sales process, you're building it.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build an AI-Enabled Sales Engine:<\/strong> Work alongside our tech team to build AI-enabled and automated outreach and new business workflows.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Drive Revenue:<\/strong> Own and exceed targets. Take a proactive approach to pipeline building across online and offline channels.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Collaborate Across Teams:<\/strong> Work cross-functionally with product, operations, and marketing to feed customer insights back into the business and improve the platform.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>What You Bring<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>2+ years of experience in a commercial role at an early-stage startup.<\/strong> You've sold in fast-moving environments where the playbook didn't exist yet.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Familiarity with online and offline sales and outreach channels.<\/strong> You know how to prospect, nurture, and close across multiple touchpoints.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Experience or appetite to build AI-enabled sales workflows<\/strong> alongside our tech team. You're excited about using AI to scale outreach and automate the new business engine.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Strong interpersonal and communication skills.<\/strong> You build and maintain relationships naturally. You're comfortable on the phone, in person, and in a cold outreach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Self-motivated and entrepreneurial.<\/strong> You take a proactive approach to driving sales and consistently over-achieve against targets.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth mindset.<\/strong> You're ambitious, constantly learning, and always looking to improve your processes and systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Collaborative.<\/strong> You work well across teams and time zones, we have teams in 5+ countries.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Nice to Have<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A genuine interest in fashion, secondhand, or vintage<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience selling to SMBs, retailers, or marketplace participants<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with CRM tools and sales automation platforms<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>How We Work<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is an in-office company. We believe the best work happens when people are together: the quick decisions, the cross-functional energy, the ability to solve problems in real time. Most of the team works from our London HQ 4\u20135 days a week.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're not prescriptive about it. Performance and trust matter more than attendance. We hire adults and treat them accordingly.<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> London HQ, Heneage Street, E1 (Shoreditch \/ Aldgate East)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work model:<\/strong> In-office, typically 4\u20135 days per week.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stage:<\/strong> Hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Team:<\/strong> 100+ across London, India, and Pakistan<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Culture:<\/strong> High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Our Values<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you're building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job isn't done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way:<\/strong> Don't accept anything at face value. Ask questions you don't know the answer to. That's how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer:<\/strong> Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/account-executive-london-479691","tags":["Commercial"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"gtm-engineer-london-103712","company_name":"Fleek","title":"GTM Engineer","description":"<h1>Can you help us fix the world's most broken supply chain?<\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill, not because people don't want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. <strong>Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice.<\/strong> We're building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade, through a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort, an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill and tripled in size year-on-year. We've raised ~$50M from a16z, Y Combinator, HV Capital, and others, and have recently closed our Series B. Our advisors and private investors include operators behind Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who want to build something that matters, and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1>About the Role<\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You'll join our GTM Acquisition team (new business) as our first GTM Engineer, reporting to our GTM lead. Your job is to build and scale the infrastructure we use to acquire the two kinds of customer we serve: online resellers (Depop, Vinted, Whatnot, eBay, Instagram shops) and physical vintage shops, from Brick Lane to Paris to New York.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, acquisition is manual and unscalable. This role exists to fix that. You'll build the custom tooling that turns one-off outreach into a repeatable engine: lead scraping, enrichment, outreach automation, sequencing, lead scoring, and honest funnel tracking, connected into our commercial operating system and the handoff to account management. The target is not incremental: we want this engine to take us to 500+ reseller closures.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a hybrid role for a rare profile: part sales engineer, part AI\/automation builder. You take a problem, build something repeatable that handles it, ideally something an agent could run, then move on, rather than doing the same thing by hand every week.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1>What You'll Do<\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build the acquisition engine:<\/strong> design and ship the end-to-end system that sources, enriches, qualifies, and contacts prospects across both customer segments, replacing manual prospecting with repeatable infrastructure.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Automate sourcing and enrichment:<\/strong> build scrapers and enrichment pipelines across eBay, Depop, Vinted, Whatnot, and Instagram that surface qualified prospects with real signals: item volume, platform, geo, estimated spend, and store maturity.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Engineer outreach at scale:<\/strong> build multi-channel sequences (email, Instagram DM, WhatsApp, calls) that are personalised systematically by AI, not sprayed or hand-cranked, and designed around real constraints like Instagram's ~40 DMs per day cap.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Own the funnel:<\/strong> model and instrument every stage from sourced to reachable to contacted to replied to qualified to booked, with honest conversion assumptions, and use the data to decide where the engine leaks and what to fix next.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Design for two very different channels:<\/strong> online resellers are mostly Instagram-only, while physical shops have full contact details and can be grouped by city for visits. You'll build distinct playbooks for each and decide where AI does the work versus a person.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build agents, not processes:<\/strong> wherever a workflow repeats, turn it into something an agent can run: qualification against ICP signals, first-touch personalisation, reply handling, dedupe, and CRM hygiene.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Scale without quality dropping:<\/strong> take the engine from 50 prospects to 30,000, choosing the channels and tooling that keep personalisation and targeting sharp as volume grows.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Connect acquisition to the business:<\/strong> integrate the engine with our commercial operating system and the account management handoff, so closed customers land cleanly and nothing falls through the cracks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1>What You Bring<\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>You've built these systems before.<\/strong> Scrapers, enrichment pipelines, outreach automation, lead scoring: you can point to acquisition or GTM tooling you've actually shipped and run, not just configured.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>An AI-first mindset.<\/strong> You use AI heavily and honestly across your work, can show the prompt or automation behind it, and know where it speeds you up and where it gets in the way.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Commercial judgment.<\/strong> You think in ICPs, tiers, and funnels. You can define qualifying signals and disqualifiers, commit to a segment, and write copy that reads like a real operator.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>B2B GTM experience.<\/strong> You understand new business acquisition and have worked with or built enterprise GTM tooling: CRMs, sequencers, enrichment stacks.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Independent problem solving.<\/strong> You take an ambiguous problem, make opinionated calls, and ship a working system without waiting for a spec. You're a builder, not a tool configurator.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Funnel rigor.<\/strong> You track honest metrics, make sensible conversion assumptions, and know where your funnel leaks. One segment fully worked beats 500 sprayed contacts.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>A genuine excitement for building acquisition infrastructure from scratch in a category that didn't exist three years ago.<\/strong> <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Nice to Have<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience selling to or building for marketplaces, resellers, or independent retail<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Founder or early-startup experience where you owned growth end to end<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with the secondhand or vintage fashion world<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience running multi-channel outbound under platform constraints (DM caps, deliverability, warm-up)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h1>What You'll Get<\/h1><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Competitive salary plus performance bonus tied to qualified pipeline<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Generous equity: being on Fleek means you'll own a part of it<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comprehensive healthcare coverage<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A collaborative team in a lovely office in the heart of East London<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Access to founders. We're a small team and they're heavily involved (and good fun!)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exclusive employee discounts to buy on Fleek<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Access to borrow any item from our collection of vintage and reworks in the office<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A disproportionate level of responsibility and the opportunity to drive massive impact<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How We Work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held. You'll work embedded with the GTM team, ship quickly, and see the impact of your work in the pipeline within days, not quarters.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Practicalities<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> London HQ, E1, Spitalfields \/ Shoreditch<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work model:<\/strong> In Person, with trust based flexibility<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stage:<\/strong> Post-Series B, hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Team:<\/strong> 100+ across London, India, and Pakistan<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Culture:<\/strong> High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Success Metrics<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>First 30 days:<\/strong> a working acquisition engine for one segment: sharp ICP, sourced and enriched target list, live sequences, and an instrumented funnel.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>3 months:<\/strong> both segments (online resellers and physical shops) running on distinct playbooks, with the boring parts (sourcing, enrichment, dedupe, logging) fully automated.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>6 months:<\/strong> the engine scaled toward tens of thousands of prospects without quality dropping, integrated with our commercial operating system and the AM handoff.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>12 months:<\/strong> the engine is the backbone of new business at Fleek, on track to 500+ closures, with agents running the repeatable work and you focused on optimisation.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h1>Our Values<\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you're building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job isn't done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way:<\/strong> Don't accept anything at face value. Ask questions you don't know the answer to. That's how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer:<\/strong> Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Ready to build the infrastructure for the world's fastest-growing fashion economy? If you want to work on genuinely hard problems, with a world-class team, at a company that's tripling annually, we'd love to hear from you.<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/gtm-engineer-london-103712","tags":["Commercial"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"full-stack-finance-builder-london-114665","company_name":"Fleek","title":"Full Stack Finance Builder","description":"<h2><strong>Can you help us fix the world's most broken supply chain?<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill, not because people don't want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. <strong>Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice.<\/strong> We're building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade, through a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort, an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill and tripled in size year-on-year. We've raised ~$50M from a16z, Y Combinator, HV Capital, and others, and have recently closed our Series B. Our advisors and private investors include operators behind Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who want to build something that matters, and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We\u2019re hiring a Full Stack Finance Builder to sit at the intersection of finance, product and engineering. This person will help Fleek automate finance workflows and accounting logic by turning business events into clean system behaviour, integrations and ledger outputs. It\u2019s an unusually cross-functional role for someone who likes building real systems, not just analysing them.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Why This Role Stands Out<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is not a standard finance systems role, and it\u2019s not a standard software role either. The challenge is to understand how Fleek\u2019s business actually works, how order states change, how cash moves, how capital gets allocated and then encode that into finance automation. That means building the connective tissue between the product, the data and the accounting layer.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What makes the role special is the blend. You need enough technical ability to build, enough product sense to understand what should happen and enough finance context to map business events into accounting outcomes. If you enjoy operating across domains and solving messy operational problems with systems, this is a rare opportunity to do it with real ownership.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>What Makes You a Fleek <\/strong><em><strong>Full Stack Finance Builder<\/strong><\/em><strong>?<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Technical First:<\/strong> You\u2019re a builder at heart. You\u2019re comfortable shipping integrations, stitching systems together and using code or automation to remove manual finance work.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Product-Minded:<\/strong> You don\u2019t just build what\u2019s asked. You want to understand the business event, the user flow and the operational edge cases before deciding what the right solution is.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Finance-Literate:<\/strong> You don\u2019t need to be a career accountant, but concepts like ledgers, chart of accounts and accounting entries are familiar enough that you can build with confidence.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Data-Driven:<\/strong> You like working from underlying system logic and operational events not hand-wavy process maps.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Cross-Functional by Default:<\/strong> You enjoy working across finance, product and engineering and you\u2019re energised by roles that don\u2019t fit neatly into one box.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>What You'll Do<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Automate Financial Reporting:<\/strong> Build systems that translate business events into financial reporting<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build Integrations:<\/strong> Connect Fleek\u2019s internal systems and databases with tools to reduce manual workflows and improve finance accuracy.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Map Business Events to Ledger Outcomes:<\/strong> Help define which events in the business should trigger which accounting entries and make that logic operational.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work Across Functions:<\/strong> Partner with finance, product and technical stakeholders to understand the current state and build better system behaviour.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Improve the Finance Stack:<\/strong> Reduce dependence on manual workarounds by creating scalable finance infrastructure that grows with the business.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>What You Bring<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong technical building ability; this is the top priority for the role<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Product and data acumen; the ability to understand what should be built, not just how to build it<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Enough finance knowledge to understand ledgers, chart of accounts and accounting entries<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience building integrations, internal tools, automations or systems that connect operational workflows to finance or data outputs<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfort working across multiple teams and disciplines<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in fintech, finance tooling or operational systems is a plus<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience deploying AI agents or similar automation tooling is a plus<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A background that blends finance with product or technical work is especially attractive<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A genuine excitement for solving messy business problems with systems, automation and first-principles thinking.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Ready to build the infrastructure for the world's fastest-growing fashion economy? If you want to work on genuinely hard problems, with a world-class team, at a company that's tripling annually, we'd love to hear from you.<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Practicalities<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> London HQ, E1, Spitalfields \/ Shoreditch<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work model:<\/strong> In Person, with trust based flexibility<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stage:<\/strong> Post-Series B, hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Team:<\/strong> 100+ across London, India, and Pakistan<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Culture:<\/strong> High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>What's In It for You?<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Fleek is building the technology infrastructure for a $350 billion market that has never been digitised. Joining now means you'll be part of the team that defines how the secondhand economy works, at scale, globally.<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Why people join Fleek<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The problem is real:<\/strong> 9 million items saved from landfill since 2022. 17,400 tonnes of CO\u2082 avoided. Your work has tangible, measurable impact.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The AI is genuinely novel:<\/strong> FleekSort is the world's first LLM fine-tuned on secondhand fashion. This isn't a GPT wrapper, it's a proprietary model solving classification problems that don't exist anywhere else.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The growth is exceptional:<\/strong> tripling annually, backed by a16z, Y Combinator, HV Capital and others.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The timing is perfect:<\/strong> EU regulation is mandating the infrastructure Fleek builds. The secondhand market is growing 3x faster than new fashion. You're catching a wave.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>You'll have real ownership:<\/strong> 100-person company, no bureaucracy. You'll shape decisions and see the impact of your work immediately.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Equity \/ share options<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Pension<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Private health benefits<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learning and development budget<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Team socials and offsites<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>Our Values<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/strong><\/em><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you're building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job isn't done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way:<\/strong> Don't accept anything at face value. Ask questions you don't know the answer to. That's how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer:<\/strong> Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/full-stack-finance-builder-london-114665","tags":["Finance"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"head-of-controllership-london-66997","company_name":"Fleek","title":"Head of Controllership","description":"<h2><strong>Can you help us fix the world's most broken supply chain?<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The fashion industry produces over 100 billion garments a year. 60% end up in landfill, not because people don't want these clothes, but because the supply chain for getting secondhand fashion from donation to resale is completely offline, manual, and broken.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fleek is fixing this. <strong>Our mission is to make secondhand the first choice.<\/strong> We're building the infrastructure powering the global secondhand clothing trade, through a B2B marketplace and the AI systems digitising the supply chain behind it<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Through Fleek, vintage stores, online resellers, and retail buyers source graded secondhand inventory directly from wholesalers and rag houses across multiple countries. Our key enabler is FleekSort, an AI model fine-tuned on secondhand fashion, that can grade, price, and categorise items with just a photo, turning what has historically been an opaque and manual trade into a structured, searchable, and tradable global inventory layer.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Since 2022, we've saved 9 million items from landfill and tripled in size year-on-year. We've raised ~$50M from a16z, Y Combinator, HV Capital, and others, and have recently closed our Series B. Our advisors and private investors include operators behind Depop, Shopify, and Postmates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, we serve thousands of resellers and retailers across the UK, Europe, and the US. With the secondhand fashion market projected to reach $350B by 2027, Fleek is building the AI-native operational and financial backbone for secondhand commerce globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who want to build something that matters, and move fast doing it. Sound good? Keep reading.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We\u2019re hiring a Controller to build the next layer of Fleek\u2019s finance function. This is a senior individual contributor role sitting within Finance, focused on creating a scalable controllership foundation in a business that has grown fast and now needs stronger process, rhythm, and control. You\u2019ll work closely with leadership and cross-functional teams to design how accounting should operate as Fleek scales.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Why This Role Stands Out<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">At most companies, a Controller steps into an established finance function and improves it incrementally. At Fleek, you\u2019ll be doing something much more interesting: building controllership in a company where the business has real scale and complexity, but parts of the accounting operating model still need to be designed from the ground up. In practice, that means you won\u2019t just maintain processes, you\u2019ll challenge them, rebuild them and create the operating cadence the company grows into.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is especially compelling for someone who has seen what \u201cgood\u201d looks like in a larger or more mature environment, but also knows how to operate in the messiness of an early-stage company. Some systems already exist here. Some may need to be rethought entirely. The opportunity is to bring judgment, structure, and momentum to help establish the finance discipline that underpins the next phase of Fleek\u2019s growth.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>What Makes You a Fleek <\/strong><em><strong>Controller<\/strong><\/em><strong>?<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Builder Mentality:<\/strong> You don\u2019t just inherit processes, you redesign them when they\u2019re not fit for purpose. You\u2019re excited by the idea of creating a controllership function, not just running one.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Comfortable with Ambiguity:<\/strong> You know how to operate when the company isn\u2019t at zero-to-one, but the finance function partly is. Existing processes don\u2019t intimidate you, even when they need to be torn down and rebuilt.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High Agency:<\/strong> You don\u2019t wait for perfect alignment or clean inputs. You can drive an agenda, create momentum and push important operational changes through the organisation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Influence Through Credibility:<\/strong> You can create buy-in outside finance, whether that\u2019s around month-end discipline, information flows or better controls. People trust your judgment because it\u2019s practical and grounded.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Scale-Informed:<\/strong> You\u2019ve seen systems and accounting environments at scale, and you know how to apply that pattern recognition without becoming rigid or over-engineered.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>What You'll Do<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build the Controllership Foundation:<\/strong> Design and establish the accounting processes, controls, and operating rhythm Fleek needs for its next phase of scale.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Redesign What Doesn\u2019t Work:<\/strong> Assess existing systems and workflows, identify where they break down, and rebuild them where needed rather than patching around weak foundations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Own the Month-End Operating Cadence:<\/strong> Create a cleaner month-end close rhythm across finance and partner teams, including stronger deadlines, accountability and information flow.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Drive Cross-Functional Discipline:<\/strong> Work with teams outside finance to improve the quality, timeliness, and consistency of inputs into the accounting process.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring Scale to an Early-Stage Environment:<\/strong> Use your experience from larger or more mature organisations to help Fleek build a finance function that is robust without becoming bureaucratic.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>What You Bring<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">An accounting qualification such as <strong>CA, CCA, or CPA<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in scaled environments, such as MNCs, big tech, or similarly mature operating environments<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience building accounting systems or processes from scratch, not just operating within established ones<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Early-stage company exposure, even if your role there was not the most senior finance role<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong stakeholder management and the ability to drive change outside the finance team<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Good judgment on where to add structure versus where to stay lightweight<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Remote or distributed team experience is a plus<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Multi-entity experience is a plus<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A data-driven or product-adjacent mindset is a plus<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A genuine excitement for building something from scratch inside a fast-growing company.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Ready to build the infrastructure for the world's fastest-growing fashion economy? If you want to work on genuinely hard problems, with a world-class team, at a company that's tripling annually, we'd love to hear from you.<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Practicalities<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> London HQ, E1, Spitalfields \/ Shoreditch<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Work model:<\/strong> In Person, with trust based flexibility<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stage:<\/strong> Post-Series B, hyper-growth<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Team:<\/strong> 100+ across London, India and Pakistan<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Culture:<\/strong> High ownership, non-hierarchical, fast-moving. Founder-led with strong opinions loosely held.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>What's In It for You?<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Fleek is building the technology infrastructure for a $350 billion market that has never been digitised. Joining now means you'll be part of the team that defines how the secondhand economy works, at scale, globally.<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Why people join Fleek<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The problem is real:<\/strong> 9 million items saved from landfill since 2022. 17,400 tonnes of CO\u2082 avoided. Your work has tangible, measurable impact.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The AI is genuinely novel:<\/strong> FleekSort is the world's first LLM fine-tuned on secondhand fashion. This isn't a GPT wrapper, it's a proprietary model solving classification problems that don't exist anywhere else.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The growth is exceptional:<\/strong> tripling annually, backed by a16z, Y Combinator, HV Capital and others.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The timing is perfect:<\/strong> EU regulation is mandating the infrastructure Fleek builds. The secondhand market is growing 3x faster than new fashion. You're catching a wave.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>You'll have real ownership:<\/strong> 100-person company, no bureaucracy. You'll shape decisions and see the impact of your work immediately.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Equity \/ share options<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Pension<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Private health benefits<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Learning and development budget<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Team socials and offsites<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>Our Values<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Five values shape how we work at Fleek:<\/strong><\/em><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dream Big and Disrupt Yourself:<\/strong> Push the most ambitious version of what you're building. Step out of your comfort zone. Nothing is out of reach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Absolute Ownership:<\/strong> The buck stops with you. Drive initiatives to completion. Experiment, learn, persevere. The job isn't done until the job is done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity Leads the Way:<\/strong> Don't accept anything at face value. Ask questions you don't know the answer to. That's how you innovate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Talk to the Customer:<\/strong> Deeply understand their challenges, motivations, and ambitions. Every decision starts with the customer at the centre.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Embrace Diversity:<\/strong> A global team building for a global supply chain. Bring your authentic self and embrace the diversity of everyone you encounter.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/fleek\/head-of-controllership-london-66997","tags":["Finance"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664913},{"slug":"senior-product-manager-fincrime-london-108920","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Product Manager, Fincrime","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>About the team<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You'll join the Financial Crime product team within our Risk and Compliance domain \u2014 the team that decides who Checkout does business with and protects the company and our merchants from money laundering and other financial crime. We build the transaction monitoring, sanctions and screening technology behind those decisions. You'll own transaction monitoring, backed by a dedicated team of five engineers.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>The role<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Reporting to our Group Product Manager, you'll own the roadmap for our anti-money-laundering (AML) transaction monitoring. The systems that spot suspicious payment patterns and stop our platform being used to launder money. We recently brought this engine fully in-house, so there's real control and a lot still to build: sharper detection, far fewer false positives, and better tools for our investigation teams. It's an internal-facing product where the impact is measured, not cosmetic.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What you'll do<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own the transaction monitoring roadmap end to end. From detection rules that flag suspicious patterns to the tooling our investigation agents rely on.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive down false positives at scale by combining rules logic and LLMs, without losing genuine risk coverage.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Partner closely with your engineering team, Compliance and Risk to ship and iterate on a maturing in-house platform.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Navigate a fast-moving, still-maturing compliance environment. Pushing technical and organisational change forward without losing momentum.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>What success looks like<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You've reduced the manual workload sent to L1 investigation agents<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You've brought false-positive rates down, while increasing the share of risky patterns we detect.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You've matured the in-house monitoring engine and become the trusted owner of this product area across the business.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Skills and experience<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven product management experience shipping data-driven or risk products, ideally in fintech, payments or another regulated, fast-moving environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A strong grasp of risk, false positives and operational monitoring workflows, with the analytical instinct to reason about detection and trade-offs.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfort working hand-in-hand with engineering to build and iterate on core backend platforms.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Resilience and influence: you keep driving change constructively when processes are imperfect or ambiguous.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You use data, insights and machine learning or LLM models to set priorities and improve performance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You communicate clearly, simplifying complex concepts for engineering, compliance, operations and commercial audiences.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We don't expect every box ticked. If you meet most of these and are excited by the mission, we'd love to hear from you.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Nice to have<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Direct experience in financial crime, AML transaction monitoring or sanctions and screening.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposure to LLM-driven detection or automation in a risk or fraud context.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience scaling risk products into new segments such as SMB, consumer or crypto.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-product-manager-fincrime-london-108920","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"commercial-data-scientist-london-113599","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Commercial Data Scientist","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Commercial Data Scientist at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, you will be the primary operator of our <strong>Growth Prediction Engine<\/strong>. Your focus will be to maintain and evolve the models that underpin our commercial strategy, working closely with Strategic Finance and Revenue Operations.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The growth forecasting framework is an established roadmap. You will own the execution of these models while working in a shared-delivery model where tasks are distributed across the wider Data Science team.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How You\u2019ll Make an Impact<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Advance our ML-Driven Forecasting:<\/strong> Own, maintain, and continuously enhance our ML-driven revenue growth models. You will be responsible for pushing these models to the next level and proactively expanding their use cases beyond the commercial domain.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Drive Strategic Financial Modeling:<\/strong> Partner with Strategic Finance to build robust projections and simulations based on our forecast model outputs, approaching this with the mindset of building scalable, automated tools rather than just ad-hoc reports.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Unlock Commercial Data Science Applications:<\/strong> Work closely with the Revenue Operations team to identify, unlock, and deploy other high-impact commercial data science applications that increase the quality and utilization of our data.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Champion Best Practices:<\/strong> Lead by example within your team and the broader data community by applying best practices in analytics and machine learning, from data collection to deployment and analysis.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What We\u2019re Looking For<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong proficiency in <strong>SQL and Python<\/strong> with experience building and maintaining predictive models.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Prior experience as a Data Scientist in a commercial set-up, delivering predictive models\/timeseries models to aid sale\/demand forecasting<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with cross-functional partners (Finance, Product, and Ops) to deliver actionable insights.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to explain technical data concepts to non-technical stakeholders clearly and concisely.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Prior experience in a commercial, fintech, or high-growth environment is preferred.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/commercial-data-scientist-london-113599","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"paralegal-commercial-team-london-190151","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Paralegal, Commercial Team","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is seeking a dedicated Commercial Paralegal to join our Legal Team to support its rapid business growth.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You\u2019ll be part of our global Commercial Legal team, a dynamic and innovative team of commercial lawyers with deep payments and technology expertise. You will partner with stakeholders across the business on a broad range of commercial matters globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Contract Negotiation<\/strong> - negotiating commercial agreements (merchant, supplier and partner) and amendments\/accessions, defending Checkout\u2019s playbook positions and collaborating with our team of expert Legal Counsels to accommodate deviations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Commercial Advisory: <\/strong>providing creative and commercially-focussed advisory support to stakeholders across Checkout\u2019s range of commercial matters globally (e.g. Sales, Account Management, Financial Partnerships, Procurement).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Strategic Projects: <\/strong>contributing to Checkout\u2019s strategic expansion projects, building new products and advancing into new territories.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Use of Legal Technology: <\/strong>Adopt and utilise our rapidly developing Legal AI stack (Ironclad, Legora, Glean, Gemini) to support both lawyers and the business team with agent-enabled legal support.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Knowledge Management and Legal Optimisation: <\/strong>Lead on projects to automate, improve and manage team knowledge, playbooks and external legal content. Develop and improve processes\/training to enable Legal and business teams to move faster. Utilise Jira\/Confluence for efficient team work allocation.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Paralegal certificate and\/or Bachelor\u2019s degree from an accredited college or university.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">2 years+ prior in-house experience as a legal professional (e.g. paralegal, legal assistant, contract manager), working in private practice or in-house.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What we're looking for<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working internationally (prior experience in a high-growth Fintech, Technology company or another fast-paced, dynamic environment would be a plus).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated experience of using enterprise AI tools to support provision of legal advice and increased efficiency.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent time management skills and the ability to handle a high workload.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to work autonomously and independently with minimal supervision.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">High level of written and interpersonal communication skills.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent level of accuracy and attention to detail.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be open-minded and willing to accept new challenges.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be a systemic thinker with proven abilities for process improvement and simplification.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience or interest in Legal Operations.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/paralegal-commercial-team-london-190151","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"business-partner-specialist-london-109921","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Business Partner, Specialist","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Job Description<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is seeking a Strategy &amp; Operations Associate to join the UK\/EEA Commercial team. You will act as a key business partner to UK\/EEA Commercial Leadership, delivering data-driven insights on trends and productivity.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Beyond reporting, you will support revenue forecasting and contribute to key GTM initiatives like territory planning and customer segmentation. You will operationalize commercial strategy by optimizing processes and leading cross-functional projects. We are looking for an analytical problem-solver with 2\u20134 years of experience who is ready to bridge the gap between data, strategic execution, and operational excellence.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What You\u2019ll Be Doing<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/>Commercial Analytics &amp; Reporting<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own the numbers: Use Salesforce, Looker,  SQL and AI-enabled tools to query, validate and interpret commercial data; identifying trends and risks. Build and maintain dashboards to track key commercial KPIs and productivity metrics.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Forecasting Support: Support the region\u2019s revenue forecasting cadence and pipeline management process, ensuring data hygiene and accuracy.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Insight Generation: Provide commercial reporting and deep-dive insights to drive business discussions and decision-making for leadership.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strategic Planning &amp; GTM Operations<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strategy Execution: Assist in delivering company-wide GTM initiatives, including sales territory planning, verticalization, and customer segmentation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Process Improvement: Identify bottlenecks in the sales process and help map the customer journey to improve efficiency.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Market Intelligence: Conduct analysis to support the shaping of the company\u2019s commercial strategy and uncover new growth opportunities.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Cross-Functional Collaboration<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Project Management: Lead specific workstreams within cross-functional projects, working closely with stakeholders in Enablement, Product, Marketing, and Finance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Stakeholder Management: Present data-driven recommendations to various stakeholders to influence actions and strategic direction.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><strong>What We Are Looking For<\/strong><\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience: 2\u20134 years of experience in Investment Banking, Venture Capital, Management Consulting and\/or Revenue\/Business Operations or Strategy at a high-growth start-up.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Analytical and Technical Skills: Analytical mindset for data interpretation and manipulation is non-negotiable. You should be comfortable manipulating large datasets to interpret complex data. This can be demonstrated via advanced Excel skills and\/or experience with SQL.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strategic Thinking: Able to connect analysis to commercial implications, make sound recommendations, and distinguish between interesting data and insights that will drive decisioning.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Communication: Strong communication skills to distill complex analysis into strategic, data-driven recommendations and engage in productive discussions with leaders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborative mindset: Comfortable in interacting with executives and leading cross-functional projects, with a strong determination to collaborate with others.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Agility: Ability to navigate in a fast-paced environment with confidence and calm.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advantageous skills: Experience with sales forecasting, territory planning, customer journey mapping, and sales process is advantageous. Salesforce proficiency is also a strong plus.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/business-partner-specialist-london-109921","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"senior-manager-licence-applications-london-460333","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Manager, Licence Applications","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>The Role<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is looking for a dynamic and strategic <strong>Senior Manager, Licensing Applications<\/strong> to join our Global Affairs team. Reporting directly to the <strong>Director of External Affairs<\/strong>, you will lead the end-to-end execution of our global licensing strategy, serving as the central architect for our regulatory expansions in new and existing markets.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Based in London with a global remit, you will sit at the intersection of public policy, regulatory strategy, and corporate expansion. This is a high-impact, cross-functional role requiring a blend of project management mastery, deep regulatory fluency, and the commercial gravitas to align internal product and compliance roadmaps with external regulatory requirements. <br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/>You will be instrumental in securing the banking &amp; EMI licenses that form the bedrock of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s global growth.<\/p><h2><strong><br \/>How You'll Make an Impact<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Global Licensing Roadmap:<\/strong> Lead the preparation, drafting, compilation, and submission of major regulatory license applications globally (e.g., EMI, PI, and local payment method or central bank approvals).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>End-to-End Application Ownership :<\/strong> Turn vague or complex regulatory frameworks into structured project plans. Coordinate multi-layered application materials, ensuring technical, financial, and operational sections meet rigorous local regulatory standards.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Cross-Functional Orchestration:<\/strong> Act as the ultimate bridge between External Affairs, Legal, Compliance, Risk, Finance, and Product. Align internal technical roadmaps with external commitments made to regulators during the application process.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Regulator &amp; Stakeholder Engagement:<\/strong> Craft compelling narratives and formal briefs for central banks, financial regulators, and executive leadership. Support local leadership teams during pre-licensing interviews and regulatory audits.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Strategic Expansion Intelligence:<\/strong> Monitor and analyze shifting global regulatory trends. Work closely with the Head of External Affairs to assess the feasibility of new market entries and advise leadership on potential regulatory risks and opportunities.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Governance and Process Architecture:<\/strong> Build out scalable, internal frameworks and playbooks for licensing applications to optimize speed-to-market and ensure operational efficiency across regional expansions.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>What We're Looking For<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>FinTech &amp; Payments Expertise: <\/strong>8+ years of experience in regulatory compliance, legal, government relations, or a strategic expansion role within the FinTech or payments ecosystem.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Proven Licensing Track Record:<\/strong> Direct experience successfully writing, managing, and delivering complex financial services licensing applications across multiple global jurisdictions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Masterful Project Management:<\/strong> A highly organized operator comfortable navigating massive, multi-departmental deliverables under tight, high-pressure deadlines.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Regulatory Fluency:<\/strong> Ability to deconstruct technical regulatory text and translate it into actionable commercial and product requirements.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Exceptional Communication:<\/strong> Stellar drafting skills and the ability to articulate complex financial mechanisms into clear, outcome-led narratives for C-suite executives and external regulators.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Ambiguity and Drive:<\/strong> A builder's mindset. You are highly autonomous, comfortable navigating grey areas, and motivated by shaping a rapidly scaling global blueprint.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-manager-licence-applications-london-460333","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"senior-data-scientist-london-193305","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Data Scientist","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h3><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/h3><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is looking for an experienced Senior Data Scientist to lead advanced optimisation projects and champion the development of robust, sustainable ML architectures. You will be responsible for the enhancing payment flow through data and ML services, advancing the complex problem of multi-objective optimisation. You will work closely with other Senior and Staff Data Scientists to shape the architecture of our decisioning systems.<\/p><h3><br \/><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead projects and architecture design for multi-objective optimisation and scalable models.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Create custom loss functions, evaluation, and tuning frameworks that reflect complex business problems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate with product stakeholders to align technical strategy with business goals and resolve blockers across the team.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Apply efficient data transformations using distributed computing (e.g., Spark, Dask) and ensure robust test coverage for production systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Mentor junior team members and utilise model explainability methods to drive feature performance improvements.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3><strong>About You<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">5+ years of experience in designing, building and maintaining machine learning models to solve complex, large-scale business problems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep understanding of frequentist and Bayesian statistics, plus supervised and unsupervised modelling techniques.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven experience modelling complex interactions (e.g., cluster or network effects).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Expertise in model explainability to tune feature engineering and understand feature interactions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to write high-quality, production-grade Python code and collaborate effectively with non-technical stakeholders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficient in leveraging LLMs for coding support and process optimisation to maximise personal and team productivity.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Adept at tuning technical communication for broad audiences.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven ability to build trusting relationships with product stakeholders and deeply understand business models.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3><strong>Nice to have<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with distributed general-purpose cluster-computing.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven experience designing and deploying recommender systems, contextual bandits, or network intelligence applications.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in fintech, payments or similar domains.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with Docker, AWS\/GCP, and modern ML deployment practices.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-data-scientist-london-193305","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"senior-engineer-i-workday-prism-accounting-center-financial-infrastructure-london-425972","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Engineer I, Workday Prism & Accounting Center (Financial Infrastructure)","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>The Role<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><u>Checkout.com<\/u><\/a> is looking for an experienced Senior Analytics Engineer specialising in Workday Prism Analytics and Workday Accounting Center to join the team responsible for building and scaling our Financial infrastructure. This is a technical and analytical role for someone who thrives at the intersection of data and financial systems. You will own the day-to-day reliability of existing Accounting Center use cases while architecting solutions for changes in upstream product platforms. In this role, you will partner closely with our Finance, Product and Engineering teams to build and maintain robust, audit-ready data pipelines.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>How You\u2019ll Make an Impact<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Architect, build, and maintain high-volume data pipelines in Workday Prism Analytics,  ingesting raw operational and transactional data from upstream product platforms.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Configure and manage Workday Accounting Center on a daily basis; from data ingestion to batch troubleshooting to successfully posting journals in the general ledger.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Partner with technical accountants and business controllers to translate complex accounting policies and transaction flows into configurable, well-documented rules within Workday Accounting Center.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Leverage Workday Prism and reporting tools to build powerful dashboards, custom matrix reports, and Discovery Boards that provide business insights and support regulatory reporting.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>What We\u2019re Looking For<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on experience with Workday Prism Analytics and\/or Workday Accounting Center within a complex, high-transaction global enterprise environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Good understanding of fundamental accounting concepts, such as debits\/credits, general ledger structure, subledger accounting, multi-currency reporting, and double-entry bookkeeping.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with Workday integration technologies (EIBs, Studio, RaaS) to facilitate data ingestion into Prism and our wider financial ecosystem.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exceptional troubleshooting skills with a deep interest in identifying data anomalies, reconciling complex transaction flows, and optimising system performance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong awareness of internal controls and IT general controls (ITGC) regarding financial reporting systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent verbal and written English communication skills, with the ability to bridge the gap between technical developers and non-technical business accountants.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with Workday Implementations and Cutover Life cycles is a plus.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">SQL proficiency is a plus.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-engineer-i-workday-prism-accounting-center-financial-infrastructure-london-425972","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"manager-sales-engineering-london-421747","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Manager, Sales Engineering","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\/\"><u>Checkout.com<\/u><\/a> is looking for an enthusiastic and talented Sales Engineer to join our fast-growing team in London to support our clients with integrating our revolutionary online payments platform. <\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a mid-level position, and the successful candidate will be responsible for providing technical leadership and guidance to our clients, predominantly in the UK, throughout the entire sales lifecycle. As a Sales Engineer, you are responsible for technical ownership of client relationships from initial contact in the sales cycle throughout the solutioning, integration, and go-live stages of the customer journey. The ability to solve business and technical requirements through the application of<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\/\"> <u>Checkout.com<\/u><\/a> products and solutions is core to the success of the position. Along the way, you'll collaborate closely with various in-house talents across Technology and Business to position our capabilities, products, services and solutions effectively with prospects.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The ideal candidate will need to be an independent, high-achieving individual, able to stand out in an entrepreneurial environment and outperform performance targets through personal drive.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What you will be doing:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support the commercial team to position <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\/\"><u>Checkout.com<\/u><\/a>\u2019s products, solutions, and services, and ultimately, help to win deals. You will be a key partner to Account Executives on all matters related to product, payments, regulation, and tech.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understand merchant requirements and technical needs, map this to our APIs and products, create solution designs and internal documentation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Run demos, build \u201cshow-me\u201d payment flows, create POCs, customise and create presentations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide thought leadership on all aspects of Payment Performance - Acceptance Rate, Fraud Prevention, Tokenisation, Payment Methods, and others.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead all technical interactions with merchants, from chats and calls to meetings and workshops until the deal is won.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support BID management team with RFP and RFI responses.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Enable internal functions, commercial and tech, with market and merchant feedback on product capabilities. Champion product change and improvement.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Being constantly up to date with industry standards, solutions, and tech<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Being an expert of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\/\"><u>Checkout.com<\/u><\/a>\u2019s platform and product.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About You:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">3-5 years experience as a Sales Engineer \/ Solutions Architect \/ Pre-Sales Consultant \/ Implementation Engineer or TAM.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working in a technical client-facing role.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drives results with a strong commercial focus and proactive approach.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Clear written and verbal English. Able to communicate to both technical (developers, product) and business (payments, finance, c-level) stakeholders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Able to thrive in a fast-paced environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to translate technical jargon into business speak.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Problem\u2011solver. Able to reproduce, isolate and explain issues using logs, API responses, and tests.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Highly organised and able to prioritise shifting workloads and responsibilities effectively.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiar with API based integration methods, associated best practices, and related tools\/frameworks (REST\/JSON APIs, Postman).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with at least one common front-end (pure JavaScript, React, Angular, etc) and back-end (Java, .NET, Python, Node, etc) technology.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Previous exposure to RFI\/RFP<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understanding of end-to-end payment flow.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Payments industry exposure with an understanding of the related rules and regulations and payments schemes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with 3DS, Network Tokenisation, Apple\/Google Pay, Open Banking, or fraud\u2011risk engines.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Nice to have:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with PSD2\/PSD3\/PSR, FCA, ISO-8583.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Additional language is a plus.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Former engineering, developer, or product manager background.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Held prior roles in E-commerce industry.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/manager-sales-engineering-london-421747","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"senior-software-engineer-ai-centre-of-excellence-london-101591","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Software Engineer, AI Centre of Excellence","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Senior AI Engineer within Checkout.com\u2019s AI Centre of Excellence, you will drive the adoption of cutting-edge Generative AI technologies to transform how we operate and innovate. You will mentor peers, set engineering best practices, and shape Checkout.com\u2019s AI strategy, while also designing, building, and deploying AI solutions that enhance products and streamline business processes in collaboration with cross-functional teams.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Partner with product managers, data scientists, and engineers to research, validate, and deliver high-impact Generative AI use cases.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design and build APIs and microservices that integrate AI capabilities into internal and external workflows.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Develop, fine-tune, and deploy LLM-based applications (e.g., chatbots, assistants, knowledge extraction tools).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Architect scalable AI infrastructure on cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure), leveraging containerisation and IaC.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Implement CI\/CD pipelines and enforce best practices for secure, compliant AI deployment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build intuitive interfaces that enable teams to interact effectively with AI-driven features.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Continuously optimise performance, reliability, and scalability of AI systems.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What we're looking for:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on experience with LLMs (e.g., GPT, BERT, Llama, Gemini) and applying them to real-world problems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong backend engineering expertise, including RESTful APIs and micro-services design.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python\/JavaScript and familiarity with AI frameworks (e.g., LangChain, PydanticAI).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Solid understanding of cloud computing (AWS, GCP, or Azure), containerisation (Docker, Kubernetes), and Infrastructure-as-Code (Terraform).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven problem-solving skills and ability to thrive in fast-paced environments.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and collaboration skills across diverse teams.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Preferred qualifications:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in C# or Java.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Frontend development experience with JavaScript\/TypeScript and frameworks such as React.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience developing Generative AI applications, including model fine-tuning and prototyping.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Awareness of ethical AI practices and emerging standards in AI governance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Track record of rapid prototyping with measurable ROI.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with distributed systems and large-scale data processing.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contributions to open-source projects or a strong GitHub portfolio.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">High technical curiosity and eagerness to learn new platforms.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in the payments industry (a strong plus).<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-software-engineer-ai-centre-of-excellence-london-101591","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"staff-ai-ml-engineer-london-311323","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Staff AI\/ML Engineer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">There are a myriad of opportunities to use AI \/ ML as part of business processes in checkout, and we\u2019re looking for an expert to help us make these a reality. Unlike many such roles, this is an opportunity to truly drive innovation at scale that matters.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We\u2019re looking for a Staff Level AL \/ ML engineer to accelerate our adoption into the AI era; helping us set our AI vision and show us what is possible.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As part of the Data and AI platform team; you\u2019ll get to pioneer on real world problems, bringing your knowledge of AI \/ ML, MLOps and LLMs to bear - collaborating cross team to make your vision a reality. You\u2019ll be backed by our platform team, and have a wealth of experience to draw on, but we want someone who\u2019ll blaze a trail; operating on the bleeding edge.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate with teams to research, scope, and validate use cases for AI that drive business value and innovation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive AI adoption by combining rigorous scientific evaluation with the operational maturity to champion high-value applications and confidently push back on unsuitable AI use cases.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design, refine and build MLOps component of the data and AI platform, from Vector Databases through feature stored and model serving, all at the millisecond scale.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Implement CI\/CD pipelines and ensure adherence to best practices for model deployment, security, and compliance with global regulations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work as part of our AI \/ ML guild; having a voice and being a driving force behind new approaches and use cases.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Continuously monitor and optimise system performance to ensure scalability, security, and operational efficiency.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What we\u2019re looking for:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Python (and at least one other language a plus).  Experience with key libraries such as PyTorch, Pandas, Hugging Face Transformers, or similar AI toolkits.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Working knowledge of common models, and their use cases and experience applying them to solve specific problems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Solid engineering skills, including designing and implementing services \/ data models and features.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Expertise with cloud computing platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure) and containerisation tools (e.g., Docker, Kubernetes).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Expertise with modern data platforms (e.g., BigQuery \/ Databricks) and data processing workflows (ETL, pipelines).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent experience with cloud hosted AI platforms (Bedrock, Sagemaker, VertexAI)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong problem-solving abilities, with the capacity to learn quickly and adapt in a fast-paced environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent communication and a drive to work effectively across diverse teams.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>We also want to hear if you have:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience developing AI \/ ML applications, including fine-tuning models or creating prototypes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Awareness of ethical considerations and emerging best practices in AI governance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Track record of developing rapid prototypes, and bringing them to production with a focus on measurable ROI.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with distributed systems and large-scale data processing.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contributions to open-source projects or a strong GitHub portfolio.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Thought leadership, any articles or talks you\u2019ve given?<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">High levels of technical curiosity and an eagerness to learn new platforms<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional information:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hybrid Working Model: All of our offices globally are onsite 3 times per week (Tuesday, Wednesday, and Friday). We\u2019ve worked towards enabling teams to work collaboratively in the same space, while also being able to partner with colleagues globally. During your days at the office, we offer amazing snacks, breakfast, and lunch options in all of our locations.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/staff-ai-ml-engineer-london-311323","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"senior-salesforce-engineer-london-299052","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Salesforce Engineer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Global payments are complex and ever-evolving, and our Salesforce platform is a critical component that empowers our operations, commercial, and finance teams to scale with our growth. At Checkout, our Salesforce Engineers develop and enhance the platform and its integrations, enabling our teams to manage merchant relationships, streamline business processes, and achieve operational excellence.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for Senior Salesforce Engineers who bring fresh ideas, have a curious nature, and are passionate about working in an Engineering environment focused on building products and solutions to achieve the company's strategic goals. You\u2019ll get to work closely with business stakeholders and product teams across <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s portfolio, all operating with a real customer-first philosophy.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Senior Salesforce Engineer, you will lead and drive specific projects critical to Checkout's needs, focusing on the Salesforce platform, its integration ecosystem, and related technologies. You'll have opportunities to switch teams and projects as you and our fast-paced business grow and evolve. We need our engineers to be versatile, display exceptional leadership qualities, and be enthusiastic to take on new problems as we continue to push technology forward. With your technical expertise, you will lead project priorities, deadlines, and deliverables. You will design, develop, test, deploy, maintain, and enhance Salesforce solutions.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What we're looking for:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in Apex, Lightning Web Components (LWC), Visualforce, and the Salesforce<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">development ecosystem<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong understanding of Salesforce Governor Limits, best practices, and declarative tools (Flow, Process Builder)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Great communication skills and ability to interact effectively with a wide range of stakeholders, including non-technical business users.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working in agile environments and delivering high-quality code within tight deadlines<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to work independently as well as part of a team.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Someone who is AI proficient or AI curious, you will be hungry to embrace what the latest technology<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">has to offer to enhance yours and your team's productivity, especially around Salesforce Einstein capabilities<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Payments or financial knowledge is a plus, but not a necessity<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Platform Developer I or II certification is highly desirable<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be part of, and collaborate with, cross-functional teams including product management and business operations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Define and design loosely coupled, scalable systems within the Salesforce platform and its<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">integrations, using industry best practices<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Stay up-to-date, use, and spread knowledge of the latest Salesforce and related technologies used by Checkout<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Write clean, maintainable, extendable, and testable Apex and LWC code on some of Checkout\u2019s most impactful business systems<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build, own, and operate your Salesforce solutions to the highest levels of resilience and service<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Mentor junior team members and assist in their technical development journey within the Salesforce ecosystem<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-salesforce-engineer-london-299052","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"data-scientist-payment-success-london-46740","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Data Scientist - Payment Success","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong><u>How you\u2019ll make an impact<\/u><\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deliver expertise and guidance to our key merchants by crafting optimal payments strategy.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct deep-dive exploratory data analysis to uncover insights and anomalies<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct experiments and A\/B tests to improve performance, including ML based solutions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Develop cutting-edge automation tools aimed at monitoring and optimising merchants\u2019 performance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Implement robust measurements to assess how proposed solutions impact merchants' performance and revenue, providing valuable insights for both internal and external ROI.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate with various teams across the company to ensure an outstanding merchant experience and feed requirements for product development<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Elevate internal awareness, particularly within the executive team, regarding the full spectrum of merchant services and benefits provided<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive a culture of cross-team learning and knowledge sharing<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong><u>What we\u2019re looking for<\/u><\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">3+ years in an analytical role either at a Fintech or Consultancy, using analysis to make business recommendations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A huge advantage if you have previous experience working as Payment Analyst\/Expert <\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Data driven approach, by clearly defining success metrics and measuring progress against them<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">SQL \/ Python knowledge to extract &amp; analyse large data from our Data Warehouse<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Good knowledge of today\u2019s major e-commerce and payments technologies and trends<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Customer driven and able to establish robust relationship with assigned customer base<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/data-scientist-payment-success-london-46740","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"enterprise-business-development-analyst-london-401568","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Enterprise Business Development Analyst","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is actively looking for an enthusiastic and talented Enterprise Business Development Analyst to join the team as we accelerate our Enterprise development of Global Accounts from our offices in London. This is a fantastic opportunity to play a fundamental role in our rapid growth as we revolutionise merchant experience and continue to set ourselves apart from the rest when managing our largest and most strategic accounts in the UK.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">If you are a motivated and focused individual, with high attention to detail and a relentless drive for growth and excellence, this is the role for you. We are looking for a self-starter who thrives in a fast-paced and competitive environment and is excited about joining us at this pivotal point in our journey.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role will be part of our Enterprise Sales team that sits within our Commercial department. You will have the opportunity to work cross-functionally with teams across Sales, Enablement, Product, Marketing, Solutions Engineering and more.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The ideal candidate approaches enterprise business development and intelligence in an analytical manner, is data-driven, and is a creative problem-solver.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">What you will do:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Develop and own the strategic account plans and end-to-end deal progression strategy for a portfolio of key prospects in collaboration with Enterprise Sales Representatives.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Serve as the internal Methodology expert and trusted advisor on the key strategic accounts, including their industry, market trends, and critical business challenges.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct in-depth market and account analysis (organizational structure, strategic priorities, competitive landscape) to generate actionable insights that accelerate sales cycles and inform business strategy.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proactively leverage AI-driven systems (e.g., Salesforce, 6Sense, proprietary tools) and advanced analytics to optimise lead generation, strategic planning, and pipeline accuracy.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work closely with Sales in nurturing, developing, and deepening relationships with existing and prospective merchants.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Influence cross-functional teams of stakeholders (including Product, Solutions Engineering, and Legal) to ensure an aligned team effort when dealing and onboarding with key merchants.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Assist senior leadership in shaping tailored solutions and product offerings for each merchant.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate daily with our engagement team to ensure a strong understanding and alignment across the entire sales cycle.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">About You:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Preferable experience in payments, fintech etc, but not essential<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven ability to build and sustain deep, multi-threaded relationships with multiple stakeholders up to the C-suite level within a large enterprise environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated deep analytical and problem-solving skills, with experience using data\/CRM (e.g., Salesforce) for account mapping, opportunity identification, and accurate forecasting.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exceptional written and verbal communication and presentation skills, with the ability to articulate complex financial\/technical value propositions to senior stakeholders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Highly organised and able to prioritise shifting workloads and responsibilities effectively.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Eager to understand and navigate long sales cycles.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Commercially minded and possesses a deep understanding of issues large accounts are facing.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Confident and proficient user of AI and data analytics tools.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Highly motivated and tenacious self starter<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fluent in English<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/enterprise-business-development-analyst-london-401568","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"senior-cloud-engineer-i-london-256358","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Cloud Engineer I","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Every payment we process runs on infrastructure we built. At <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, the Cloud Platform team owns the cloud foundations that global payments depend on: a large multi-account AWS estate, a growing Azure platform, and the networking and connectivity that reaches card schemes and banks worldwide. We are genuinely multi-cloud, and we are looking for a Senior Cloud Engineer who is too - a strong generalist who treats infrastructure as a software problem and can deliver from week one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a hands-on senior role in an established, fast-moving team. Everything we run is defined in code, deployed through pipelines, and reviewed like software. You will bring deep cloud expertise across AWS and Azure and pair it with a genuine software engineering mindset: you write Terraform modules others build on, you automate away toil rather than documenting it, and you treat the platform as a product with users, SLOs, and a roadmap.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Senior Cloud Engineer, you are responsible for the technical delivery of your team's services. You will work closely with your Engineering Manager to shape direction, manage dependencies across pillars, and ensure our platform meets the standards a regulated payments business demands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What we are looking for:<\/strong><br \/><br \/>Deep AWS expertise: Advanced, hands-on experience designing and operating production infrastructure in AWS at enterprise scale: multi-account architectures (Control Tower, Organizations, SCPs), IAM, KMS, and the core compute, storage, and security services that a large regulated estate runs on. You should have a proven track record of delivering resilient, multi-region architectures.<br \/><br \/>Azure experience: Real production experience with Azure alongside AWS: landing zones, VNet architectures, Entra ID, and the Azure resource and governance model. You understand where the two clouds differ and can design well for both rather than forcing one cloud's patterns onto the other.<br \/><br \/>Software engineering mindset: You treat infrastructure as software. Expert-level Terraform: reusable modules, secure state management, and disciplined code review. You are comfortable in a Git-based workflow with CI\/CD (we use Spacelift), and you reach for Python or similar to automate what others would handle with a runbook. No ClickOps.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong cloud networking: Confident designing and debugging in a complex network estate: VPC and VNet design, hub-and-spoke and Transit Gateway or Cloud WAN architectures, DNS, private connectivity (PrivateLink, Private Link), and enough routing knowledge to own connectivity issues end to end rather than escalate them.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Kubernetes: Solid experience running containerised workloads in production, ideally on EKS\/AKS: cluster lifecycle, workload deployment patterns, and the operational realities of keeping Kubernetes healthy at scale.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Security and compliance awareness: Experience operating in regulated environments. You understand why change control, least privilege, and auditability matter, and you design controls in rather than bolting them on. Familiarity with PCI DSS is a strong plus.<br \/><br \/>Engineering excellence: A focus on observability and measurement: you instrument what you build and answer operational questions with data rather than opinion.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Leadership and mentorship: A natural ability to guide and mentor peers, translate ambiguous problem definitions into actionable technical plans, and raise the bar through your code and your reviews.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Pragmatic problem solver: You understand when to move fast (creating tech debt) and when to move right (paying it off). You are a cornerstone in incident resolution and root-cause analysis.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience: 5+ years in cloud engineering roles with significant AWS depth. We need someone who can hit the ground running: comfortable joining a complex, established estate and delivering meaningful work in their first weeks, not their first quarter. A degree in Computer Science or a related field is useful but not required; we care about what you can build.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>How you\u2019ll make an impact:<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead Design &amp; Delivery: Take ownership of large-scale platform projects end to end, from architecture through Terraform to production, ensuring they are scalable, secure, and cost-optimised.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build the paved road: Design the platform primitives that every product team at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> builds on, so that the secure path is also the easy path.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Architectural Influence:  Work with Engineering Managers and architects to refine requirements and shape the technical direction of the platform, documenting significant decisions as ADRs.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Operational SME: Act as the Subject Matter Expert for numerous team-owned services, providing advanced operational support and ensuring high availability for our global payment systems.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Evangelise Best Practices: Produce exemplary code and documentation that inspires others. You will be responsible for spreading best practices and standards across your group.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Manage Dependencies: Navigate the organisation to manage technical dependencies inside and outside your pillar, optimising for both delivery speed and business outcomes.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Foster Culture: Embody Checkout Operating Principles, using them to shape the group\u2019s culture and acting as an example of efficiency and professional excellence.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">AI Integration: Proactively explore and implement AI-driven automation to enhance infrastructure efficiency and team productivity.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-cloud-engineer-i-london-256358","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664911},{"slug":"senior-specialist-communications-12m-ftc-london-405716","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Specialist, Communications (12m FTC)","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is looking for an enthusiastic and talented Senior Specialist, Corporate Communications to join our fast-paced Communications and Content team on a 12m FTC. This role is ideal for an experienced communications professional who is ready to take ownership of high-quality execution across a broad range of corporate communications activity while continuing to grow their strategic judgment and influence. You will work closely with senior communications team members across media relations, corporate communications, strategic and crisis communications, editorial development, agency coordination, and campaign execution. You will be comfortable managing multiple workstreams at pace, producing excellent written output, supporting high-impact communications campaigns, securing quality media coverage, and partnering effectively with stakeholders across the business.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Media relations and pitching:<\/strong> Develop targeted pitches, build relationships with relevant journalists and influencers, and help secure meaningful coverage across priority media outlets.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Content creation:<\/strong> Draft high-quality written materials, including press releases, bylines, briefing documents, messaging, and spokesperson preparation materials.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Press office management:<\/strong> Support day-to-day press office activity, including fielding inbound enquiries, organising interviews, and helping ensure timely responses to media requests.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Awards and recognition:<\/strong> Support awards and list-pitching activity by identifying relevant opportunities, drafting strong submissions, and managing deadlines effectively.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Analytics and reporting:<\/strong> Maintain reporting and analytics across communications activity, using data and insights to help evaluate performance and improve future work.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>International:<\/strong> Partner with the wider marketing team to support international PR activity, helping coordinate agency inputs and contributing to consistent execution across markets.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI and agentic workflows:<\/strong> Use AI and agentic workflows effectively to improve pace, output, and quality, while applying strong editorial judgment and maintaining a high bar for accuracy.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Crisis and sensitive issues:<\/strong> Support communications planning and execution for sensitive topics and high-stakes moments, including preparing materials, coordinating responses, and supporting senior team members with delivery.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated experience in corporate communications or public relations, either in-house or at an agency.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exceptional writing and editing skills, with the ability to draft compelling press materials, bylines, briefing documents, and media pitches.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven media relations experience, with a track record of landing stories with trade, business, or technology media.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong organisational and project management skills, with experience handling multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A data-driven mindset, with experience using reporting and analytics to assess communications performance and inform next steps.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A collaborative and proactive approach, with the ability to influence peers and project partners, act as a subject matter expert in your area, and manage stakeholders effectively with support from your manager where needed.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience supporting communications activity on sensitive issues or high-profile stakeholder matters, with sound judgment and attention to detail.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-specialist-communications-12m-ftc-london-405716","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"data-scientist-london-375610","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Data Scientist","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h3><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/h3><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is looking for a Data Scientist to join our ambitious team, focused on discovering, designing, and experimenting with new estimators, models and features to boost payment performance across our portfolio of merchants. You will work closely with Data Scientists, Product and Engineering to enhance our core offering, protect customer lifetime value through network intelligence, and ensure safe model launches through robust observability.<\/p><h3><br \/><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to the research and development of new ML models and estimators to boost core Acceptance Rate performance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design and implement experiments to produce actionable insights, focusing on managing time-based data leakage and ensuring robust model evaluation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate with other Data Scientists and engineers to productionise ML features, models and evolve our evaluation and monitoring frameworks.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Write high-quality, interpretable Python code for feature engineering and model training, contributing directly to our core products.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Communicate hypotheses, evaluation results, and monitoring dashboards clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3><br \/><strong>About You<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">3+ years of experience developing machine learning models to solve business problems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong understanding of supervised ML algorithms, tuning, and performance evaluation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with a range of feature engineering techniques (e.g. target encoding).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Solid grasp of frequentist and Bayesian statistics for parameter estimation and experimentation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in writing clean, production-grade Python code for both model training and inference.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excited to leverage LLMs for coding support and process optimisation to maximise personal and team productivity.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3><br \/><strong>Nice to have<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with advanced data transformation techniques (e.g., lambda functions).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with, or hands-on experience in, recommender systems, contextual bandits, or network intelligence applications.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in fintech, payments, or building cross-disciplinary relationships for advice and guidance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with the unix shell, Databricks, Docker, and common cloud platforms (GCP\/AWS).<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/data-scientist-london-375610","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"communications-manager-merchant-announcements-london-45047","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Communications Manager, Merchant Announcements","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is looking for a <strong>Communications Manager<\/strong> to join our Communications and Content team. In this role, you will own the end-to-end delivery of our most impactful, largest, merchant announcements, coordinating across Commercial, Brand and Creative, and your colleagues in Communications to bring some of the most high-profile stories in payments to market.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a role for someone who thrives at the intersection of editorial judgment, project management, and stakeholder influence. You'll be the connector between account managers, merchants, channel owners, and the broader comms team, ensuring that announcements land with precision, that the pipeline never runs dry, and that the programme gets measurably better over time.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you'll make an impact:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Announcement ownership:<\/strong> Lead the end-to-end coordination of hero merchant announcements, from initial brief through to publication \u2014 managing timelines, aligning stakeholders, and ensuring nothing falls through the gaps.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Content creation:<\/strong> Work on PR and social copy, and supporting communications assets for merchant announcements, with a consistent standard of accuracy, clarity, and commercial relevance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stakeholder management:<\/strong> Build strong working relationships with account managers, regional marketing leads, and merchants directly \u2014 keeping the flow of announcements moving and anticipating blockers before they become problems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Channel briefing and coordination:<\/strong> Brief in channel owners across PR, social, and owned media, ensuring each announcement is executed consistently and on time across every relevant touchpoint.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Pipeline management:<\/strong> Own and maintain a healthy pipeline of upcoming merchant announcements, prioritising by commercial impact and ensuring the team always has a clear view of what's coming and when.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Reporting and measurement:<\/strong> Own the reporting framework for the merchant announcements programme, tracking KPIs including PR hits, social impressions, and share of voice, and presenting performance clearly to senior stakeholders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Programme development:<\/strong> Continuously evaluate and improve the way merchant announcements are run \u2014 from briefing templates and approval workflows to partner engagement and post-publication analysis.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What we're looking for:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in communications, content, or PR, ideally with exposure to B2B or fintech environments, and a track record of managing complex, multi-stakeholder announcements.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">AI-fluent. You use LLMs and associated tools to work faster and think harder, drafting, brainstorming, and stress-testing ideas as a matter of course.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong writing skills across formats, with the ability to move fluently between a press release and a LinkedIn caption without losing the thread of a story.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A natural coordinator who keeps projects on track without needing to be chased, and who earns trust from commercial and creative colleagues alike.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Data-literate and outcomes-focused, you understand what good looks like for earned media and paid social performance, and you use that to inform how you work.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable managing up and across: you can hold a timeline with a senior account manager, push back on a deadline that doesn't work, and represent the comms team's interests clearly.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Sharp attention to detail, particularly around accuracy in copy that will carry a merchant's name publicly.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong><br \/>About you<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You care deeply about your work, and strive to deliver the best quality output possible. You welcome constructive criticism.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You're not an island. You can show and tell us how you've helped the people around you get better, or brought in others\u2019 support from inside or outside the team to get something done.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You think in systems. You can anticipate the ripple effects small and large changes will have on the brand experience.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You highly prize being accountable. You take ownership for every action, share faults and failures, strive for better, and build trust.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You're self motivated and can work independently.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You love learning. You might not have experience for everything this role requires, but you're excited to grow and learn \u2013 sometimes 'wearing many hats' in a team.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/communications-manager-merchant-announcements-london-45047","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"manager-merchant-insights-12m-ftc-london-401895","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Manager, Merchant Insights (12m FTC)","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As <strong>Manager, Merchant Insights (12-Month Fixed-Term Contract)<\/strong>, you will own our buyer insights programme, bringing together customer feedback, research, and market intelligence to build a deeper understanding of the merchants we serve. Your work will shape product marketing, influence strategic decisions, and ensure the voice of the buyer is reflected across the business.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role sits at the intersection of Product, Commercial, and Marketing. You will lead research and insight programmes that help internal teams make better decisions, influencing everything from product roadmaps and messaging to external campaigns and thought leadership.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a hands-on and strategic role focused on execution, analytical precision, and impact. You will be turning complex research and data into actionable recommendations, using your exceptional storytelling skills to drive better business outcomes globally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>How You\u2019ll Make an Impact<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Own the Buyer Insights Programme:<\/strong> Lead <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>'s buyer insights programme, developing research that helps the business better understand merchant needs, behaviours, perceptions, and future priorities.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Champion the Voice of the Buyer:<\/strong> Own customer listening programmes, including the company-wide NPS programme, event feedback, and other feedback channels. Bring together multiple sources of insight to identify trends, opportunities, and areas for improvement.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Inform Product Strategy:<\/strong> Analyse customer feedback and research to uncover themes that help inform product priorities, roadmap discussions, and the overall customer experience.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Shape Product Marketing:<\/strong> Deliver insights that strengthen product positioning, messaging, campaigns, thought leadership, and commercial enablement. Ensure our marketing reflects what matters most to buyers.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Lead Strategic Research:<\/strong> Manage research initiatives that deepen our understanding of enterprise buyers, emerging industry trends, and the future of digital commerce. Support the development of buyer personas and audience segmentation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build Insight Capabilities:<\/strong> Improve how buyer knowledge is captured, organised, and shared across the business, including maintaining AI-enabled research repositories and introducing new approaches to insight generation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Partner Across the Business:<\/strong> Collaborate closely with Marketing, Product, Commercial, and Operations to ensure buyer insights are embedded in decision-making across the organisation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Turn Insight into Action:<\/strong> Create executive-ready reports, presentations, and recommendations that help stakeholders make informed decisions and drive better business outcomes.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>What We\u2019re Looking For<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Research and Insights Experience:<\/strong> Proven experience leading research programmes or insight initiatives within technology, fintech, SaaS, or payments.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Strong Research Skills:<\/strong> Comfortable designing and managing qualitative and quantitative research, including surveys, interviews, feedback programmes, and strategic research projects.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Analytical Thinking:<\/strong> Able to synthesise customer feedback, market research, and commercial data into meaningful insights and practical recommendations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Clear Storytelling:<\/strong> Able to communicate complex findings in a simple, engaging way that influences and aligns stakeholders across Product, Commercial, and Marketing.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Commercial Mindset:<\/strong> Deep understanding of how buyer insights directly support product strategy, go-to-market execution, and overall business growth.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Cross-Functional Collaboration:<\/strong> Ability to build strong relationships across Product, Marketing, Commercial, Customer Success, and Design to align priorities and deliver impact.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Curiosity and Continuous Learning:<\/strong> Passionate about understanding enterprise buyers and the trends shaping digital commerce. Motivated to continually improve how insights are generated and applied.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Ownership and Accountability:<\/strong> Takes end-to-end ownership from research design through delivery, ensuring insights are actionable, high quality, and drive measurable value.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/manager-merchant-insights-12m-ftc-london-401895","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-manager-underwriting-london-298670","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Manager, Underwriting","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for a Senior Manager to join our Underwriting team in London. You will be part of a team that is responsible for underwriting enterprise customer applications with a focus on analysis relevant to Business Model, Credit Exposure and enhanced Financial Analysis. The ideal candidate must have a passion for coaching and developing people as you will be managing a team of underwriters with a focus on delivering results for the business.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is hands-on and highly cross-functional, requiring close collaboration with our key internal players (Business Development, Sales, Account Managers, Risk, Legal teams and Senior Management), and our high value merchants and partners.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><u>How you'll make an impact<\/u><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Oversee people and performance management for a team of underwriters<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Responsible for work assignments across your team within defined SLAs and productivity targets set at the department and company level<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Serve as the first escalation point for all applications and tasks handled by your team<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Serve as the first level approver for applications submitted by your team, providing expert level insight into the business model risk,  credit risk and AML risk of a merchant.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Leveraging experience, you will upscale junior team members through training initiatives on business model and credit analysis, in-line with internal policy guidelines<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure policies and processes are understood and adopted by your team to drive quality and efficiency<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct proficient analysis of P&amp;L, balance sheet and cash flow statements of large, complex deals and prepare persuasive summaries to assess micro and macro risks, mitigants and make balanced recommendations to the Credit Risk Committee<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identify operational issues and areas for improvement, and make detailed recommendations on how to improve the merchant onboarding experience<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Foster a culture of collaboration with key internal stakeholders, in particular Sales, and first and second line Risk and Compliance personnel and Legal<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to Underwriting initiatives and projects as required<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Qualifications<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><u>What we're looking for<\/u><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Expert level understanding in financial analysis with proficiency in evaluating high risk lines of businesses including travel, subscriptions, ticketing and events, securities dealers, gambling, amongst others<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understanding of KYC\/KYB and Enhanced Due Diligence measures in the UK and EEA.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Passion for coaching and nurturing talent, helping team members develop their technical skills and professional skills to achieve their goals<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Apply qualitative and quantitative criteria to evaluate teammate performance against KPIs<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated ability to make sound judgment, balancing risk and reward<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Possess excellent written and interpersonal communication skills<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Adopt a \u2018customer first\u2019 mindset to deliver creative solutions for our merchants<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Competent escalation management - act with urgency to ensure escalations are prioritized, owned, and resolved effectively<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to continually monitor and manage competing priorities and adjust accordingly<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Possess enthusiasm to drive process improvement initiatives, and contribute to broader department initiatives and projects<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">High performance mindset defined by rigorous discipline and execution intensity<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to cross team collaboration and building a One Team culture<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Leading by example, you will demonstrate our core Values and live out our Operating Principles in everything you do<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><u>Experience you will bring to the role<\/u><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coaching and developing the knowledge and skill of others within your domain expertise, preferably demonstrated through previous people management positions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience related to underwriting, credit insurance and\/or commercial lending<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Domain expertise within the payments industry will be preferable<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work in a team that uses qualitative and quantitative targets to measure performance<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Expert level financial statement analysis and credit exposure assessment ability<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with concise written and oral presentations, and ability to deliver complex messages in a clear and focused manner<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A highly analytical team player who loves to evaluate financial, compliance and business risks<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-manager-underwriting-london-298670","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-information-security-analyst-grc-london-423959","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Information Security Analyst (GRC)","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Senior Information Security Analyst within the GRC team, you will lead the strategic and technical execution of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>'s governance, risk and compliance programme. This is a role for a seasoned GRC professional who brings deep expertise across regulatory compliance, enterprise risk management, and security governance \u2014 and who can operate with full autonomy while shaping how the function evolves.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will take ownership of Checkout's most complex and high-stakes compliance programmes \u2014 PCI DSS v4.0.1, ISO 27001, SOC 2, DORA, and emerging obligations across our global licensed entities \u2014 while providing expert guidance to engineering, product, legal, and compliance teams on the security requirements that underpin our ability to operate and grow in regulated markets worldwide.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">At L4, you are a trusted advisor. You do not just manage compliance \u2014 you set the direction for it. You define how risk is identified, assessed, and treated. You advise on product and infrastructure decisions from a risk perspective. You mentor and develop junior and mid-level analysts. And you work closely with security leadership to ensure the GRC programme is aligned to the business's strategic objectives and risk appetite.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Your influence extends well beyond the GRC team. You help shape the security culture at Checkout, driving a risk-aware mindset across the business through clear communication, pragmatic guidance, and expert leadership.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How You'll Make An Impact<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>GRC Programme Leadership<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Lead defined sub-areas of Checkout's GRC programme end-to-end, including PCI DSS v4.0.1, ISO 27001, SOC 2, and regulatory obligations across Europe, MENA, APAC, and the Americas.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Define how control evidence is collected and maintained, moving the function toward continuous audit readiness and away from point-in-time preparation.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Own and drive improvements to GRC documentation including policies, standards, procedures, and control matrices \u2014 ensuring they reflect Checkout's evolving risk profile and regulatory obligations.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Lead gap analyses against new and evolving requirements, including DORA ICT risk obligations and the EU AI Act, producing prioritised remediation roadmaps with clear business impact framing.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Own the risk register for your sub-area, managing risk treatment through to closure and escalating to leadership where risk appetite may be exceeded.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Define and refine Checkout's third-party risk management approach for high-risk and critical vendors, setting assessment standards and overseeing their consistent application.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Drive continual improvement of the GRC programme itself \u2014 regularly assessing programme maturity, identifying process inefficiencies, and implementing improvements to how risk is identified, assessed, treated, and reported across the business.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Audit and Assessment Leadership<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Serve as the primary point of contact for external auditors, QSAs, and regulatory assessors across PCI DSS, ISO 27001, SOC 2, and ITGC audit cycles.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Demonstrated experience implementing ISO management system standards end-to-end, covering initial scoping and gap assessment through control design, policy development, internal audit programme, and certification \u2013 ideally across more than one standard.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Lead end-to-end audit delivery \u2014 scoping, evidence preparation, walkthrough facilitation, finding management, and formal closure.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Own the end-to-end response process for complex merchant assurance and regulatory due diligence requests, ensuring Checkout's compliance posture is presented accurately and persuasively.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Lead quarterly and annual compliance activities including vulnerability scanning coordination, penetration testing programmes, access reviews, and firewall configuration assurance.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Policy, Controls and Regulatory Strategy<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Apply expert knowledge of PCI DSS v4.0.1, ISO 27001\/27002, SOC 2, DORA, NIST CSF, and related frameworks to drive control design, policy development, and compliance strategy.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Advise product and engineering teams on compliance requirements at the point of design, embedding regulatory obligations into architecture decisions and development workflows.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Lead Checkout's regulatory change management activities \u2014 monitoring the evolving landscape across financial services, data protection, and AI regulation, assessing business impact, and driving remediation programmes.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Identify and drive systemic improvements to GRC processes, including automation opportunities that improve programme efficiency and evidence quality.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Contribute to the design and development of GRC tooling, dashboards, and risk reporting to improve leadership visibility of Checkout's compliance and risk posture.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stakeholder Influence and Team Development<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Act as a senior trusted advisor to Engineering, Product, Legal, Finance, Procurement, and Compliance on all GRC matters, communicating risk in business terms that drive informed decisions.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Represent the GRC function in cross-functional forums, governance committees, and regulatory discussions, influencing decisions that affect Checkout's risk posture.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Mentor and develop junior and mid-level GRC analysts (L1\u2013L3), raising the capability of the team through structured knowledge sharing, review, and coaching.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Promote a security-first culture across Checkout through proactive engagement, executive-level reporting, and accessible guidance that empowers non-security teams to make good risk decisions.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What We're Looking For:<\/strong><br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Experience<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- 5 or more years of experience in GRC, information security compliance, IT audit, or a closely related function, ideally within payments, financial services, or fintech.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Deep working knowledge of PCI DSS (v4.0.1 required), ISO 27001, and SOC 2. Practical experience with DORA, NIST CSF, the EU AI Act, or FCA\/PRA obligations is strongly preferred.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Demonstrated track record of leading external audits and regulatory assessments end-to-end, including managing assessor relationships and driving findings to closure.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Proven ability to own and deliver complex GRC programme workstreams independently, including gap analyses, risk treatment programmes, and regulatory change initiatives.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Experience advising engineering and product teams on compliance requirements, with the ability to translate regulatory obligations into practical, proportionate controls.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Track record of developing and mentoring less experienced colleagues.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Skills and Approach<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Expert written and verbal communication. You can frame complex regulatory and risk issues for a technical audience, a business stakeholder, and executive leadership \u2014 and adapt your style to drive the right outcome in each context.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Strategic and analytical thinker. You see beyond individual findings and controls to understand systemic risk patterns, root causes, and the broader implications for the business.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Decisive under ambiguity. You can set direction and make sound judgement calls on prioritisation and risk treatment without waiting for perfect information.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Highly collaborative and influential. You understand that compliance must be embedded across the business, and you build the relationships and credibility needed to make that happen.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Pragmatic and outcome-focused. You design controls and processes that are proportionate to risk and workable in practice, not just theoretically sound.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Preferred<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- CISA, CISM, CISSP, PCIP, ISO 27001 Lead Implementer or Lead Auditor, or equivalent advanced certification.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Familiarity with cloud environments (AWS, Azure, GCP) at an architecture or control level.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Experience with AI governance frameworks such as ISO 42001, the EU AI Act, or NIST AI RMF.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Experience designing or implementing GRC tooling, risk platforms, or compliance automation solutions.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Background in a Big Four advisory, payments scheme, or regulatory environment is advantageous.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-information-security-analyst-grc-london-423959","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"information-security-analyst-london-76606","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Information Security Analyst","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Role <\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As an Information Security Analyst at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, you will work across the full breadth of the information security function, spanning Governance, Risk and Compliance (GRC), AI Governance, Application Security (AppSec), Technology Risk, and Data Governance. This is a role for someone who has built a solid foundation in information security and is ready to move from guided execution to genuine ownership of tasks and smaller workstreams.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Security at Checkout operates at scale and at pace. We are a global payments business, regulated across multiple jurisdictions, building infrastructure that processes billions of transactions. Our security function needs analysts who understand how different domains fit together, communicate clearly with technical and non-technical colleagues, and take accountability for the quality of their work.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">At L2 you will implement security controls, respond to security incidents, identify risks, and support compliance activities across multiple domains. You work independently for extended periods and are developing the cross-domain knowledge and stakeholder skills that will prepare you for programme ownership at L3 and beyond.<br \/><br \/><strong>How You'll Make Impact<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Governance, Risk and Compliance<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Support workstreams within Checkout's GRC programme, including ISO 27001, SOC 2, PCI DSS, and applicable regulatory obligations across our global licensed entities.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Assist with control evidence collection activities, coordinating with internal teams to gather accurate and timely evidence in support of audit readiness.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Maintain GRC documentation including policies, standards, procedures, and control matrices under the guidance of senior colleagues.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Support monitoring of the risk register, tracking remediation activity against agreed timelines and escalating where commitments are at risk.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Assist in conducting third-party risk assessments, evaluating supplier security controls in line with Checkout's TPRM framework.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Develop working knowledge of regulatory obligations across Checkout's operating markets, including FCA\/PRA requirements, payment scheme rules, and DORA.<br \/><br \/><strong>AI Governance<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Support the operationalisation of Checkout's AI governance framework, aligned to ISO 42001, the EU AI Act, and NIST AI RMF.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Assist in conducting AI risk assessments for internal AI and ML systems and third-party AI tools, under the guidance of more senior analysts.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Help maintain an inventory of AI use cases and associated risk classifications, working with product and engineering teams as directed.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Develop awareness of the evolving regulatory landscape for AI in financial services and contribute to policy and control documentation.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> - Contribute to the development and communication of responsible AI usage guidance for staff, helping teams across the business understand acceptable use boundaries, data handling expectations, and the risks associated with AI tools in a regulated environment.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Application Security<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Contribute to Checkout's application security programme, including support for secure code review processes, SDLC integration, and developer security guidance.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Support threat modelling activities for new and existing products, identifying security requirements under the guidance of senior colleagues.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Assist in managing vulnerability findings from penetration tests, bug bounty programmes, and automated tooling, tracking remediation and validating fixes.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Apply knowledge of the OWASP Top 10 and secure development frameworks to practical security reviews and guidance activities.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Technology Risk<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Support technology risk assessments across infrastructure, cloud environments, and third-party systems, contributing to outputs with actionable treatment recommendations.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Assist with control assurance activities including vulnerability scanning coordination, access control assessments, and firewall and configuration reviews.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Develop an understanding of Checkout's technology risk landscape, identifying emerging threats and contributing inputs to the risk register.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Support DORA-related ICT risk management activities under the direction of senior analysts.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Data Governance<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Support Checkout's data governance programme, including data classification activities, data flow mapping, and enforcement of data handling standards.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Assist with data loss prevention (DLP) controls and tooling, contributing to activities that ensure sensitive data is protected throughout its lifecycle.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Help maintain records of processing activities (RoPA) and support data protection impact assessments (DPIAs) for new systems.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Develop working knowledge of GDPR, UK GDPR, and applicable regional data protection requirements as they affect Checkout's operations.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Cross-domain Collaboration<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Work with Engineering, Product, Legal, Procurement, Finance, and Compliance teams to support the embedding of security requirements into processes, systems, and projects.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Respond to security due diligence requests from merchants, partners, and regulators with accuracy and within agreed SLAs, escalating complex queries appropriately.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Communicate clearly with internal stakeholders on security requirements, keeping teams updated on changes and project progress.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Contribute to security awareness initiatives, promoting a security-conscious culture across Checkout.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What We're Looking for<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Experience<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- 1 to 2 years of experience in information security, IT audit, or a closely related function, ideally within payments, financial services, or fintech.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Working knowledge of at least one of the following domains: GRC, AppSec, technology risk, or data governance.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Practical familiarity with at least one compliance framework: PCI DSS, ISO 27001, SOC 2, NIST CSF, or equivalent.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Some exposure to external audits, risk assessments, or security assurance activities.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Ability to manage tasks independently and deliver on commitments reliably.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Skills and Approach<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Clear written and verbal communication. You can translate security concepts for technical and non-technical audiences.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Detail-oriented and methodical. You approach your work carefully and follow through consistently.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Curious and proactive. You ask questions, flag issues early, and look for root causes rather than surface fixes.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Collaborative and adaptable. You work effectively across teams and adjust your approach as priorities shift.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Receptive to feedback and committed to developing your information security skills across multiple domains.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Preferred<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Pursuing or holding a relevant certification: CompTIA Security+, CISA (in progress), ISO 27001 Foundation, or equivalent.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Familiarity with cloud environments (AWS, Azure, GCP) from a security or compliance perspective.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Exposure to security or GRC tooling such as Wiz, Qualys, Microsoft Sentinel, ServiceNow GRC, or similar.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Awareness of AI governance frameworks or the OWASP LLM Top 10.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Some scripting or automation experience (Python, etc.) is a plus.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/information-security-analyst-london-76606","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-legal-counsel-product-regulatory-london-175723","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Legal Counsel (Product & Regulatory)","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Job Description<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is seeking a talented Senior Legal Counsel with a strong payments regulatory and product background to join our Legal team. The Senior Legal Counsel will be expected to advise on compliance with financial services and payments regulations, interact with regulators and assist in the implementation of broader regulatory projects and product launches across the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> group.<br \/><br \/>As Senior Legal Counsel, you will work closely with all areas of the business in our offices around the globe. You will need to take a consultative and collaborative approach to solving complex legal and business issues in a fast-moving environment.<br \/><br \/>As you will be collaborating with all core functions within the company, the successful candidate should be able to handle multiple areas of responsibilities autonomously, demonstrating excellent critical judgment with a hands-on approach. This is a great opportunity to work on a broad range of projects across multiple jurisdictions, learn new areas of law and play a key role in supporting the company\u2019s rapid growth. You will be based at Checkout\u2019s offices in London.<br \/><br \/>You will be joining an expanding legal team in one of Europe's most valuable fintechs. Checkout Legal's mission is to be a legal team that exceeds expectations. We do this by providing pragmatic and trusted advice and balancing risk management by fusing high performance, innovation, collaboration and integrity.<br \/><br \/><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact  <\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Partner with our Commercial, Product, Treasury, Financial Partnerships and Compliance teams, acting as a real-time legal advisor to understand their needs and help find creative solutions to achieve business objectives<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support relationships with regulators on license-related matters, including potential de novo applications<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review payments product structures, flows and terms to ensure compliance with legal requirements<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advise on payments regulatory matters, including compliance with payments laws and related regulations across our different jurisdictions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advise on broader regulatory requirements applicable to financial institutions, including with respect to group regulatory change projects<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advise the business on market expansion, researching and evaluating new territories and applying for new licenses or expanding the scope of existing licenses<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advise key business functions on new regulatory developments impacting our operations, products and contractual commitments  <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Qualifications  <\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Qualified solicitor\/lawyer (8+ years PQE) with strong post-qualification experience either in-house or in private practice<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong understanding of legal principles applicable to payments, including the payments ecosystem and payments regulatory and licensing strategy\/execution, and to broader financial institutions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Previous FinTech, start-up, payments and\/or financial institution experience is desirable but not essential<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent time management skills and experience managing a diverse workload and competing stakeholder demands<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to handle and deliver on numerous high-priority projects concurrently<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfort with ambiguity, constant change, and a fast-paced culture<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A practical, solutions-oriented focus to solving legal challenges<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to work autonomously and collaboratively as needed, flexing the approach as the matter requires<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong communication skills and the ability to articulate and explain complex legal issues clearly and concisely<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-legal-counsel-product-regulatory-london-175723","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-sales-manager-london-430650","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Sales Manager","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is actively looking for an enthusiastic and talented Payments Senior Sales Manager to join our Commercial Payments Team to drive rapid growth across various industries for our revolutionary online payment solution.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">If you are a driven and focused salesperson with a proven track record of success selling direct payment solutions to enterprise companies, in a high-growth and competitive environment, this is the role for you. In return, on top of a tremendous working environment, we offer you an unrivaled uncapped recurring commissions plan, hybrid work model and competitive benefits package.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The Senior Sales Manager will play a key role in growing <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s payments footprint. They will be responsible for selling <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s full payments technology stack to middle market and large enterprise organizations.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Along the way, you'll collaborate closely with various in-house talents across Technology and Business to position our capabilities, products, services and solutions effectively with prospects. Desire an independent, high-achieving individual that stands out in an entrepreneurial environment and has the grit and desire to outperform sales targets.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make impact:<\/strong><br \/>\u25cf Acting as a consultative Payments strategist able to advise companies on an optimal payments structure that pulls from a myriad of solutions <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> provides<br \/>\u25cf Identify, qualify and close the most promising prospects and partners that will help <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> grow a healthy pipeline across various verticals.<br \/>\u25cf Build prospect engagement strategies and partner with marketing, business development, product and other departments to build qualified that pipeline in cold and warm channels<br \/>\u25cf Pitch our next-generation payment solutions and value-added services<br \/>\u25cf Prepare high-quality presentations and proposals for C-suite stakeholders at prospective merchants, and implement winning negotiation strategies<br \/>\u25cf Become the expert on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s technology stack, help new merchants understand the value of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> to solve their pain points, and handle detailed questions about our product capabilities.<br \/>\u25cf Orchestrate the entire Sales process, drive urgency and work to mutual action plans, and act as the main point of contact for merchants and internal stakeholders.<br \/>\u25cf Maintain a solid, well-organized portfolio and nurture key accounts by having a deep understanding of their industry, pain points, and needs.<br \/>\u25cf Partner with other Payment Sales Managers to share best practices, key business insights and industry trends.<br \/>\u25cf Provide feedback on local trends including competitor insights, customer needs, sales, product and marketing information.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Qualifications:<\/strong><br \/>\u25cf 5+ years Enterprise Sales experience directly in the Payments industry<br \/>\u25cf Track record of high performance, and self sourcing leads<br \/>\u25cf Highly motivated and committed to growth and development with excellent communication skills<br \/>\u25cf Solid network of potential prospects and partners within the payments landscape<br \/>\u25cf Tech-savvy, with a passion for Fintech and Payments<br \/>\u25cf Strong commercial acumen, ability to effectively negotiate complex structures<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-sales-manager-london-430650","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"manager-compliance-advisory-london-459364","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Manager, Compliance Advisory","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Checkout is looking for an experienced leader with deep expertise in financial crime compliance to establish, grow, and maintain a global second-line team. This role will oversee the compliance frameworks supporting our rapidly evolving portfolio of mass market products.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This opportunity is a perfect fit if you are excited by the prospect of leveraging the momentum and resources of a global scale-up to support the launch and scale of high velocity products. As products expand and launch, there will be an opportunity to grow your team across multiple regions.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will be expected to:<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Build the Framework:<\/strong> Establish the global framework for second-line escalations for new products; working closely with relevant regional MLROs to ensure consistency and operational excellence.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Drive Cross-Functional Alignment:<\/strong> Partner with Risk, Operations, and Product teams to align compliance requirements with fraud mitigation and user experience goals.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Monitor Emerging Trends:<\/strong> Maintain a deep understanding of financial crime typologies, regulatory guidance, and emerging industry trends, ensuring these are proactively factored into our control framework and knowledge base.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Design &amp; Deliver Training:<\/strong> Develop and deliver targeted training to business and compliance teams regarding complex financial crime and fraud risks inherent in high-volume environments.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Ensure Compliance-by-Design:<\/strong> Partner with our Regulatory Compliance function to integrate compliance requirements early in the product development lifecycle.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Own Compliance Requirements:<\/strong> Assume central responsibility for mapping and maintaining SDD, CDD, and EDD requirements for our evolving product set, ensuring relevant factors are codified into global minimum standards.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Strategic Advisory:<\/strong> Directly advise Product and Operations teams on the opportunities and risks associated with automation, AI deployment, and system scale.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Integrate Risk Assessments:<\/strong> Collaborate closely with regional MLROs to ensure product-specific risk profiles are accurately captured and factored into Business-Wide Risk Assessments.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Implement Assurance:<\/strong> Collaborate with our Assurance and Internal Controls team to design and execute robust compliance monitoring processes for new product lines.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience we are looking for: <br \/><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">6+ years of second-line compliance experience in fintech, payments, or banking at scale (neobank\/fintech experience strongly preferred).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep expertise in financial crime (AML\/CFT\/Sanctions\/Fraud) risk, with regulatory compliance experience as a strong plus.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience growing and leading a team, with cross-border\/global management experience highly desirable.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven track record in architecting frameworks for high-volume environments and working directly with technical\/product stakeholders to design solutions.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Personal qualities we look for:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Confident decision-maker:<\/strong> Ability to quickly assess risks, weigh mitigations, and provide strong, defensible rationale for your decisions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Technical fluency:<\/strong> Comfortable working directly with technical leaders to drill down into the configuration of user journeys, systems, and tooling.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI-first mindset:<\/strong> Experience deploying AI or automation tools to accelerate compliance processes at scale.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Strategic thinker:<\/strong> Ability to immerse yourself in fine details while keeping the broader organisational picture in mind.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth-oriented:<\/strong> Relentlessly curious and driven; always learning and spotting opportunities to develop yourself and others.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Proportionate and Collaborative:<\/strong> An obsession with balancing strong compliance with scalability and user experience, supported by exceptional interpersonal and communication skills.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/manager-compliance-advisory-london-459364","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"specialist-events-experiential-marketing-london-486408","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Specialist, Events & Experiential Marketing","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>'s Regional Events and Field Marketing Team support the end-to-end management and execution of hosted and sponsored events to drive business growth by partnering closely for our UK and Europe commercial teams. You will collaborate with expert regional marketers to develop and implement a comprehensive account-based marketing strategy, encompassing events, experiential marketing activities, and global initiatives. Your attention to detail, planning skills, and data-driven mindset ensure events align seamlessly with strategic goals.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><strong>How You\u2019ll Make An Impact<br \/><\/strong>As an Events Specialist, you'll support the execution of our regional and global events. You will work to build strong relationships with commercial teams and collaborate cross-functionally. Your responsibilities will span the entire event lifecycle, including:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Assist in developing and executing a regional event strategy, including the management of regional events, experiential marketing activities, and participation in major global initiatives, ensuring high-quality execution and alignment with company goals.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support end-to-end event planning, including vetting, sourcing, budget management, and on-site execution, while coordinating with cross-functional teams for seamless event experiences.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to creating audience acquisition plans grounded in data-driven insights to drive pipeline generation. Leverage your customer-centric proficiency to help build audience targeting based on inputs (e.g., TAM, ICP, Personas).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Assist in managing key performance indicators (KPIs), reporting, data analysis, and providing comprehensive program performance summaries with actionable recommendations. Work with the team to identify new ways of optimising activity against KPIs.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Help with the meticulous planning and management of events, optimising processes for scalability and efficiency, and contribute to documentation of processes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Use your excellent communication skills to convey complex thoughts and manage multiple external parties effectively.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrate strong project management skills, helping to deliver programs and activities within the team with the guidance of senior members.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What We\u2019re Looking For<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven experience in a similar role (3+ years), preferably in payments, fintech, or related sectors, or within an event agency.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">In this hands-on and high-impact role, you\\'re a self-starter, passionate about data, and proactive in pursuing new ideas.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent organisational and project management skills, with the ability to juggle multiple projects effectively.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to establish relationships with stakeholders of all levels to drive excellent collaboration.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exceptional writing, communication, and presentation skills with good attention to detail.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Operational proficiency in event management software, marketing automation, and CRM systems (e.g., Salesforce, Pardot, Zoom, or other).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Willingness and ability to travel 20%-40% of the time for event management.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/specialist-events-experiential-marketing-london-486408","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"sales-manager-london-206396","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Sales Manager","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is actively looking for an enthusiastic and talented Payments Sales Manager to join our Commercial Payments Team to drive rapid growth across various industries for our revolutionary online payment solution.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">If you are a driven and focused salesperson with a proven track record of success selling direct payment solutions to enterprise companies, in a high-growth and competitive environment, this is the role for you. In return, on top of a tremendous working environment, we offer you an unrivaled uncapped recurring commissions plan, hybrid work model and competitive benefits package.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The Sales Executive will play a key role in growing <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s payments footprint. They will be responsible for selling <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s full payments technology stack to middle market and large enterprise organizations.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Along the way, you'll collaborate closely with various in-house talents across Technology and Business to position our capabilities, products, services and solutions effectively with prospects. Desire an independent, high-achieving individual that stands out in an entrepreneurial environment and has the grit and desire to outperform sales targets.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make impact:<\/strong><br \/>\u25cf Acting as a consultative Payments strategist able to advise companies on an optimal payments structure that pulls from a myriad of solutions <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> provides<br \/>\u25cf Identify, qualify and close the most promising prospects and partners that will help <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> grow a healthy pipeline across various verticals.<br \/>\u25cf Build prospect engagement strategies and partner with marketing, business development, product and other departments to build qualified that pipeline in cold and warm channels<br \/>\u25cf Pitch our next-generation payment solutions and value-added services<br \/>\u25cf Prepare high-quality presentations and proposals for C-suite stakeholders at prospective merchants, and implement winning negotiation strategies<br \/>\u25cf Become the expert on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s technology stack, help new merchants understand the value of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> to solve their pain points, and handle detailed questions about our product capabilities.<br \/>\u25cf Orchestrate the entire Sales process, drive urgency and work to mutual action plans, and act as the main point of contact for merchants and internal stakeholders.<br \/>\u25cf Maintain a solid, well-organized portfolio and nurture key accounts by having a deep understanding of their industry, pain points, and needs.<br \/>\u25cf Partner with other Payment Sales Managers to share best practices, key business insights and industry trends.<br \/>\u25cf Provide feedback on local trends including competitor insights, customer needs, sales, product and marketing information.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Qualifications:<\/strong><br \/>\u25cf 3+ years B2B Sales experience<br \/>\u25cf Track record of high performance, and self sourcing leads<br \/>\u25cf Highly motivated and committed to growth and development with excellent communication skills<br \/>\u25cf Solid network of potential prospects and partners within the payments landscape<br \/>\u25cf Tech-savvy, with a passion for Fintech and Payments<br \/>\u25cf Strong commercial acumen, ability to effectively negotiate complex structures<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Nice to Have: <\/strong><br \/>\u25cf Experience directly in the Payments industry<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/sales-manager-london-206396","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"commercial-standard-london-10687","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"[Commercial] Standard","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What You'll Be Doing<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Strategic Growth &amp; Performance<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Become a true expert on your merchants\u2019 business, diving deep into their payment data to uncover actionable insights and opportunities.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Act as a payment performance consultant, identifying and driving initiatives that boost authorization rates, increase revenue, and lead to the adoption of new <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> products.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Serve as a strategic advisor during business reviews, translating technical performance into a compelling commercial story for your merchants.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Technical Ownership &amp; Delivery<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Serve as the primary technical authority for your merchants, mastering their API integrations and infrastructure.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead the response to critical incidents with a calm, decisive approach, coordinating internal teams to ensure swift resolution and clear communication.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/commercial-standard-london-10687","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"product-data-scientist-london-9176","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Product Data Scientist","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Product Data Scientist, you'll work as part of a cross-functional team alongside product managers, designers, and software and analytics engineers, using data and your analytical expertise to influence the strategy of our Operations and Compliance products. You'll focus on two main domains: AML Transaction Monitoring, where you will help optimize our rules-engine and scale predictive automation, and Merchant Care, where you will measure tooling efficiency and apply text analytics to drive product roadmaps.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You'll help define how we measure the success of our products, collaborate with engineers on data collection, build analytical frameworks, and run insights to find product improvement opportunities. Data Analytics at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is a highly visible function that critically impacts the company\u2019s success. As part of this group, you'll have a strong support network of Senior Data Scientists, Analytics Engineers, and Data Product Managers to help you develop your technical and data science practice.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How You\u2019ll Make an Impact<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Efficiency &amp; Product Measurement:<\/strong> Build frameworks to measure the operational efficiency and ROI of new software releases and internal tooling updates within Merchant Care.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Data Partnerships:<\/strong> Work closely with Data Analytics Engineers and Software Engineers to ensure we log and model the right data to produce high-integrity business insights.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Data-driven automations and solutions:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Run historical data simulations to analyze how changes in our deterministic AML rule thresholds affect review backlogs, and suggest optimal logic updates to our SQL-based alerts.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support the development and testing of a Level 1 (L1) automated discounting agent for transaction monitoring alerts, building on existing team frameworks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Text Analytics &amp; Insights:<\/strong> Use clustering techniques and LLM-based summary extraction on merchant ticket conversations to identify recurring user friction points and help product teams map future features.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What We\u2019re Looking For<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Technical foundations:<\/strong> Excellent data interrogation skills with <strong>SQL<\/strong> and the ability to comfortably write, read, and iterate through <strong>Python<\/strong> scripts to run data science analyses.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Foundational ML knowledge:<\/strong> A good understanding of foundational data science concepts (e.g., statistics, clustering, basic NLP workflows). You do not need experience deploying ML models to production, but you should understand how to apply them to data tasks.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Analytical Mindset:<\/strong> A strong analytical mind with a demonstrable ability to take operational problems and convert them into structured, data-informed solutions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Communication:<\/strong> Clear and precise communicator, able to explain data insights and analytical logic to non-technical stakeholders (Product Managers and Operations teams).<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Experience: Prior experience or a strong internship background in product analytics, risk\/compliance data, or a high-growth tech environment is a plus.<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/product-data-scientist-london-9176","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"brand-designer-15m-ftc-london-462677","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Brand Designer (15m FTC)","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">At <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, we power the world\u2019s most ambitious businesses. We\u2019re determined to build the best fintech brand in the world, and our Creative team is the powerhouse driving that vision.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a <strong>Brand Designer (15-month Fixed Term Contract, Maternity Cover)<\/strong>, you will turn complex, abstract business concepts into clear, compelling, and world-class creative outputs. You will take cues from our established brand system and use your expertise to apply it distinctively and consistently to make an impact every day.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role sits within our dynamic Brand &amp; Creative team in London. You will work in a highly collaborative environment alongside copywriters, fellow designers, and sharp marketers, while partnering cross-functionally with Product Design through regular Design Town Halls to cultivate our shared visual vision.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>How You\u2019ll Make an Impact<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Drive Visual Problem-Solving:<\/strong> Partner closely with copywriters and designers to explore, develop, and visualize conceptual approaches for integrated marketing campaigns across digital advertising, email, and targeted direct mail.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Execute Experiential &amp; Event Design:<\/strong> Support the creation of branded event collateral and experiential assets for our flagship global events, bringing immersive brand spaces to life with support from senior creatives.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Champion Commercial Enablement:<\/strong> Design unique RFP responses and tailored visual experiences for strategic accounts, collaborating with commercial partners to maximize our chance of winning while building scalable solutions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Evolve the Brand System:<\/strong> Act as a thoughtful guardian of our brand identity, creating new brand elements and sub-brands for key programs while adapting templated assets to make repeatable work more efficient.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Deliver Confident Craft:<\/strong> Own day-to-day stakeholder conversations, think beyond single assets to consider overall content flow, and deliver high-standard outputs that strictly match project specs.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Foster Creative Culture:<\/strong> Actively contribute to the team\u2019s creative culture by sharing ideas, learning from others, and proactively seeking constructive feedback to continuously iterate for better solutions.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>What We\u2019re Looking For<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Design Expertise:<\/strong> Strong background in graphic or brand design, with an exceptional aptitude for typography, layout, and visual storytelling across digital, print, and physical touchpoints.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>System Thinking:<\/strong> Ability to think in systems, understanding how small and large design choices affect the broader brand experience and how to scale design consistency.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Collaborative Mindset:<\/strong> A true team player who works seamlessly with cross-functional stakeholders, values diverse perspectives, and knows when to bring in support to execute a brief.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Accountability &amp; Ownership:<\/strong> Deeply accountable for your work, with a proven ability to manage project timelines, share progress clearly, and learn from mistakes to build internal trust.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Agility &amp; Self-Motivation:<\/strong> Highly self-motivated and capable of working independently in a fast-paced environment, with the flexibility to \"wear many hats\" when required.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Communication &amp; Presentation Skills:<\/strong> Confident articulating your design work, creative process, and strategic choices to non-creative internal business partners.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth Orientation:<\/strong> Driven by a love for learning, a desire to welcome constructive feedback, and an excitement to grow even if you don't check every single requirement on day one.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/brand-designer-15m-ftc-london-462677","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"front-end-engineer-london-37157","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Front end Engineer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Frontend Software Engineer embedded within a multifunctional team, you will collaborate with Product and Design counterparts in ideating, building and supporting the UI for <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> products and services, ensuring our merchants enjoy an optimal experience across all our frontend touchpoints.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We seek engineers who are versatile and enthusiastic about tackling new challenges across the full stack as we push technology forward. With your technical expertise, you will help define project priorities, manage deadlines, and ensure high-quality deliverables. You will be responsible for designing, developing, testing, deploying, maintaining, and enhancing software solutions.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Qualifications<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficient in React and TypeScript: Able to implement and maintain features with limited guidance, following best practices.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Modern software development practices, designing and architecting with security in mind<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Good practical knowledge of OOP concepts and SOLID principles<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Solid understanding of HTTP and RESTful design<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Working knowledge of Continuous Integration and Deployment workflows<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Great communication skills and ability to interact effectively with multidisciplinary teams<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong customer focus with care for accessibility and User Experience<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience building reliable, accessible and well-tested systems.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Desirable:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Some experience with C# is nice to have<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understanding of common security vulnerabilities and performance issues in web applications and knowing how to debug them<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with asynchronous, event-driven architecture<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Database experience with NoSQL, ElasticSearch or similar tool<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/front-end-engineer-london-37157","tags":["Technology"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"information-security-analyst-ii-london-30581","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Information Security Analyst II","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>The Role<\/strong><\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As an Information Security Analyst II at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, you will work across the full breadth of the information security function, spanning Governance, Risk and Compliance (GRC), AI Governance, Application Security (AppSec), Technology Risk, and Data Governance. This is a role for someone who has built solid foundational expertise and is ready to take independent ownership of security initiatives across multiple domains.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Security at Checkout operates at scale and at pace. We are a global payments business, regulated across multiple jurisdictions, building infrastructure that processes billions of transactions. Our security function needs analysts who can think across domains, communicate with engineers and executives alike, and contribute to a security programme that is genuinely embedded in how the business operates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">At L3 you will manage security programmes, lead assessments, drive policy improvements, and mentor junior colleagues. Your primary focus is independent execution with growing influence. You know your domains well enough to spot gaps, propose solutions, and take them through to completion.<br \/><br \/><strong>How You'll Make an Impact<\/strong><br \/><\/p><h2><strong>Governance, Risk and Compliance<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support workstreams within Checkout's GRC programme, including ISO 27001, SOC 2, and relevant regulatory obligations across our global licensed entities.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordinate control evidence collection activities across internal teams, ensuring continuous audit readiness rather than point-in-time preparation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Maintain and improve GRC documentation including policies, standards, procedures, and control matrices, ensuring they stay current and proportionate to Checkout's evolving risk profile.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Monitor the risk register, track remediation activity against agreed timelines, and escalate issues where commitments are at risk.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct third-party risk assessments, evaluating supplier security controls and compliance posture in line with Checkout's TPRM framework.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Track regulatory change across Checkout's operating markets including DORA, FCA\/PRA requirements, and payment scheme obligations, flagging gaps and supporting impact assessments.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>AI Governance<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support the development and operationalisation of Checkout's AI governance framework, aligned to ISO 42001, the EU AI Act, and NIST AI RMF.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct AI risk assessments for internal AI and ML systems and third-party AI tools, evaluating bias, transparency, data lineage, and control adequacy.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Maintain an inventory of AI use cases and associated risk classifications, working with product and engineering teams to embed governance requirements at the point of design.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Monitor the evolving regulatory landscape for AI in financial services and contribute to policy and control development that keeps Checkout ahead of emerging obligations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support Checkout's AI Security programme including threat modelling for agentic and LLM-based systems, and controls mapping against the OWASP LLM Top 10 and related frameworks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Technology Risk<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct technology risk assessments across infrastructure, cloud environments, and third-party systems, producing clear outputs with actionable treatment recommendations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support third-party risk management activities, evaluating supplier security controls and compliance posture in line with Checkout's vendor risk framework.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to control assurance activities including vulnerability scanning coordination, firewall and configuration reviews, and access control assessments.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Monitor Checkout's technology risk landscape, identifying emerging threats and translating them into actionable risk items for the register and leadership reporting.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support DORA-related ICT risk management obligations, contributing to resilience testing coordination and critical third-party risk assessments.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Data Governance<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support Checkout's data governance programme, including data classification, data flow mapping, and enforcement of data handling standards across the business.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to data loss prevention (DLP) controls and tooling, working with engineering and product teams to ensure sensitive data is protected throughout its lifecycle.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Assist in maintaining records of processing activities (RoPA) and supporting data protection impact assessments (DPIAs) for new systems and processing activities.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work with the privacy and legal functions to ensure data governance controls meet GDPR, UK GDPR, and applicable regional data protection requirements.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Promote data governance awareness and good data handling practices across the business, contributing to training and guidance materials for non-technical teams.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Cross-domain Collaboration and Mentoring<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work closely with Engineering, Product, Legal, Procurement, Finance, and Compliance teams to embed security requirements into processes, systems, and projects across all five domains.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Respond to security due diligence requests from merchants, partners, and regulators, drawing on multi-domain expertise to provide accurate and comprehensive responses.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide guidance and day-to-day support to junior analysts (L1 and L2), contributing to their development through knowledge sharing and review.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to the continuous improvement of Checkout's security processes, identifying inefficiencies and proposing practical solutions including automation where viable.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>What We're Looking For<\/strong><br \/><\/h1><h2><strong>Experience<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">2 to 4 years of experience in information security, IT audit, or a closely related function, ideally within payments, financial services, or fintech.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated working knowledge across more than one of the following domains: GRC, AI governance, AppSec, technology risk, or data governance. Depth in one or two with credible breadth across the others is the target profile.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Practical experience with one or more major compliance frameworks: PCI DSS (v4.0.1 preferred), ISO 27001, SOC 2, DORA, NIST CSF, or equivalent.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience supporting or managing external audits, assessments, or regulatory engagements including evidence collation and assessor liaison.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated ability to own a workstream independently, from scoping through to delivery, without requiring constant direction.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Skills and Approach<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong analytical and process-oriented mindset. You look for root causes and systemic fixes, not just point-in-time remediation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Clear written and verbal communication. You can translate security concepts for technical teams and business stakeholders with equal clarity.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable operating with ambiguity across a complex domain landscape. You can prioritise without perfect information.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborative and pragmatic. You understand that security must work with the business and that influence matters as much as expertise.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Methodical and well-organised, with a track record of delivering on commitments across concurrent workstreams.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Preferred<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Relevant certification in one or more domains: CISA, CISM, CISSP, PCIP, ISO 27001 Lead Implementer or Auditor, Certified AppSec Practitioner (CAP), or equivalent.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with cloud environments (AWS, Azure, GCP) from a security or compliance perspective.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposure to AI and ML systems from a risk, governance, or security perspective.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with security or GRC tooling such as Wiz, Qualys, Microsoft Sentinel, ServiceNow GRC, or similar.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understanding of agentic AI and LLM security risks including OWASP LLM Top 10, prompt injection, and data exfiltration vectors.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h1><\/h1><h2><strong>Hybrid Working Model<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">All of our offices globally are onsite three times per week (Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday). We've worked towards enabling teams to work collaboratively in the same space while also being able to partner with colleagues globally. During your days at the office, we offer great snacks, breakfast, and lunch options in all of our locations.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/information-security-analyst-ii-london-30581","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"information-security-analyst-ii-grc-london-10633","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Information Security Analyst II (GRC)","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>The Role<\/strong><\/h1><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As an Information Security Analyst II within the GRC team, you will take meaningful ownership of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>'s governance, risk and compliance programmes. This is a role for someone who has moved beyond task execution and is ready to drive workstreams, lead compliance activities, and act as a trusted point of contact for internal teams and external assessors.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will work across Checkout's core compliance frameworks including PCI DSS v4.0.1, ISO 27001, SOC 2, and emerging regulatory obligations such as DORA and the EU AI Act, supporting our global footprint across Europe, MENA, APAC, and the Americas. You will coordinate audit evidence activities, conduct risk assessments, improve GRC processes, and support the development of junior colleagues.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role sits at the heart of how Checkout manages risk. We don't just audit and report. We own the risk narrative, drive the control environment, and ensure the business can grow with confidence in regulated markets worldwide.<br \/><br \/><strong>How You'll Make an Impact<\/strong><br \/><\/p><h2><strong>Governance, Risk and Compliance Programme Management<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own and manage defined workstreams within Checkout's GRC programme, including PCI DSS v4.0.1, ISO 27001, SOC 2, and relevant regulatory obligations across our global licensed entities.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordinate control evidence collection activities across internal teams, ensuring continuous audit readiness rather than point-in-time preparation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Maintain and improve GRC documentation including policies, standards, procedures, and control matrices, ensuring they stay current and proportionate to Checkout's evolving risk profile.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Perform gap analyses against new or evolving requirements including DORA and the EU AI Act, translating findings into prioritised remediation plans.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support monitoring of the risk register, track remediation activity against agreed timelines, and escalate issues where commitments are at risk.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct third-party risk assessments, evaluating supplier security controls and compliance posture in line with Checkout's TPRM framework.<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>Audit and Assessment Support<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Act as a key liaison between internal teams and external auditors, QSAs, and assessors across PCI DSS, ISO 27001, IT General Controls (ITGCs) and SOC 2 certification cycles.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Prepare and deliver evidence packages, coordinate walkthroughs, and manage audit findings through to closure.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support end-to-end response process for merchant assurance questionnaires and due diligence inquiries, ensuring all technical and regulatory queries are addressed with accuracy and within agreed SLAs.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support quarterly and annual compliance activities including vulnerability scanning, penetration testing coordination, access reviews, and firewall configuration reviews.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Policy, Controls and Regulatory Coverage<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Apply working knowledge of PCI DSS v4.0.1, ISO 27001\/27002, SOC 2, DORA, NIST CSF, and other applicable frameworks to day-to-day GRC work.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support meeting regulatory change across Checkout's operating markets including FCA\/PRA requirements and payment scheme obligations, flagging gaps and supporting impact assessments.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proactively identify inefficiencies in GRC processes and propose practical improvements, including automation where viable.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to the development and refinement of GRC tooling, dashboards, and reporting to improve visibility of risk and compliance posture across the business.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Stakeholder Engagement and Mentoring<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work closely with Engineering, Product, Legal, Procurement, and Finance to embed security and compliance requirements into processes, systems, and projects.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Respond to PCI DSS, ISO 27001, and broader security-related due diligence requests from merchants, partners, and regulators.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide guidance and day-to-day support to junior analysts (L1 and L2), contributing to their development through knowledge sharing and review.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Promote a security-first culture across Checkout through proactive engagement, awareness sessions, and accessible guidance for non-security teams.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h1><strong>What We're Looking For<\/strong><br \/><\/h1><h2><strong>Experience<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">2 to 4 years of experience in GRC, information security compliance, IT audit, or a closely related function, ideally within payments, financial services, or fintech.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Practical working knowledge of PCI DSS (v4.0.1 preferred), ISO 27001, and SOC 2. Familiarity with DORA, NIST CSF, or the EU AI Act is a plus.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience supporting or directly managing external audits and assessments, including evidence collation and assessor liaison.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated ability to own a programme workstream independently, from planning through to delivery.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Well-versed in risk management processes include risk identification, third-party risk management and merchant due diligence.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Skills and Approach<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Clear written and verbal communication. You can translate a compliance requirement or risk finding for a technical team and a business stakeholder with equal clarity.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Analytical and process-oriented mindset. You look for root causes, not just point-in-time fixes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable operating with ambiguity. You can prioritise and structure your work without every requirement being fully defined upfront.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Methodical and well-organised, with strong attention to detail and a consistent track record of delivering on commitments.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborative and pragmatic. You understand that security and compliance must work with the business, not against it.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Preferred<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">CISA, CISM, PCIP, ISO 27001 Lead Implementer or Auditor, or equivalent certification.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with cloud environments (AWS, Azure, GCP) in a GRC or compliance context.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with GRC tooling, risk platforms, or compliance automation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposure to AI governance frameworks such as ISO 42001, EU AI Act, or NIST AI RMF.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Hybrid Working Model<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">All of our offices globally are onsite three times per week (Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday). We've worked towards enabling teams to work collaboratively in the same space while also being able to partner with colleagues globally. During your days at the office, we offer great snacks, breakfast, and lunch options in all of our locations.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/information-security-analyst-ii-grc-london-10633","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-analyst-financial-crime-product-compliance-london-389977","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Analyst, Financial Crime Product Compliance","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Job Description<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We\u2019re looking for a Senior Analyst to join our Financial Crime Product Compliance team. <br \/><br \/>This is a role supporting new product launches and expansion of existing products on a global scale; helping <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><u>Checkout.com<\/u><\/a> maintain a world-class standard in financial crime requirements.<br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will coordinate between Commercial, Product, and Compliance teams, holding stakeholders to their commitments so that we can launch products with speed and integrity. The successful candidate must deeply understand AML\/CTF and work closely with stakeholders across global teams.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How You'll Make An Impact<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead the product-to-compliance workflow. You will ensure Product teams provide complete and accurate product information for Compliance to perform risk assessments and map AML controls for MLRO approval.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support regional MLROs across the globe by ensuring their bespoke requirements are captured and addressed. You will keep regional stakeholders informed and ensure their input is integrated into the launch process.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Monitor the progress of new initiatives through the governance lifecycle. You will follow up with stakeholders to ensure requirements are met on time, and call out risks to the launch timeline when information is missing or delayed.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build strong partnerships with business, product, and technology stakeholders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Oversee the consistency of documentation and data entry across the framework. You will ensure that all inputs and outputs are standardized, allowing for accurate and reliable.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work with other product and engineering leaders to ensure alignment with their roadmaps and delivery.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Gain a deep understanding of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> \u2019s customers and business.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Foster a team culture that upholds <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s operating principles.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">3+ years of experience within financial crime compliance<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working in the payments sector: acquiring\/issuing\/payouts<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You have a sharp eye for detail, ensuring that the information shared between teams is accurate and that our reporting reflects the reality of our operations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Good knowledge of PSRs, MLRs, PSD2 etc and ability to interpret regulations, assess the impact on new product implementation and collate AML\/CTF controls requirements<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to effectively communicate with stakeholders across different levels and functions within Product, Engineering, Operations, Compliance Advisory etc<br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">All of our offices globally are onsite 3 times per week (Monday, Tuesday, and Wednesday). We\u2019ve worked towards enabling teams to work collaboratively in the same space, while also being able to partner with colleagues globally. During your days at the office, we offer amazing snacks, breakfast, and lunch options in all of our locations.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-analyst-financial-crime-product-compliance-london-389977","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"specialist-marketing-operations-london-289157","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Specialist, Marketing Operations","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Job Description<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for an ambitious, analytical, and AI-native Specialist to join our global Growth Operations &amp; Lifecycle hub. Reporting directly to the Head of Growth Operations &amp; Lifecycle Globally, this is a pure, technical operations and systems role. You won't be managing campaign calendars, writing email copy, or designing creative assets. Instead, you will be the absolute engine room of our global marketing team\u2014architecting, scaling, and optimizing the technical data flows that power our multi-segment execution across Enterprise, Mid-Marketing and growth segments.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Your mandate is to drive the continuous technical evolution of our MarTech stack. You will take ownership of evaluating new technologies, leading platform migrations, removing architectural technical debt, and ensuring our core systems are unified, scalable, and leak-free.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Role Overview | Remit and Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>1. MarTech Architecture &amp; Infrastructure Evolution<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead Technology Evaluations: Serve as the operational lead for major software and platform reviews; gathering cross-functional technical requirements, managing vendor evaluations, and mapping out structural dependencies.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Stack Overhaul &amp; Integration: Lead the technical migration and backend overhaul of our core marketing systems, ensuring seamless data synchronization and configuration with our primary CRM environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">System Integrity &amp; Diagnostics: Conduct routine, deep-dive technical audits of our infrastructure to identify data mismatches, routing bottlenecks, or automation leaks, resolving non-routine platform issues independently.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>2. Multi-Segment Operational Scaling<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Cross-Segment Frameworks: Build and manage the backend routing, scoring, and data models required to simultaneously fuel long-cycle Enterprise buyer journeys and high-velocity B2B segments.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">AI-Native Automation: Actively pilot and integrate AI-driven tools, webhooks, and modern automation scripts into our daily infrastructure to scale system capabilities and erase manual bottlenecks.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Agile Project Delivery: Navigate fast-moving global technical initiatives by managing an operational backlog, scoping technical tasks with precision, and executing updates with speed and rigor.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>3. Technical Governance &amp; Attribution<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Attribution Architecture: Build and maintain the backend tracking frameworks necessary for advanced multi-touch marketing attribution, connecting system performance straight to commercial outcomes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Global Guardrails: Establish and enforce strict operational governance, unified system labeling protocols, and clear data hygiene standards across all global regions to ensure a single source of truth.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Role Overview | Desired Background &amp; Competencies<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The Ops DNA: You have solid, dedicated experience purely in Marketing Operations, Marketing Systems Engineering, or MarTech Management within a fast-paced B2B, SaaS, or Fintech environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Platform Expertise: You are an administrator-level power user of major enterprise marketing automation platforms and possess a highly sophisticated understanding of CRM data architecture and relational databases.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Migration &amp; Implementation Experience: You\u2019ve been through the trenches of a major platform migration, software implementation, or complex technology onboarding process before. You know how to evaluate tech objectively and plan for zero system downtime.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">An AI Native: You don't treat AI as a buzzword. You naturally use AI utilities, automated workflows, and modern tooling to supercharge your own productivity and solve complex logical puzzles.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lateral &amp; Analytical Thinker: You possess massive analytical capability. You don\u2019t just execute a technical ticket blindly\u2014you look at systems laterally, frame your work in terms of commercial outcomes (not just activities), and understand how a technical change impacts the broader pipeline.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ambitious &amp; Resilient: You thrive on ownership, excel in fast-moving environments, and are comfortable managing multiple technical projects simultaneously while maintaining an uncompromising quality bar.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/specialist-marketing-operations-london-289157","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"associate-digital-content-writer-london-171032","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Associate, Digital Content Writer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is actively looking for a talented <strong>Digital Content Writer<\/strong> to join our fast-paced Communications and Content team. This role is perfect for a commercially-minded, AI-native writer with 3-5 years of experience in tech or fintech who is looking to apply their skills in a high-growth environment.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Working closely with digital, social, and communications peers, you will be responsible for creating high-quality web content and drafting impactful materials for our spokespeople. You will own the development of a range of technical and non-technical content pieces, and with the support of your colleagues have the opportunity to contribute to longer-form data-driven reports and the wider content strategy and roadmap.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you'll make an impact:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>High-quality web content:<\/strong> Take ownership of creating and publishing compelling thought leadership articles, and owning the publication process via our CMS.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Commercially-oriented copywriting:<\/strong> Draft talk tracks for speakers, social copy, merchant interviews, LinkedIn-native thought leadership, and op-eds used by our key spokespeople across online and social channels.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Long-form and data-driven collaboration:<\/strong> Support our existing content writers on longer-form pieces, data-driven content, whitepapers, and industry reports.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Cross-functional alignment:<\/strong> Work closely with Digital, Social, and Communication teams, ensuring that content is briefed in with the right creative assets and that all messaging is tightly aligned.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stakeholder engagement:<\/strong> Collaborate regularly with the Communications team on messaging accuracy, while occasionally engaging with senior stakeholders and commercial team members to gather insights and approvals.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Strategic project support:<\/strong> You can collaborate with your colleagues to provide input into more complex projects, including content strategy, working with Product Marketing on technical pieces, and contributing to the overall content roadmap.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI-native workflows:<\/strong> Act as an AI-native practitioner, using LLMs to generate first drafts, bounce ideas, and help refine existing work to increase pace and execution quality.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What we're looking for:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>3-5 years of experience<\/strong> in content writing, ideally with a background in fintech, tech, or payments.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Exceptional writing versatility:<\/strong> Ability to switch seamlessly between a snappy social post, a conversational merchant interview, and a technical product marketing piece.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Operational sharpness:<\/strong> Experience working with web CMS platforms and collaborating with creative teams to brief in and deploy assets.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>An AI-forward mindset:<\/strong> You proactively use LLMs as a daily tool to structure thinking, draft content, and refine output.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>A collaborative, \"One team\" approach:<\/strong> You thrive when working closely with peers in Comms, Social, and Digital, aiming for solutions that enable the wider team to succeed.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/associate-digital-content-writer-london-171032","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"manager-bank-relationships-london-273749","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Manager, Bank Relationships","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is seeking a motivated Relationship Manager to lead our bank relationships across Europe and the UK. Reporting to the Global Head of Bank Relationships you will be working with Checkout\u2019s key bank partners and will be the main point of contact for external and internal queries.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About You:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to build strong professional relationships<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent verbal and communication skills.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong business orientation and ability to manage and prioritise high workload in a fast-paced environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">\u201cCan do\u201d attitude with a positive mind set<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in cash and treasury management services<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Good understanding of bank accounts opening and on-boarding processes, including KYC and EDD approvals.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What you will be doing:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Owning the implementation projects for Europe and the UK, and be the global coordinator for the implementation managers across all regions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Establish and manage relationships with existing contacts at partner banks and internal stakeholders;<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordinating the execution of Due Diligence questionnaires, KYC and Onboarding requirements;<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Providing assistance on banking infrastructure requirements in new countries \/ verticals;<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Monitoring and updating online bank accounts accesses;<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Efficiently managing queries from internal and external partners, related to payments processing and compliance topics.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordination of external bank meetings.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Act as primary point of cover when the Global Head of Bank Relationships is out of office, coordinating all queries, meetings and managing escalations<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/manager-bank-relationships-london-273749","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"forward-deployed-ai-accelerator-operations-london-187811","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Forward Deployed AI Accelerator, Operations","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s Operations organisation is undergoing a fundamental transformation in how it works. We're building a team of Forward Deployed AI Accelerators embedded directly within Operations to make AI the default mode for all work - not an occasional tool, but the foundation of how every frontline operations analyst at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> works.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, our frontline teams are already using AI to reduce multi-hour processes. The FDA team exists to take what's working and systematically scale it across the entire operations organisation.<\/p><h2>What you'll do<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Forward Deployed AI Accelerator, you'll be embedded with a function of<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">approximately 20-30 analysts organised by team or workflow. You'll build alongside them, and you will help them fundamentally change how they operate. Your measure of success is the number of workflows you've permanently transformed and the extent to which those in your group start any task with an AI tool.<\/p><h3>Responsibilities<\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identify and document the highest-leverage workflow transformations within your group's day-to-day work by deeply understanding their processes and outputs<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build custom tools, agents, automations, and skills tailored to each operations analyst's specific responsibilities<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coach and partner with each operations analyst through a progressive journey: from awareness, to first win, to regular AI integration, to full workflow transformation, to self-sufficiency<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Teach analysts to build and iterate on their own tools over time, creating independence<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Recognise patterns across your cohort and systematically scale what works - a tool built for one operations analyst should become reusable for their peers<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Document every tool, playbook, and transformation pattern you build so the entire FDA team can use each other's work<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Share wins visibly within your cohort and with leadership to build momentum, inspire, and celebrate success<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Track individual and cohort progress rigorously against a defined maturity model, moving every operations analyst toward self-sustaining, AI-first work<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Prepare operations analysts for an agentic future - not just prompt writing, but designing, building, and overseeing autonomous, multi-agent workflows<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2>Who you are<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for people who have already lived the transformation they'll be driving for others. You've used AI to fundamentally change how you work - not as a novelty, but as your default operating mode.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You are a deep AI practitioner. You build agents, automations, and tools fluently. You don't just know what AI can do in theory - you've built things that changed how real work gets done. You can build in real time alongside the people you support.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You are an exceptional coach and communicator. You can meet people wherever they are. You create desire for progress, and you adapt your approach to each person.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You understand how operations work. You either have direct experience in operations or can quickly learn the workflows, deliverables, tools, and pressures of your assigned group. You know that understanding someone's work is a prerequisite to transforming it.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You are a pattern recogniser. When you build something that works for one person, you immediately see how it applies to others. You think in systems, not one-off solutions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You are high-caliber, persistent, and versatile. Your skills and experience are valuable across the company. You're the kind of person who could succeed in many roles at Checkout.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You bias toward action and speed. You'd rather show someone a working proof-of-concept on their own deliverable today than present a polished deck about what's theoretically possible next quarter.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You are comfortable with ambiguity and evolution. This is a new team building a new operating model. The playbook will be rewritten as we learn. You thrive in that environment.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3>Minimum requirements<\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">3+ years of professional experience in a role requiring analytical thinking, problem-solving, and cross-functional collaboration<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated, hands-on experience building AI-powered tools, agents, automations, or workflows that transformed real work processes (not just using AI as a chatbot - building with it)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Track record of coaching, teaching, or enabling others - formally or informally - with evidence that people you've helped actually changed how they work<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain technical concepts to non-technical audiences and adapt your style to different learners<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfort working across multiple workstreams and relationships simultaneously (you'll be supporting up to 30 analysts at varying stages of their AI journey)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3>Preferred qualifications<\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in risk, fraud, compliance, or a closely adjacent function<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency with AI development tools and platforms (e.g., Claude, Claude Code, Codex, custom agent frameworks, API integrations, workflow automation tools)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with change management, organisational transformation, or large-scale enablement programs<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with the following technology stacks (e.g., Zendesk, Salesforce, analytics platforms, content management tool)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience building and scaling internal tools, templates, or playbooks that were adopted beyond your immediate team<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Background in consulting, solutions engineering, technical account management, or other client-facing technical roles<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/forward-deployed-ai-accelerator-operations-london-187811","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"early-career-programme-manager-london-6164","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Early Career, Programme Manager","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About this role: <\/strong>This is a high-impact role at the strategic heart of our future talent engine. We are looking for an innovative, globally-minded Early Careers professional to be the face, voice, and leader of our NextGen brand. In this role, you aren't just a program manager; you are a brand ambassador, a community builder, and an operational architect. We are seeking a product-minded problem solver who is excited to lead our foundational programs, design top-tier university partnerships, meet the brightest emerging talent, and define what global excellence looks like. Based in our London HQ, you will set the global standards and frameworks that ensure our early careers talent thrives consistently across all our international hubs.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What you\u2019ll be doing?<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Driving our Global NextGen Brand:<\/strong> You will be the primary custodian representing our early careers brand in the market. Your goal is to establish us as the top global choice for ambitious students and graduates through creative events, digital engagement, and immersive experiences.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Architecting University Partnerships:<\/strong> You will design, build, and oversee high-quality, targeted university partnership frameworks to extract top-tier talent internationally. This goes beyond traditional career fairs; it is about creating deep, long-term strategic links with core global faculties and career centers.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Creating Multi-Region Talent Pipelines:<\/strong> You\u2019ll be responsible for scaling and nurturing diverse, high-performing candidate pipelines across our key global entities, ensuring a standardized yet culturally adaptable approach to discovering future leaders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Designing Global Recruitment Strategies:<\/strong> You\u2019ll spearhead the creation of high-quality, standardized recruitment and assessment processes. This includes designing cutting-edge, centralized assessment centers and ensuring a flawless, world-class candidate experience globally.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Managing the End-to-End Program Lifecycle:<\/strong> You will take global ownership of the entire Early Careers journey, ensuring programs run seamlessly from initial application configurations to program graduation and permanent team placement.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Enabling Global Managers &amp; Nurturing Hubs:<\/strong> A great program needs world-class support. You will build toolkits, frameworks, and training modules to enable international hiring managers to effectively mentor, manage, and accelerate early-career talent on the ground.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Cross-Functional &amp; Regional Collaboration:<\/strong> You will partner closely with regional Talent Acquisition stakeholders and People Partners worldwide to ensure local programs align beautifully with our global standards while matching regional business operational structures.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>What we\u2019re looking for:<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Ambitious &amp; High Energy: <\/strong>You don\u2019t just want to execute a playbook; you want to build a legacy. You bring a high level of energy, urgency, and passion to everything you do, motivated by making a lasting impact on young careers.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Master of Global Stakeholder Management: <\/strong>You excel at building trust and navigating diverse perspectives across international leadership teams. You can align corporate objectives with regional nuances to ensure universal program buy-in.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Creative &amp; Forward-Thinking Architect: <\/strong>You challenge the status quo of traditional graduate schemes. You bring fresh, innovative ideas to talent attraction, and you are excited to embed emerging tools (like AI literacy and automated skills mapping) into the program structure.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Natural Networker &amp; Community Builder: <\/strong>You genuinely love connecting with people. You are naturally skilled at inspiring a room full of graduates, managing corporate relationships, or collaborating with academic deans.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Data-Driven Problem Solver: <\/strong>You treat talent acquisition as an optimization problem. When you detect process friction, pipeline bottlenecks, or retention gaps, you proactively design structural, measurable solutions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Collaborative Global Spirit: <\/strong>You thrive in a borderless environment, working seamlessly with international teams to deliver localized impact backed by global alignment.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong> Why join:<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a unique opportunity to fundamentally own and scale a world-class NextGen brand from our global headquarters. You will enjoy the autonomy to innovate locally in London while steering the strategic direction of a supportive, global team. If you are passionate about defining how the next generation of global fintech talent is discovered and developed, we would love to meet you.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/early-career-programme-manager-london-6164","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"software-engineer-i-london-229763","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Software Engineer I","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Global payments are complex and ever-evolving. At Checkout our software engineers develop the next-generation payments technologies that enable our Merchants to boost their acceptance rates, cut processing costs, fight fraud, and create cutting edge technology that enables extraordinary customer experiences.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We're looking for Software engineers who bring fresh ideas, have a curious nature and are passionate about working in an Engineering environment which focuses on building products to achieve the company's strategic goals. You\u2019ll get to work with teams from across <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s portfolio of products and services who all have a real customer first philosophy.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Software engineer, you will lead and drive specific projects critical to Checkout's needs with opportunities to switch teams and projects as you and our fast-paced business grow and evolve. We need our engineers to be versatile, display exceptional leadership qualities and be enthusiastic to take on new problems across the full-stack as we continue to push technology forward. With your technical expertise you will lead project priorities, deadlines, and deliverables. You will design, develop, test, deploy, maintain, and enhance software solutions.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What are we looking for:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficiency in C# .NET, Java, or Go, with a strong understanding of software development principles in either a backend or full stack environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Great communication skills and ability to interact effectively with a wide range of stakeholders<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working in agile environments and delivering high-quality code within tight deadlines<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to work independently as well as part of a team<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Someone who is AI proficient or AI curious, you will be hungry to embrace what the latest technology has to offer to enhance yours and your teams productivity<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Payments or financial knowledge is a plus, but not a necessity<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be part of, and collaborate with, cross-functional teams including product management, across a large engineering community.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Define and design loosely coupled, scalable systems in a wider microservices using industry best practices.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Stay up-to-date, use, and spread knowledge of the latest technologies used by Checkout.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Write clean, maintainable, extendable and testable code on some of Checkout\u2019s most impactful systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build, own and operate your systems to the highest levels of resilience and service.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Mentor junior team members and assist in their technical development<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/software-engineer-i-london-229763","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-associate-liquidity-management-london-390560","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Associate, Liquidity Management","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is seeking a driven and self motivated Senior Associate with experience in Liquidity Management, to join our Treasury team in London! The successful candidate will be working on the buildout and deepening of liquidity risk management capabilities globally and regionally.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">In response to the continued scaling and expansion of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> in terms of volume, geographic footprint, payment methods, currencies supported, and product diversity, you'll be identifying and quantifying liquidity risks, contributing to the design and implementation of a liquidity and funding management framework, monitoring and managing these risks on an ongoing basis.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The ideal candidate will have excellent interpersonal skills and work with a variety of stakeholders, including commercial, product managers and clients, be diligent and well-organised, adaptable to the changing demands of the role, and capable of independently working toward specific goals! The ideal candidate has a positive hands-on and can-do-attitude, willing to work in a fast-paced environment.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What you'll be doing:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> in all aspects of the day to day monitoring, analysis and management of the legal entities and regional liquidity positions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understand current business model and payment flows, to understand and identify liquidity risks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Develop basic models, undertake forecasting and execute on liquidity management strategies, procedures and controls to mitigate and manage these risks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to the design and set up of early warning\/key risk indicators<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Execute liquidity management and hedging strategies, including management of intra-group funding and liquid assets<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support documentation of policies and procedures associated with the above<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Participate in new product and expansion initiatives for liquidity risks and funding requirements<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to the implementation of liquidity and funding management frameworks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Involvement in strategic and regulatory initiatives within the treasury and liquidity space<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About you:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">2-5 years of treasury experience<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understanding of liquidity management strategies and activities<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience of liquidity risk management frameworks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Quantitative and analytical skills, including basic Excel modelling skills<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong communication skills and an ability to build and leverage cross-functional relationships<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Attention to detail and proactivity crucial<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience of working through change and implementing new processes preferable<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Knowledge of regulatory frameworks, including either banking or EMI\/PI regulations and safeguarding beneficial<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-associate-liquidity-management-london-390560","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"associate-deal-analyst-london-404931","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Associate, Deal Analyst","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Job Description<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is seeking an Associate, Deal Analyst to join our growing Sales Operations team in our London office  to support our global growth. This role sits within our Commercial department.<br \/><br \/>We are looking for someone who is highly motivated, detail-oriented and confident in collaborating cross-functionally with internal teams throughout the organisation. Within this role, you will be working with teams such as Sales, Legal, Risk, Onboarding and Finance. We are looking for someone who can build for scale  -  a strong interest in improving and streamlining processes, and a comfort with AI and its possibilities here is vital. <br \/><br \/>The ideal candidate is a self-starter that is able to work autonomously and thrives in an entrepreneurial environment in which they can exceed expectations through personal drive.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">How you\u2019ll make an impact<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support and adapt the execution of new processes with a focus on pace and customer experience<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide proactive support and guidance to the sales team and our merchants to complete the onboarding process.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be a creative problem solver who finds a way to meet clients\u2019 needs while adhering to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>\u2019s policies.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Respond to inbound requests from the Sales team regarding onboarding or reviewing existing clients\u2019 profiles.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure processes which mean we have accurate and up-to-date documentation related to deal structures and contracts.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Create and review customer agreements\/contracts<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build and maintain positive relationships with internal stakeholders, especially sales, Customer Onboarding, and Legal teams.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Manage multiple internal stakeholders while delivering exceptional service<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support with the onboarding of new colleagues<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Based on the above, create impact through projects improving these processes<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><br \/><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Very detailed oriented<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfort with AI<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fluent English<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent customer service, customer-facing, and problem-solving skills<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Self-starter who can work independently with minimal supervision<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fast learner and motivated by new challenges<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Humble and hungry to learn<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Able to work under pressure, multi-task, and consistently meet tight deadlines<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Superb communication skills, ability to interact with multidisciplinary senior stakeholders<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with the payment processing industry and regulations is a plus<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience using Salesforce a plus<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/associate-deal-analyst-london-404931","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-machine-learning-engineer-london-463490","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Machine Learning Engineer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/>As an ML (Machine Learning) Engineer at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> in the Disputes ML team, you will contribute to the development of our brand-new, ML-driven dispute optimisation suite. This is a unique opportunity to get in on the ground floor of an expanding area, grow alongside top-tier engineers, and make a tangible impact on millions of disputes.<br \/><br \/>You will be building solutions that power our stack of value added services in the Disputes area. We\u2019re a growing team in an expanding area within the company and we\u2019re looking for individuals who have strong ownership, are passionate about productionising ML and have a pragmatic approach to converting big problems into smaller iterations to constantly deliver value.<br \/><br \/><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build systems for training, deploying and monitoring machine learning models used in our Disputes platform, at scale<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build and optimize data pipelines and backend services to process dispute and payment data in real time<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build and scale our feature store for use-cases both online and offline<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take complete ownership of delivering comprehensive, end-to-end features within a startup-like setting, driving the entire lifecycle from requirement refinement, data pipeline construction and model training to troubleshooting and production deployment<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Turn raw data into production-ready features that feed our dispute systems<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate with platform and backend engineers to integrate models seamlessly<br \/><br \/><strong>Experience and qualifications<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">5+ years of experience as MLOps \/ML Engineer<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">High proficiency in writing clear, production-ready Python code<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with production ML models (online or offline) and standard MLOps practices<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with monitoring and observability of production systems, with a strong sense of ownership<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with training and operating models on Databricks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity in Cloud-based application development (we use AWS &amp; Azure)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with one or more ML frameworks and technologies: scikit-learn, xgboost, TensorFlow, PyTorch, Spark, SageMaker, Vertex AI, Kubeflow, Seldon, Triton<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong communication skills, able to express ideas clearly and collaborate across teams<br \/><br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-machine-learning-engineer-london-463490","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-network-engineer-london-384377","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Network Engineer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are a fast-growing global FinTech company, operating across multiple regions with a footprint spanning trading floors, data centres, and corporate offices worldwide. As a <strong>Senior Network Engineer,<\/strong> you will own the design, delivery and ongoing optimisation of our corporate office network infrastructure globally. You will define the standards that govern how office networks are built, ensure consistent deployment across locations, and deliver reliable, secure connectivity that supports modern workplace technologies and collaboration tools.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a hands-on, high-impact role. You'll be the subject matter expert who turns business requirements into reliable, secure, and scalable network solutions, from greenfield office buildouts to major refits of existing sites.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Network Design &amp; Standards<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Define and maintain global network architecture standards for corporate office environments, covering LAN, WAN, Wi-Fi and SD-WAN, ensuring consistent and repeatable deployments across all locations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Develop and maintain network build standards, configuration templates, and technical runbooks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure all designs meet FinTech regulatory and security requirements (e.g., PCI-DSS, SOC2)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own the reference architecture and standard design patterns used for new office deployments and office expansions.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Operations, Monitoring &amp; User Experience<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide escalation support (L3\/L4) for network incidents across all office locations, leading root cause analysis and driving permanent fixes<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own end-to-end network observability across all office environments, including monitoring, telemetry, packet loss, bandwidth utilisation and device health. Ensure Wi-Fi and network performance delivers a high-quality employee experience across all office locations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Define and track network SLAs and KPIs for office environments, with regular reporting to IT leadership<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Champion a user-first approach to network performance, proactively identifying and resolving degradation before it generates tickets<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work closely with IT Engineering and AV teams to ensure a seamless connectivity experience for meeting rooms, collaboration tools, and hybrid working<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive continuous improvement initiatives based on monitoring data, user feedback, and post-incident reviews<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Office Buildouts &amp; Refits<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead end-to-end network delivery for new office openings and major refits globally from initial scoping and design through to commissioning and handover<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Engage and manage third-party vendors, cabling contractors, and ISPs to ensure on-time, on-budget delivery<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct site surveys and produce detailed network designs, rack layouts, and cabling schematics<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure all office network deployments adhere to global architecture standards and security requirements.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Produce high- and low-level network design documentation for office network deployments.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Stakeholder &amp; Project Management<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Partner with Real Estate, Workplace, GTSO Teams and senior IT leadership to plan and scope network requirements for new and changing office locations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Produce clear technical documentation and present designs to both technical and non-technical stakeholders<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Manage project timelines, risks, and dependencies across concurrent office programmes<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Required Skills &amp; Experience<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">8+ years of hands-on network engineering experience, with a strong focus on corporate office environments<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Expertise in Cisco and\/or Juniper switching and routing (BGP, OSPF, VLAN design, QoS)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Solid experience with enterprise Wi-Fi platforms (Cisco Meraki, Aruba, or equivalent)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven track record delivering network buildouts or major refits in a corporate or financial services environment<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with SD-WAN technologies (Meraki, Fortinet or similar)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong understanding of network security principles: firewalls, network segmentation, 802.1X<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with MPLS, VPLS, and internet circuit procurement<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working with third-party vendors and ISPs across multiple geographies<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable working in a regulated environment (PCI-DSS, SOC2 awareness is a plus)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Desirable<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">CCNP \/ CCIE (Routing &amp; Switching)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fortinet NSE 4-7 (Network Security)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposure to network automation tooling (Ansible, Python, NetBox)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with ITSM platforms (Jira Service Management, ServiceNow or similar)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with network monitoring tools (LogicMonitor, SolarWinds, Elasticsearch, Grafana, Splunk or Datadog)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with data centre networking concepts and their integration with corporate office networks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-network-engineer-london-384377","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"company-secretarial-associate-london-46030","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Company Secretarial Associate","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is seeking a dedicated Company Secretarial Associate to join our Legal team to support business growth and expansion. <br \/><br \/>You'll be a part of our Corporate Legal team and will lead on Board and corporate entity management matters for several companies across multiple jurisdictions. You will be working closely with senior management and collaborating with stakeholders across the business (e.g. Finance, Treasury, Tax, Compliance, etc.) on all corporate, governance and group administration matters.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Leading on board governance matters across the group, including supporting company directors globally in ensuring the boards function efficiently and effectively, scheduling and preparing for board meetings, assisting with taking meeting minutes and managing board delegations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Managing external counsel and corporate service providers.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Working with the Corporate Legal team and the wider business on capital actions (dividends, capitalisations etc.) and other corporate transactions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Leading on group entity management, including incorporations, director and officer appointments and dissolutions, managing corporate filings and maintaining statutory registers. Drafting and reviewing a variety of legal documents (corporate resolutions and minutes of board meetings, etc.).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Assisting the Finance team with annual audits across the group.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Arranging for signatures, notarisation and apostilles for various legal documents.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Helping to improve, streamline and automate existing workflows and processes<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><br \/><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Paralegal certificate and\/or Bachelor\u2019s degree from an accredited college or university<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">5-6+ years of relevant corporate paralegal experience or company secretary expertise with a law firm and\/or in-house at a public or private company<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><strong>What we're looking for<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working internationally (prior experience in a high-growth fintech or another fast-paced, dynamic environment would be a plus).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent time management skills and the ability to handle a high workload.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to work autonomously and independently with minimal supervision.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">High level of written and interpersonal communication skills.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent level of accuracy and attention to detail.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be open-minded and willing to accept new challenges.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Be a systemic thinker with proven abilities for process improvement and simplification.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience or interest in legal and technical operations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Prior experience working with CSC Navigator or other entity management software is a plus.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Dedication to working within the corporate secretarial sector.<br \/><br \/><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/company-secretarial-associate-london-46030","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"legal-counsel-product-regulatory-london-369183","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Legal Counsel, Product & Regulatory","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Role<\/strong><br \/><br \/>We are excited to be growing our incredible London Legal team and are looking to hire a Legal Counsel with a payments and regulatory background in London. <br \/><br \/>As Legal Counsel, you will work closely with all areas of the business and take a collaborative approach to solving complex legal challenges. You will be expected to advise on compliance with financial services and payments regulations, interact with regulators and assist in the implementation of broader regulatory projects and product launches across the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> group.<br \/><br \/>The successful candidate will be able to handle a busy workload with minimal supervision, demonstrating excellent critical judgment, quick thinking and agility. This is a great opportunity to work on a broad range of projects across multiple jurisdictions, learn new areas of law and play a key role in supporting the company\u2019s rapid growth.<br \/><br \/>You will be joining an expanding team in one of Europe's most valuable fintechs. Our mission is to be a legal team that exceeds expectations across the board, providing pragmatic and commercially focused advice, finding creative solutions to manage risk and becoming trusted advisers to our colleagues in the business.<br \/><br \/><strong>How You'll Make An Impact  <\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is based in London at our global head office and sits within the regulatory vertical of our Legal department<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support relationships with regulators on license-related matters, including potential de novo applications<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review payments product structures, flows and terms to ensure compliance with legal requirements<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advise on payments regulatory matters, including compliance with payments laws and related regulations across our different jurisdictions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advise on broader regulatory requirements applicable to payment services providers, including with respect to group regulatory change projects<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advise the business on market expansion, researching and evaluating new territories and applying for new licenses or expanding the scope of existing licenses<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advise key business functions on new regulatory developments impacting our operations, products and contractual commitments<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct research on various multi-jurisdictional legal issues<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support the company\u2019s strategic projects and initiatives by providing creative, proactive and results-orientated advice  <\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What We Are Looking For  <\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Qualified solicitor\/lawyer (3-7 PQE) with strong post-qualification experience either in-house or in private practice<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong understanding of legal principles applicable to payments in the UK, including the payments ecosystem and payments regulatory and licensing strategy\/execution, and to broader financial institutions<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Previous FinTech, payments, software, e-commerce and\/or bank experience is desirable but not essential<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working in a start up or other fast-paced and dynamic environment is desirable but not essential<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfort with ambiguity, constant change, and a fast-paced culture<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A practical, solutions-oriented focus to solving legal challenges<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working internationally and on a variety of cross-border matters<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent time management skills and experience managing a diverse workload and competing stakeholder demands<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to work autonomously and collaboratively as needed, flexing the approach as the matter requires<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong communication skills and the ability to articulate and explain complex legal issues clearly and concisely<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Enthusiasm for new challenges and skilling up in different areas of law<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/legal-counsel-product-regulatory-london-369183","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-cloud-security-engineer-london-324849","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Cloud Security Engineer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>The role<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will evolve <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>'s security posture across our multi-cloud environments and SIEM platform. This role sits at the intersection of cloud security engineering and detection capability \u2014 responsible for both hardening the infrastructure we operate on and ensuring we can see what's happening across it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will lead security integration projects, guide cloud engineering teams, and drive continuous improvement across monitoring and detection, including applying AI to accelerate security operations.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is not a tool-monitoring role. You are here to architect secure cloud environments, build and enhance detection logic at scale, and drive measurable improvements to our security baseline across AWS, Azure, and GCP.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will partner closely with Engineering, GRC, Technology Risk and Security Operations - defining standards, fine tuning the SIEM, and progressively taking on the most complex cloud security and detection engineering challenges across the organisation.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><h2><strong>What you\u2019ll be responsible for<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><strong>Cloud Security<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Secure and continuously improve our multi-cloud estate (AWS, Azure, GCP) using cloud native tooling to keep our cloud infrastructure hardened and compliant<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Partner with Engineering and Security Operation team to make security a natural part of how we design and deliver, automating compliance checks so security scales without friction<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Defining and enforcing cloud security architecture standards, guardrails, and policy-as-code inline with industry best practices including NIST, CIS, and PCI DSS.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Use Wiz or equivalent CNAPP\/CSPM to continuously assess, prioritise, and drive remediation of misconfigurations and vulnerabilities against CIS, NIST, and PCI DSS benchmarks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Security Monitoring<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Fine tune, and maintain modern SIEM platform (e.g. Sentinel) including KQL detection rules, workbooks, logging pipelines, and AI-assisted alert triage.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Map detection coverage against MITRE ATT&amp;CK tactics and techniques. Identify and close visibility gaps across the cloud estate.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Maintain alignment to PCI DSS, SOC2, ISO27001 NIST, and CIS frameworks. Produce documentation and evidence to support audit and assurance activities.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI Security<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design and implement guardrails for AI\/LLM systems, covering data exposure, prompt injection, and model misuse risks.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Leverage AI and automation to enhance alert investigation, enrichment, and response workflows.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Maintain technical policies and standards for the secure use of AI tools across the organisation.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>What we\u2019re looking for<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">6+ years of  hands-on experience securing AWS, Azure, and GCP environments, including Azure Policy, IAM, Infrastructure-as-code (IAC) security or other cloud native tooling.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with security tools: Microsoft Sentinel, SentinelOne, NetSkope, Flashpoint, Wiz or similar tooling.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong Microsoft Sentinel expertise: KQL, detection rules, workbooks, and logging pipelines.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Working knowledge of DLP and threat intelligence monitoring.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience applying AI\/ML to security workflows - automated triage, behavioural analytics, or LLM-assisted investigation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understanding of AI security risks and frameworks: OWASP LLM Top 10, NIST AI RMF.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Scripting proficiency in Python, PowerShell, or Bash for security automation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong grasp of PCI DSS, NIST CSF, SOC 2, ISO27001, CIS Benchmarks, and MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Cloud.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2><strong>Nice to have<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">AZ-500, AWS Certified Security \u2013 Specialty, or equivalent cloud security certification.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience integrating ATT&amp;CK Navigator into SOC workflows.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-cloud-security-engineer-london-324849","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-detection-threat-engineer-london-231045","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Detection & Threat Engineer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will own and evolve the company\u2019s threat detection and threat-hunting capability. This role defines <em>what \u201cgood\u201d looks like<\/em> for detection and increasingly engineers it directly as capability shifts into Cyber Security.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is not an alert-triage role. You are here to understand attacker behaviour, convert it into high-fidelity detection logic, and raise the security baseline for the entire organisation.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will partner closely with Security Operations, GRC  and Engineering\u2014setting standards, direction, and expectations\u2014while progressively taking ownership of the most complex and high-value detection and threat engineering work.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What you\u2019ll be responsible for<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Engineering high-fidelity threat detections across endpoint, identity, cloud, and SaaS<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Defining detection standards, principles, and quality thresholds for Security Operations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conducting proactive threat hunting based on attacker behaviour, not vendor alerts<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Translating threat intelligence and incident learnings into durable, reusable detections<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Mapping detections to MITRE ATT&amp;CK and real-world attack paths<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Reducing alert fatigue through logic refinement, correlation, and contextual enrichment<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advising and supporting during high-severity security incidents; contribute to runbooks and escalation playbooks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Driving the transition of advanced detection capability into Cyber Security ownership<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What we\u2019re looking for<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven experience in detection engineering, threat hunting, or advanced SOC roles<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep understanding of modern attacker tradecraft and intrusion techniques across the attack lifecycle<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on experience buidling detection logic in modern SIEM platforms (e.g Sentinel)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficienty with scripting and programmaining (e.g. Python, KQL) to build detection pipelines and automation<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Willingness to challenge bad detections, weak assumptions, and vanity metrics<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Pragmatic mindset: precision and impact beat coverage theatre<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience operating beyond traditional SOC or MSSP models<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on cloud detection experience (identity, control plane, SaaS)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with threat intelligence platforms and frameworks such as PCI DSS, NIST CSF, SOC 2, ISO27001, CIS Benchmarks, and MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Cloud.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-detection-threat-engineer-london-231045","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"cyber-security-engineer-london-142826","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Cyber Security Engineer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h3><strong>The role<\/strong><\/h3><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role will be responsible for supporting design &amp; implementation of AI-enabled capabilities across Checkout, while ensuring AI technologies are deployed in a safe, governed, and resilient manner. The successful candidate will work closely with Engineering, Data Governance, GRC, and business teams to embed security into AI systems, assess AI-related risks, and help the organisation adopt AI securely at scale.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As a Cyber Security Engineer I, you will act as the bridge between cyber security and emerging AI technologies. You will help shape how Checkout secures AI tools, models, data pipelines, and supporting infrastructure, while also identifying opportunities to use AI to strengthen cyber defence capabilities.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a hands-on role suited to someone who understands modern security engineering and has a strong interest in AI\/ML technologies, LLMs, automation, and risk management.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><h3><strong>What you\u2019ll be responsible for<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design and implement security controls for AI and machine learning solutions, including LLM-based applications, model integrations, and supporting cloud infrastructure.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Assess the security, privacy, and compliance risks associated with AI systems, including model misuse, prompt injection, data leakage, insecure plugins, over-permissioned access, and third-party AI services.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Develop standards, guardrails, and reference architectures for the secure use of AI across the organisation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Review AI use cases, architectures, and deployments to ensure alignment with cyber security policies, regulatory requirements, and internal governance expectations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build and maintain monitoring, detection, and response capabilities for AI-related threats and misuse scenarios.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identify opportunities to use AI to enhance cyber security operations, such as alert triage, threat analysis, playbook automation, knowledge retrieval, and workflow optimisation.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Stay current on evolving risks, attack techniques, regulations, and industry practices related to AI security and AI governance (inline with EU AI Act, ISO42001)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><h3><strong>What we\u2019re looking for<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in cyber security engineering, security architecture, or a related security role.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong understanding of core security domains such as identity and access management, cloud security, application security, data protection, logging and monitoring, and incident response.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Knowledge of AI\/ML and LLM concepts, including model deployment patterns, APIs, embeddings, vector stores, prompt handling, and common AI security risks.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience securing cloud environments and modern development workflows in platforms such as AWS, Azure, or GCP.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with security risks relevant to AI systems, including prompt injection, data exfiltration, insecure model access, supply chain risks, model poisoning, and sensitive data exposure.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience conducting architecture reviews, threat modelling, and security assessments for complex technical solutions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to translate technical risk into clear, practical guidance for both engineering and non-technical stakeholders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong collaboration skills and the ability to work across cyber security, engineering, data, legal, and business teams.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A proactive mindset, with the ability to operate in a fast-moving area where standards and best practices continue to evolve.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/cyber-security-engineer-london-142826","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-security-incident-response-engineer-london-427112","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Security Incident Response Engineer","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>The role<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role exists to ensure security incidents are rare, contained, and unsurprising.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will own the technical direction of security incident response and response readiness across the company. When a serious incident occurs, you lead from the front \u2014 investigating, containing, and driving resolution with calm authority. When incidents are not happening, you are actively eliminating the conditions that would cause the next one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is not a role for someone who waits for alerts. It is for someone who constantly asks <em>\u201cwhat will break next, and why?\u201d<\/em> \u2014 and then fixes that problem before an attacker finds it.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will operate across endpoint, identity, cloud, and SaaS environments, working closely with Security Operations, IT, and Engineering to reduce real risk, not theoretical risk.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><h2><strong>What you\u2019ll be responsible for<\/strong><br \/><\/h2><h3><strong>Incident Response &amp; Technical Leadership<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Leading the end-to-end technical response to high-severity security incidents<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Owning investigation, containment, eradication, and recovery activities<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Acting as the senior technical authority during live incidents<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Providing clear, decisive guidance to Security Operations under pressure<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Coordinating response across endpoint, identity, cloud, and SaaS platforms<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Supplying executives, legal, and risk stakeholders with accurate technical context and impact assessments<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensuring incidents are driven to resolution, not just stabilised<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Response Readiness &amp; Proactive Risk Reduction<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Designing, maintaining, and continuously improving incident response playbooks and runbooks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identifying systemic weaknesses that increase incident likelihood or blast radius, including:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Unpatched or inconsistently patched systems<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposed services and misconfigurations<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Degraded or ineffective controls<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Using SIEM and security tooling to prioritise patching and vulnerability risk based on real exposure and exploitability, not CVSS scores alone<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Partnering with IT, Cloud, and Engineering teams to drive remediation based on business risk<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Tracking remediation through to completion and validating effectiveness post-fix<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Learning, Detection, and Maturity<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Turning incidents, near-misses, and exposure findings into:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Improved detections<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Stronger preventative controls<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Faster and less disruptive response<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Driving readiness through simulations, tabletop exercises, and scenario testing<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Raising the overall maturity of the Cyber Security function by pushing advanced response and exposure management practices into BAU operations<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><h2><strong>What we\u2019re looking for<\/strong><\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven, hands-on experience leading response to real security incidents<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong investigation capability across endpoint, identity, and cloud environments<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demonstrated experience prioritising vulnerability or patching risk in large, complex estates<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to remain decisive and effective during incidents, and analytical between them<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Clear communicator who can influence outcomes without needing direct ownership of every fix<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Pragmatic mindset: reduce risk first, optimise later<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">DFIR, forensics, or malware analysis experience<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proven ability to correlate vulnerability data with runtime telemetry and attacker behaviour to drive actionable risk reduction<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Cloud-first incident response or exposure management experience<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposure to compliance-driven security requirements<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working alongside vulnerability scanning platforms without being constrained by them<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-security-incident-response-engineer-london-427112","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"engineer-i-workplace-technology-london-383982","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Engineer I, Workplace Technology","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>The Role<\/h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are looking for a seasoned <strong>IT Engineer II<\/strong> to join our Engineering team. At this level, you have developed your skill set to confidently tackle all but the most complex problems affecting the team. You will lead the delivery of essential IT services and small to medium-sized projects, either independently or by guiding other engineers.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As an Engineer II, you are an individual contributor with a deep understanding of your team\u2019s purpose and how it impacts Checkout as a whole. You will act as an owner-operator, taking accountability for the success of the systems within your area of responsibility.<\/p><h2>How You\u2019ll Make an Impact<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Project Leadership:<\/strong> Independently design and deliver project-level work with minimal guidance from senior engineers.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Atlassian Mastery:<\/strong> Act as a subject matter expert for our Workplace Technology stack, with a specific focus on high-level administration and optimisation of <strong>Jira<\/strong> and <strong>Confluence<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Endpoint &amp; Infrastructure:<\/strong> Provide advanced technical support and policy management for macOS and Windows endpoints using <strong>Jamf<\/strong> and <strong>Microsoft Intune<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Operational Excellence:<\/strong> Provide an advanced level of operational support on team-owned services and train new members on service design, security, and operations.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Incident Response:<\/strong> Display urgency and accountability during incidents, triaging and supporting complex flows unaided.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Mentorship:<\/strong> Regularly support and mentor less experienced engineers, helping to raise the technical quality of the team.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Automation:<\/strong> Proactively recognise areas for improvement and suggest automated solutions (Python\/PowerShell) to reduce incidental complexity.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>What We\u2019re Looking For<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Experience:<\/strong> Typically 2\u20133+ years of experience in an IT Engineering or similar technical role.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Technical Expertise:<\/strong> Experience with <strong>Identity Providers<\/strong> (Okta, Azure AD) and protocols like <strong>SAML<\/strong> and <strong>SCIM<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Advanced Atlassian Skills:<\/strong> High-level experience managing the Atlassian suite. You should be comfortable with complex Jira configurations, workflow customisations, and permission schemes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Problem Solving:<\/strong> A logical approach to troubleshooting, with the ability to articulate technical trade-offs between different solutions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Ownership:<\/strong> A proactive \"owner-operator\" mindset\u2014you take responsibility for your tasks and the long-term health of the systems you manage.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Communication:<\/strong> Ability to communicate effectively with company stakeholders and resolve complex support queries within your area of focus.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Adaptability:<\/strong> Comfortable working in a fast-paced environment where you can balance temporary workarounds with flexible, long-term architectural solutions.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/engineer-i-workplace-technology-london-383982","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-specialist-account-management-london-64687","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Specialist, Account Management","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong><u>The Mission:<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We are seeking a visionary and results-oriented Senior Specialist, Account Management to nurture and maintain long-term relationships with our most strategic Enterprise accounts within the United Kingdom.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will be the business advisor and main point of contact to some of our most important accounts. You will act as the voice of our product and ambassador of our brand, delivering expertise, education, and mentorship to our merchants. The key for success here will be the ability to use your business savvy knowledge and the required gravitas to effectively communicate and influence at all levels to achieve mutually beneficial scenarios and promote our value proposition. <\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The ideal candidate is an independent, high-achieving individual, able to stand out in an ambitious environment and excel through self-motivation and personal drive. If you are eager to join a thriving, fast-paced environment this is the role for you to make a difference. <\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong><u>How you\u2019ll make an impact<\/u> <\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Grow a portfolio of existing enterprise merchants by identifying expansion opportunities, cross\/upselling Checkout\u2019s value add services, performance improvements, and other levers to increase our share of wallet.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Crafting and executing on merchant specific account development plans, outlining clear opportunities for growth and paths to success. <\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Building high touch, consultative, and nurturing relationships with our merchants through regular and open communications, both face-to-face and virtual.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Delivering expertise, education, and guidance to merchants. Act as their payment consultant as they craft and complete a comprehensive, global payments strategy. <\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Negotiate win-win pricing structures by growing a thorough overview of a merchant's revenue drivers to deliver the best, sustainable outcomes for both merchant and Checkout.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Tracking merchant project deliverables and ensure merchant activities are updated within SalesForce, Clari, and other CRM tools.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Understanding the intricacies of our products, services and partner networks thoroughly to leverage this against our merchants\u2019 growing needs.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Collaborating with various teams (e.g. Sales, Legal, Integration, Support) across the company to ensure an outstanding merchant experience and bring the voice of the customer to our internal stakeholders.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Data-based decision making - not afraid of diving into numbers to ensure merchants have confidence in our ability to provide meaningful and metric-driven insights. <\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Drive a culture of cross-team learning through active knowledge sharing whilst contributing to improving ways of working, impacting not just \u2018what\u2019 we do but \u2018how\u2019 we do it. <\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong><u>Qualifications<\/u> <\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Experience: 3+ years\u2019 commercial experience in a B2B Account Management or Relationship Management role in the FinTech and\/or Payments industry.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Commercial Acumen: Proven track record of driving and exceeding revenue targets and managing strategic account portfolios. Experience in negotiating and pricing strategy deals specific to the UK market.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Payments Knowledge: Good knowledge of today\u2019s major e-commerce and payments, technologies, players and major future trends.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">- Customer Obsession: Customer driven and able to establish a robust relationship with assigned customer base.<br \/>- Multifaceted approach adapting to changing requirements with the ability to balance multiple opportunities concurrently.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-specialist-account-management-london-64687","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"manager-procurement-london-141035","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Manager, Procurement","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">There has never been a more exciting time to join Procurement at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> . We are currently on an ambitious journey of transformation, evolving from a traditional function into a tech-forward, strategic powerhouse.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We have recently rolled out a cutting-edge P2P platform (Zip), are scaling a new Center of Excellence (CoE) in Mauritius, and are aggressively investing in AI and advanced tooling to realise our Vision 2030. This isn't just about managing spend; it\u2019s about redefining how a global fintech operates.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As the Global Category Manager for People &amp; Corporate Services, you will own the strategy for the essential services that power our global operations. Beyond category-specific expertise, you will be a core contributor to our wider transformation program\u2014acting as a pioneer in rolling out and testing AI Agents, optimising workflows, and driving data transformation.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Develop and lead a multi-year global strategy for a diverse portfolio, including Marketing, Legal, Audit and other Corporate Services stakeholders<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Act as a strategic advisor to the Head of Audit, General Counsel and Chief Marketing Officer teams, ensuring procurement initiatives are seamlessly aligned with our global talent and operational footprint.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Play a hands-on role in our transformation roadmap. You will participate in the deployment of AI Agents, pilot new procurement technologies, and help shape a data-driven operating model.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate with our new offshore CoE to streamline tactical execution, allowing you to focus on high-value strategic partnerships and complex problem-solving.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design and manage Tier-1 global partnership programs, moving beyond cost-savings to focus on service excellence, innovation, and scalability.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Integrate Third-Party Risk Management (TPRM) into the heart of the corporate services lifecycle, ensuring our growth is both fast and resilient.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About You<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You have deep experience, contract and commercial skills in Professional Services-related procurement, Marketing, Audit, Legal, Advisory, Consulting, Tax<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You are energised by transformation. You don\u2019t just use tools; you want to test AI, automate workflows, and find better ways to work.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You have a proven track record of delivering complex, multi-million-pound negotiations and building long-term vendor ecosystems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You are comfortable navigating a high-growth environment and enjoy mentoring junior talent within the local team and the CoE.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You\u2019re tech-savvy and data-oriented. Experience with modern P2P stacks (experience with Zip is a major plus) is highly valued.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">8+ years in Procurement\/Strategic Sourcing, with a significant focus on People\/Corporate Services categories.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience working within a procurement transformation program or a high-growth tech environment is essential.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">MCIPS\/FCIPS preferred, or equivalent practical experience.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exceptional negotiation, a \"digital-first\" approach to problem solving, and the ability to influence at the COO and Executive level.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/manager-procurement-london-141035","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"product-manager-vault-forward-api-london-448608","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Product Manager, Vault & Forward API","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>'s vision on becoming the system of record for payment credentials, independent of acquiring. The Vault holds billions of stored instruments; the Forward API is how they reach any endpoint - and the forward-first connector backbone of our orchestration platform, reaching any processor without their cooperation. <\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Product, infrastructure, and commercial ownership in one role, including pricing - scope almost no PSP gives its PMs.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Network tokens and account updater sit with a partner team - one credential story, run on a shared scorecard (credential freshness, network-token penetration, auth uplift).<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>You'll own<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Vault:<\/strong> core primitives (instruments, tokens, metadata), PCI DSS posture, and standalone Vault for merchants who don't process with us<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Forward API:<\/strong> credential forwarding end to end - expand beyond PSP fallback into fraud tools, 3DS, loyalty, and migrations, with reliability and latency SLAs on the critical payment path<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Portability and migration:<\/strong> contractual token export as a sellable feature - our answer to lock-in in enterprise RFPs - and import tooling at scale to win credentials from other vaults<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Commercial:<\/strong> pricing, packaging, billing, and the metrics that matter - instruments stored, standalone adoption, forward volume, credential revenue<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>GTM:<\/strong> positioning and sales enablement, including when to sell Forward API vs orchestration<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2>You'll bring<\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">5+ years in product, 3+ in payments - and you've built or owned a payment vault, tokenization platform, network token service, or card-on-file infrastructure<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep tokenisation and PCI DSS knowledge; fluent with developer-facing APIs<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Commercial ownership experience: pricing, P&amp;L inputs, a number you were accountable for<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h2><strong>Bonus:<\/strong> <\/h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Token portability\/migration programmes<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Regulated markets <\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Agentic commerce<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/product-manager-vault-forward-api-london-448608","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"senior-manager-technical-accounting-london-356646","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Senior Manager, Technical Accounting","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As we continue to improve the pace and breadth of our reporting, we are looking for a highly experienced accounting professional to join our team as we build the Finance function of the future.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Reporting to the Director of Group Reporting, the successful candidate will provide accounting advice under IFRS globally across all functions. The role will be responsible for the preparation and review of internal accounting policy guidance, liaising with external auditors, the preparation of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><u>Checkout.com<\/u><\/a>\u2019s Group financial statements, global share-based payments expense and communicating accounting outcomes and requirements to senior stakeholders.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">The ideal candidate will thrive in a dynamic, fast-paced environment, possess strong technical skills, have meticulous attention to detail, always act with integrity and demonstrate the range of expertise required to produce high quality financial information.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide accounting advice on a range of IFRS topics including revenue recognition, financial instruments, software capitalisation, leases and impairment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As the lead of the Technical Accounting team you will provide oversight on the calculation of complex global accounting topics.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead the determination of group accounting policies and the development and maintenance of internal guidance manuals, including running the accounting decisions for new products and geographic expansion.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead the assessment and implementation of new and amended accounting standards.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Communicate with senior internal stakeholders, including the Executive team, and lead complex accounting discussions with external auditors and internally with functions such as Treasury, Tax and legal entity financial controllers.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Assist financial controllers with financial statement preparation and local GAAP advice as necessary, including disclosure requirements and completeness.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead efforts to continuously improve our technical accounting processes and consider best practice.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Qualifications:<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Professionally qualified accountant (CA \/ ACA \/ ACCA or equivalent) with 8 years post-qualification experience.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Financial services experience<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">In-depth knowledge of international accounting standards, in particular IFRS 15, IFRS 9 and IFRS 2.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in leading a team.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exceptional written and communication skills, in particular the production of accounting analysis memos and simplifying complex accounting concepts for non-accountant senior stakeholders.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience in the preparation, review or audit of financial statements prepared under IFRS, including complex disclosure notes.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience of accounting within an international environment and communication with external auditors.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience of US GAAP is desirable but not essential.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/senior-manager-technical-accounting-london-356646","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"manager-payroll-london-189432","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Manager, Payroll","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is one of the most exciting fintechs in the world. Our mission is to enable businesses and their communities to thrive in the digital economy. We\u2019re the strategic payments partner for some of the best known fast-moving brands globally such as Wise, Hut Group, Sony Electronics, Homebase, Henkel, Klarna and many others. Purpose-built with performance and scalability in mind, our flexible cloud-based payments platform helps global enterprises launch new products and create experiences customers love. And it's not just what we build that makes us different. It's how.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We empower passionate problem-solvers to collaborate, innovate and do their best work. That\u2019s why we\u2019re on the Forbes Cloud 100 list and a Great Place to Work accredited company. And we\u2019re just getting started. We\u2019re building diverse and inclusive teams around the world \u2014 because that\u2019s how we create even better experiences for our merchants and our partners. And we need your help. Join us to build the digital economy of tomorrow.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Payroll Manager at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> is seeking a Payroll Manager to take ownership of our global payroll operations. Reporting to the Group Financial Controller, the ideal candidate will be responsible for managing the end-to-end payroll delivery for key regions. You will act as a strategic partner to Finance and People teams with a deep focus on scalability, efficiency, and the employee experience.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role goes beyond day-to-day processing; you will lead a high-performing global team of five and manage the payroll setup to support approximately 2,400 employees across 24+ countries. You will also spearhead a comprehensive transformation project to consolidate 14+ regional payroll vendors under a single global provider. We're looking for a strategic leader who thrives in a challenging, fast-paced, and high-growth environment.<\/p><h3><strong>How you\u2019ll make an impact<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Spearhead a comprehensive transformation project to consolidate 14+ regional payroll vendors under a single global provider, establishing the target operating model needed to support <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a> as it continues to scale.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Drive the integration of HRIS data flows into the global payroll system to achieve end-to-end automation, increasing operational efficiency and improving the control environment to public company equivalents.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Act as the primary owner for payroll-related data in systems like Workday and Cloudpay.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Lead and mentor a high-performing global team of five, taking responsibility for talent acquisition, personalised coaching, and designing tailored growth plans to ensure long-term career development.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Orchestrate highly complex payroll events, including shadow payroll, tax equalisation for secondments, and the processing and reporting of share-based compensation with the support of the equity and tax teams.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Manage comprehensive payroll and employment tax audits from regulatory authorities, maintaining robust compliance and audit controls across 24+ jurisdictions and ensuring zero-defect compliance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Take full ownership of monthly payroll delivery for employees across all regions, reviewing and verifying payroll changes and outputs with providers to ensure 100% accuracy before final approval.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Support key payroll cycles, including year-end tasks, annual salary reviews, and the processing of bonuses and commissions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure that General Ledger postings accurately reflect monthly payroll and maintain robust balance sheet substantiation across all payroll-related accounts.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide timely audit support to the Finance team for payroll-related reporting, reconciliation, and audit queries.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proactively research and stay up to date with changes in payroll legislation, international accounting standards, and financial regulations.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3><strong>What we\u2019re looking for<\/strong><\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Over a decade of experience driving excellence in a high-growth environment, alongside experience managing equity-related tax withholdings across multiple tax jurisdictions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A proven track record of managing end-to-end international payroll processes, ideally within the fast-paced tech or fintech industry where a high volume of change is the norm.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">CIPP certification (or equivalent certified payroll professional status).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deep technical expertise in Workday, Global Mobility, Shadow Payroll, Tax Equalisation, and Share-Based Compensation. Experience with Cloudpay is a significant advantage.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">An expert problem-solver with a strong track record of consolidating fragmented regional processes into unified global models.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Someone who enjoys working at pace and has a genuine drive to continuously improve processes and systems.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\">Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/manager-payroll-london-189432","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"ai-automation-specialist-london-477750","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"AI & Automation Specialist","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>'s Process Architecture pillar designs how operations should work. This role builds what that looks like in practice.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You'll use modern AI-assisted development tools, Cursor, Claude Code, n8n, and LLM APIs, to rapidly prototype and ship internal tools that eliminate manual effort across our operational teams. Your primary customers are Disputes, Due Diligence, and Transaction Monitoring: high-volume, high-stakes teams where the right automation meaningfully reduces analyst burden and improves decision quality.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You'll move fast. You'll take processes that currently live in spreadsheets and manual case queues and turn them into something that mostly runs itself. Process Architects redesign how work flows; you make the new flow real.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What You'll Do<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Use AI-assisted development (Cursor, Claude Code) to prototype and ship tools for operational teams - fast.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Build workflow automations that connect case management systems, document stores, APIs, and LLMs into end-to-end pipelines<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Create analyst-facing interfaces, triage tools, summary generators using self-built applications, Retool, or similar.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Apply LLMs where they reduce cognitive load: classification, case summarisation, structured extraction, decision support.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Embed with Disputes, CDD, Periodic Review, and Transaction Monitoring to learn how analysts actually work - not how the process doc says they do.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Translate vague pain points i.e \"this part takes forever\" into shipped tools in days or weeks, not quarters.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Demo early, iterate based on what analysts actually use versus ignore.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Treat every tool as a product: instrument usage, capture feedback, measure time saved or quality gained.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Document what you build and share reusable patterns so good ideas compound.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What We're Looking For<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We care more about what you've built and how you think than years of experience or formal credentials.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Must-haves<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You've used Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot, or similar to build something real,  a script, a tool, a side project, that solved an actual problem. Not just tutorials<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Comfortable in Python, or willing to be within weeks.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Basic API fluency: you can read a doc, make a request, parse the response, and chain a few calls<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with at least one LLM API. You've written a prompt, gotten structured output back, and understood why it sometimes goes wrong<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Bias to ship - you'd rather get a rough version in front of users on Friday than a polished version in three weeks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curiosity. You're the kind of person who opens the hood - you want to understand how things work, not just use them<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Nice-to-haves<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Workflow automation tools (Zapier, n8n, Make)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Retool, Gradio, or similar lightweight UI frameworks<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Git, basic SQL, or comfort with JSON\/CSV at scale<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exposure to payments, fraud, compliance, or risk operations - even tangentially<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A portfolio, GitHub, or demo you can walk us through<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/ai-automation-specialist-london-477750","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"manager-policy-governance-fincrime-compliance-london-289320","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Manager, Policy & Governance (FinCrime Compliance)","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h3>Job Description <br \/>Hybrid role with 3 days a week in the London Office <br \/><br \/>As Checkout scale globally, we are looking for a Financial Crime Compliance SME with experience designing, owning and implementing Policy for Anti-Bribery &amp; Corruption. It's an opportunity to own an area of our compliance function and make an impact from day one. <br \/><br \/>Sitting in our Compliance function, this person will have an opportunity to lead the ABC policy globally. <br \/><br \/><\/h3><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>1. Policy &amp; Governance Framework<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Global Ownership: Design, implement, and maintain the Global Financial Crime Policy for Anti-Bribery &amp; Corruption, ensuring alignment with local regulations in all operating jurisdictions.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Regulatory Horizon Scanning: Monitor global regulatory shifts and translate complex legal requirements into actionable internal standards.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Governance Reporting: Prepare high-quality governance reports and MI for the Board and Senior Management, highlighting emerging risks and policy effectiveness.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>2. ABC Specialization (Anti-Bribery &amp; Corruption)<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">ABC Framework Management: Lead the development and enforcement of the Global ABC Policy, specifically targeting high-risk areas such as Incentives and Marketing Joint Ventures.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Gifts, Entertainment &amp; Hospitality (GEH): Own the global GEH register. You will define the thresholds, manage the approval workflow, and perform periodic audits to ensure compliance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Third-Party Risk: Work closely with Procurement to ensure robust ABC due diligence is performed on vendors, partners, and joint venture participants.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Advisory: Act as the primary point of contact for the business on complex ABC queries, providing pragmatic advice that balances commercial goals with regulatory safety.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>3. Risk Assessment &amp; Training<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">EWRA Support: Contribute to the Enterprise-Wide Risk Assessment (EWRA) by identifying specific vulnerabilities related to anti-bribery and corruption and policy gaps.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Culture of Compliance: Develop and deliver specialized training sessions for high-risk departments (Sales, Marketing, Partnerships) regarding bribery risks and proper disclosure protocols.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><h3>About You<\/h3><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience: 5+ years in Financial Crime Compliance, specifically within a Policy, Governance, or ABC-focused role (FinTech or Payments experience is a major plus).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Technical Knowledge: Deep understanding of the UK Bribery Act, US FCPA, and global AML\/Sanctions standards (FATF).<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Operational Mindset: You don\u2019t just write policies; you know how to build the <em>process<\/em> (e.g., automated registers, clear approval hierarchies) that makes compliance seamless.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Communication: Exceptional drafting skills. You can explain complex regulatory concepts to a non-compliance audience without losing the nuance.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Integrity: Unwavering ethical standards and the confidence to provide \"challenge\" to senior stakeholders when necessary.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/manager-policy-governance-fincrime-compliance-london-289320","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910},{"slug":"data-analytics-engineer-i-london-20275","company_name":"Checkout.com","title":"Data Analytics Engineer I","description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>Company Description<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We\u2019re<\/em><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http:\/\/checkout.com\"><em> <\/em><\/a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><em>Checkout.com<\/em><\/a><em>. You might not know our name, but companies like eBay, Spotify, Klarna, Uber, and Sony do, because we\u2019re behind many of the digital experiences you use every day. <\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><br \/><em>We are where the world checks out, enabling over 10 billion transactions yearly for more than one billion global shoppers. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>Whether you want to book a holiday, order food, renew a subscription, or check out online, there\u2019s a good chance our tech powers the payments behind the scenes. Our platform helps the most ambitious businesses deliver effortless digital experiences, at scale. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>If you want to do career-defining work, you\u2019ve come to the right place. We move fast, think globally, and believe great teams are built by hiring exceptional people with conviction, curiosity, and the desire to make an impact. <\/em><br \/><br \/><em>With 20 offices across six continents and London as our HQ, we\u2019re shaping the future of fintech \u2013 and we\u2019re just getting started.<\/em><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You will be joining the Financial Infrastructure team, responsible for building and maintaining the core systems powering our internal financial ecosystem. Every year, we process hundreds of billions of events that have a financial impact on Checkout.com and our merchants. Our team is responsible for maintaining an accurate record of all financial data, the data integrity of our systems and ensuring our infrastructure meets regulatory and compliance obligations in a scalable, reliable and fault-tolerant manner.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">As an Analytics Engineer, you will play a pivotal role in our mission to make our financial data capabilities world-class. You will work closely with our Finance and Treasury teams to translate their requirements into robust and intuitive data models. You will design and build the data pipelines necessary to process and transform large amounts of data that our systems generate. You will be responsible for ensuring the accuracy and reliability of these data pipelines, as Checkout continues to scale as a business. You will have ownership over these processes, allowing you to take charge in maintaining a high standard of data quality.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>How You\u2019ll Make An Impact<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design and build data pipelines to process data from our systems, services and applications.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Implement monitoring and alerting frameworks to ensure data pipeline performance and reliability.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Partner with other analytics engineers to design and implement scalable data models that support downstream business operations and analytical queries.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ensure data governance and security standards are maintained across our systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Continuously evaluate and implement new technologies to improve our platform and systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborate with Finance stakeholders to translate business requirements into technical specifications and Service Level Agreements.<br \/> <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">2+ years of experience in an Analytics Engineering or Data Engineering role with a focus on large scale data transformation and data warehousing.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Excellent SQL coding skills.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with cloud-based data warehouse technologies such as Snowflake, Google BigQuery, or AWS Redshift.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with data transformation tools such as dbt, or Dataflow.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understanding of data modeling techniques.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with using visualisation platforms such as Looker, Tableau, or Apache Superset.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understanding of software engineering best practices and their application to data processing systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Knowledge of Python, Java or Flink is a plus, but not a necessity.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong attention to detail.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Ability to work autonomously in a fast-paced and dynamic environment.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong communication and interpersonal skills.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Bring all of you to work<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We create the conditions for high performers to thrive, through real ownership, fewer blockers, and work that makes a difference from day one.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Here, you\u2019ll move fast, take on meaningful challenges, and be recognized for the impact you deliver. It\u2019s a place where ambition gets met with opportunity, and where your growth is in your hands.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We work as one team, and we back each other to succeed. So whatever your background or identity, if you\u2019re ready to grow and make a difference, you\u2019ll be right at home here.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">It\u2019s important we set you up for success and make our process as accessible as possible. So let us know in your application, or tell your recruiter directly, if you need anything to make your experience or working environment more comfortable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Life at <\/strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\"><strong>Checkout.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We understand that work is just one part of your life. Our hybrid working model offers flexibility, with three days per week in the office to support collaboration and connection.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Curious about what it\u2019s like to be part of our team? Visit our<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.checkout.com\/careers\"> <u>Careers Page<\/u><\/a> to learn more about our culture, open roles, and what drives us.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">For a closer look at daily life at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/Checkout.com\">Checkout.com<\/a>, follow us on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/checkout\/life\/\"><u>LinkedIn<\/u><\/a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/checkout_com\/\"><u>Instagram<\/u><\/a><\/p><p>Find more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom<\/a> on Arbeitnow<\/a>","remote":false,"url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.co.uk\/jobs\/companies\/checkoutcom\/data-analytics-engineer-i-london-20275","tags":["All cost centres"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1785664910}],"links":{"first":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/api\/job-board-api?page=1","last":null,"prev":null,"next":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/api\/job-board-api?page=2"},"meta":{"current_page":1,"current_page_url":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/api\/job-board-api?page=1","from":1,"path":"https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/api\/job-board-api","per_page":175,"to":175,"terms":"This is a free public API for jobs, please do not abuse. I would appreciate linking back to the site. By using the API, you agree to the terms of service present on Arbeitnow.com","info":"Jobs are updated every hour and order by the `created_at` timestamp. Use `?page=` to paginate. Read more information here: https:\/\/www.arbeitnow.com\/blog\/job-board-api"}}